  <para style="h">Nọmba</para>
  <para style="toc1">Nọmba</para>
  <para style="toc2">Nọmba</para>
  <para style="toc3">Nọm</para>
  <para style="mt1">Nọmba</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="NUM 1" />
  <para style="s1">Ubadawo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 1:1" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi amaadọkkọ Moses ke atayad mbono ke Akpautatan Sainai ke akpa usen ke ayọhọ afiọñ iba ke ayọhọ isua iba ke nditọ Isrel emaekewuọñọ ke Iyib, ate: <verse eid="NUM 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 1:2" />“Wet anyịñ ibad awo ke afịd esob Isrel ke aduuk ye ke ubon ammọ, wet afịd anyịñ ideen, keedekeed. <verse eid="NUM 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 1:3" />Afo ye Erọn enie edibat afịd ideen ke Isrel akeene ekpək ammọ, mbon se ido isua edịb, me ekpoono ekan ado, ekemeke edidʌk ekọñ. <verse eid="NUM 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 1:4" />Awo keedekeed kwa aduuk; ndin mme adaiwuod keedekeed ke ekpək amọ anie adunwam fiin.<verse eid="NUM 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 1:5" />“Mme anyịñ mbon se iduunwam fiin edo ami:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="NUM 1:5" />
  <para style="li1" vid="NUM 1:5">“ke ubon Rubịn, Elisọ ayịn Sedọọ;<verse eid="NUM 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 1:6" />ke ubon Simiọn, Selumiel ayịn Surisadai;<verse eid="NUM 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 1:7" />ke ubon Yuda, Nasọn ayịn Aminadab;<verse eid="NUM 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 1:8" />ke ubon Isaka, Natandiel ayịn Suaa;<verse eid="NUM 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 1:9" />ke ubon Sebulọn, Eliab ayịn Helọn;<verse eid="NUM 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 1:10" />ake nditọ ideen Yosef:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 1:10">ake Ifrem, Elisama ayịn Amihud;</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 1:10">ake Manase, Kamaliel ayịn Pedasọ;<verse eid="NUM 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 1:11" />ake Benyamin, Abidan ayịn Kidiọni,<verse eid="NUM 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 1:12" />ake Daan, Ahiesa ayịn Amisadai;<verse eid="NUM 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 1:13" />ake Asaa, Pakiel ayịn Okran,<verse eid="NUM 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 1:14" />ake Kad, Eliasaf ayịn Dewel;<verse eid="NUM 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 1:15" />ake Naftali, Ahira ayịn Enan.”<verse eid="NUM 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 1:16" />Mbon se ekesio ke atu afịd esob Isrel, mme adadusʌñ ke mme aduuk mme eteete ammọ edo ami. Ammọ ekedo mme adaiwuod ke mme esiin Isrel.<verse eid="NUM 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 1:17" />Moses ye Erọn emaeben afịd mbon ekesaiya anyịñ, <verse eid="NUM 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 1:18" />enyʌñ enam afịd esob edisoobo ke akpa usen afiọñ ke ayọhọ afiọñ iba. Mme awo emaewet anyịñ imaan ammọ akeene mme aduuk ye ubon ammọ, ndin emaewet keedekeed anyịñ afịd ideen e-ekeyọhọke isua edịb, <verse eid="NUM 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 1:19" />kpa naña <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akenọọ Moses uyio. Ndin anye amaabat ammọ ke Akpautatan Sainai:<verse eid="NUM 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 1:20" />Se ikito ke mme ubon Rubịn, akpa ayịn awodeen Isrel:</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="NUM 1:20">Emaewet anyịñ afịd ideen e-ekeyọhọke isua edịb me ekponno ekan ado, ekekemme se edidʌk ekọñ, keedekeed, akeene ñwed ubon ye ufọk ammọ. <verse eid="NUM 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 1:21" />Ibad awo se ikito esiin Rubịn akedo tọsịn aba mme itiokeed mme ikie ition (46,500).<verse eid="NUM 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 1:22" />Mme ubon ake Simiọn:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 1:22">Emaewet mme anyịñ afịd ideen e-ekeyọhọke isua edịb me ekponno ekan ado, ekekemme se edʌk ekọñ, keedekeed, ekeene ñwed ubon ye ufọk ammọ. <verse eid="NUM 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 1:23" />Ibad awo se ikito esiin Simiọn akedo tọsịn aba mme duob mme usʌkkeed mme ikie ita (59,300).<verse eid="NUM 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 1:24" />Mme ubon Kad:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 1:24">Emaewet mme anyịñ afịd ideen e-ekeyọhọke isua edịb me ekponno ekan ado, ekekemme se edʌk ekọñ, keedekeed, ekeene ñwed ubon ye ufọk ammọ. <verse eid="NUM 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 1:25" />Ibad awo se ikito esiin Kad akedo tọsịn aba mme ition mme ikie itiokeed mme aba mme duob (45,650).<verse eid="NUM 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 1:26" />Mme ubon ake Yuda:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 1:26">Emaewet mme anyịñ afịd ideen e-ekeyọhọke isua edịb me ekponno ekan ado, ekekemme se edʌk ekọñ, keedekeed, ekeene ñwed ubon ye ufọk ammọ. <verse eid="NUM 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 1:27" />Ibad awo se ikito esiin Yuda akedo tọsịn ata mme duob mme inaañ mme ikie itiokeed (74,600).<verse eid="NUM 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 1:28" />Mme ubon Isaka:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 1:28">Emaewet mme anyịñ afịd ideen e-ekeyọhọke isua edịb me ekpono ekan ado, ekekemme se edʌk ekọñ, keedekeed, ekeene ñwed ubon ye ufọk ammọ. <verse eid="NUM 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 1:29" />Ibad awo se ikito esiin Isaka akedo tọsịn aba mme duob mme inaañ mme ikie inaañ (54,400).<verse eid="NUM 1:29" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 1:30" />Mme ubon ake Sebulọn:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 1:30">Emaewet mme anyịñ afịd ideen e-ekeyọhọke isua edịb me ekponno ekan ado, ekekemme se edʌk ekọñ, keedekeed, ekeene ñwed ubon ye ufọk ammọ. <verse eid="NUM 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 1:31" />Ibad awo se ikito esiin Sebulọn akedo tọsịn aba mme duob mme itiaba mme ikie inaañ (57,400).<verse eid="NUM 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 1:32" />Mme nditọ ideen Yosef: Se ito ke ubon Ifrem:</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="NUM 1:32">Emaewet mme anyịñ afịd ideen e-ekeyọhọke isua edịb me ekponno ekan ado, ekekemme se edʌk ekọñ, keedekeed, ekeene ñwed ubon ye ufọk ammọ. <verse eid="NUM 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 1:33" />Ibad awo se ikito esiin Ifrem akedo tọsịn aba mme ikie ition (40,500).<verse eid="NUM 1:33" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 1:34" />Mme ubon ake Manase:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 1:34">Emaewet mme anyịñ afịd ideen e-ekeyọhọke isua edịb me ekponno ekan ado, ekekemme se edʌk ekọñ, keedekeed, ekeene ñwed ubon ye ufọk ammọ. <verse eid="NUM 1:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 1:35" />Ibad awo se ikito esiin Manase akedo tọsịn edịb mme duob mme iba mme ikie iba (32,200).<verse eid="NUM 1:35" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 1:36" />Mme ubon ake Benyamin:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 1:36">Emaewet mme anyịñ afịd ideen e-ekeyọhọke isua edịb me ekponno ekan ado, ekekemme se edʌk ekọñ, keedekeed, ekeene ñwed ubon ye ufọk ammọ. <verse eid="NUM 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 1:37" />Ibad awo se ikito esiin Benyamin akedo tọsịn edịb mme duob mme ition mme ikie inaañ (35,400).<verse eid="NUM 1:37" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 1:38" />Mme ubon ake Daan ekedo:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 1:38">Emaewet mme anyịñ afịd ideen e-ekeyọhọke isua edịb me ekponno ekan ado, ekekemme se edʌk ekọñ, keedekeed, ekeene ñwed ubon ye ufọk ammọ. <verse eid="NUM 1:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 1:39" />Ibad awo se ikito esiin Daan akedo tọsịn ata mme iba ye ikie itiaba (62,700).<verse eid="NUM 1:39" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 1:40" />Mme ubon ake Asaa:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 1:40">Emaewet mme afịd anyịñ ideen e-ekeyọhọke isua edịb me ekponno ekan ado, ekekemme se edʌk ekọñ, keedekeed, ekeene ñwed ubon ye ufọk ammọ. <verse eid="NUM 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 1:41" />Ibad awo se ikito esiin Asaa akedo tọsịn aba mme keed mme ikie ition (41,500).<verse eid="NUM 1:41" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 1:42" />Mme ubon ake Naftali:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 1:42">Emaewet mme anyịñ afịd ideen e-ekeyọhọke isua edịb me ekponno ekan ado, ekekemme se edʌk ekọñ, keedekeed, ekeene ñwed ubon ye ufọk ammọ. <verse eid="NUM 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 1:43" />Ibad awo se ikito esiin Naftali akedo tọsịn aba mme duob mme ita mme ikie inaañ (53,400).<verse eid="NUM 1:43" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 1:44" />Mbon ami edo ideen se Moses ye Erọn ye mme adadusʌñ duob mme iba ke Isrel ekebat, ammọ keedekeed ekeda ke iwuod ufọk ammọ. <verse eid="NUM 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 1:45" />Emaebat afịd ideen ke Isrel e-ekekemme isua edịb me ekponno ekan ado enyʌñ edoñño mbon se ikikem adidʌk ekọñ ke Isrel, akeene mme ubon ammọ. <verse eid="NUM 1:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 1:46" />Afịd ibad awo akedo tọsịn ikie itiokeed mme ita mme ikie ition mme aba mme duob (603,550).<verse eid="NUM 1:46" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 1:47" />Ado awo ikibatta ubon mme Lifai idian ye mme esiin mbon ñko. <verse eid="NUM 1:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 1:48" />Sia <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaadọkkọ Moses abo, <verse eid="NUM 1:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 1:49" />“Inaaha afo abat ubon Lifai me asịn ammọ ke atu ubadawo ake nditọ Isrel mbon ñko. <verse eid="NUM 1:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 1:50" />Utu ke ado, mek mbon Lifai nọ ese ñkpọ ebaña tabanakịd akebe edioomo mbed, ye afịd ñkpọ mbanaufọk ye afịd ñkpọ se inie anye. Ammọ enie edibiom tabanakịd ye afịd ñkpọ mbanaufọk amọ; ammọ enie edise ñkpọ mbaña anye enyʌñ eba ekanna anye ekʌk. <verse eid="NUM 1:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="NUM 1:51" />Mme Lifai enie edidooro akebe edioomo ke ini e-eyemme iben anye, ammọ enyʌñ enie edidiọọk anye ke emaebiisio inịm. Ana ewot awo akeedodo mfen asañake akpere akebe edioomo. <verse eid="NUM 1:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="NUM 1:52" />Nditọ Isrel enie adituak mme atayad ammọ ke ikpeghe ke ikpeghe, ammọ keedekeed ke itie nnaaekọñ ammọ naña idaha ammọ ado. <verse eid="NUM 1:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="NUM 1:53" />Ado mme Lifai enie edituak mme atayad ammọ ñkanna tabanakịd mbed edioomo ñkʌk mbaak ifiobesịd mmi adisọiyọ adoro esob nditọ Isrel. Ubiọñutom mme Lifai ado adise ñkpọ mbaña tabanakịd mbed edioomo Abasi.”<verse eid="NUM 1:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="NUM 1:54" />Nditọ Isrel emaenam afịd mme ñkpọ ami, kpa naña <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akenọọ Moses ewʌhọ.<verse eid="NUM 1:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="NUM 2" />
  <para style="s1">Ubonoñkpọ ke Mme Nnaaekọñ Akeene Aduuk</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 2:1" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Moses mme Erọn ate: <verse eid="NUM 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 2:2" />“Yak nditọ Isrel enam itie nnaa ammọ nsan-nsan ekanna atayad mbono ekʌk, ammọ keedekeed ke idak ñkpọ idiọọñọ ammọ enyʌñ ekama mme afọñidiọọñọ ufọk ete ammọ.”<verse eid="NUM 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 2:3" />Yak ikpeghe mbon Yuda enịm itie</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="NUM 2:3">nnaa ke idak ñkpọ idiọọñọ ammọ ke usakkautịn. Adadusʌñ nditọ Yuda ado Nasọn ayịn Aminadab. <verse eid="NUM 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 2:4" />Ikpeghe ubon amọ ado awo tọsịn ata mme duob mme inaañ mme ikie itiokeed (74,600).<verse eid="NUM 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 2:5" />Yak aduuk Isaka enịm itie nnaa ammọ ekpere ammọ. Adadusʌñ nditọ Isaka ado Natandiel ayịn Suaa. <verse eid="NUM 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 2:6" />Ikpeghe ubon amọ ado awo aba mme duob mme inaañ mme ikie inaañ (54,400).<verse eid="NUM 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 2:7" />Esiin Sebulọn adiido udiana. Adadusʌñ nditọ Sebulọn ado Eliab ayịn Helọn. <verse eid="NUM 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 2:8" />Ikpeghe ubon amọ ado tọsịn aba mme duob mme itiaba, mme ikie inaañ (57,400).<verse eid="NUM 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 2:9" />Afịd ideen e-enọọhọ nọ eba ke itie nnaaekọñ Yuda, akeene mme ikpeghe ubon ammọ edo awo tọsịn ikie keed mme anaañ mme itiokeed, mme ikie inaañ (186,400). Ammọ ediido akpa adito ñwuọ.<verse eid="NUM 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 2:10" />Yak mme ikpeghe ubon Rubịn ke</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="NUM 2:10">idak ñkpọ idiọọñọ ammọ eba ke usuuk. Adadusʌñ aduuk Rubịn ado Elisọ ayịn Sedọọ. <verse eid="NUM 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 2:11" />Ikpeghe ubon amọ ado tọsịn aba mme itiokeed mme ikie inaañ (46,400).<verse eid="NUM 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 2:12" />Esiin Simiọn eyaenam nnaaekọñ ediana ammọ. Adadusʌñ aduuk Simiọn ado Selumiel ayịn Surisadai. <verse eid="NUM 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 2:13" />Ibad awo ke ikpeghe ubon amọ ado tọsịn aba mme duob mme usʌkkeed mme ikie ita (59,300).<verse eid="NUM 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 2:14" />Esiin Kad eyaediana do. Adadusʌñ ke atu ubon Kad ado Eliasaf ayịn Rewel. <verse eid="NUM 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 2:15" />Ibad awo ke ikpeghe amọ ado tọsịn aba mme ition mme ikie itiokeed mme aba mme duob (45,650).<verse eid="NUM 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 2:16" />Afịd ideen se ekebat esịn ke nnaaekọñ Rubịn, akeene mme ikpeghe ubon ammọ ekedo tọsịn ikie mme aba mme duob mme keed mme ikie inaañ mme aba mme duob (151,450). Ammọ ediido ayọhọ iba adisaña ñwuọ.<verse eid="NUM 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 2:17" />Ndin atayad mbono ye anwa mbono nditọ Lifai adiiwʌhọ ke ufọọd anwa mbono. Ammọ ediisaña iwuọ ukem naña ammọ ekebono ke mme atayad, keedekeed ke mme itie ammọ ke ndaha ammọ.<verse eid="NUM 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 2:18" />Ke edem usobutịn adiido:</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="NUM 2:18">mme ikpeghe nnaaekọñ Ifrem ke ndaha ammọ. Adadusʌñ ke aduuk Ifrem ado Elisama ayịn Amihud. <verse eid="NUM 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 2:19" />Ibad awo ke ikpeghe ubon amọ ado tọsịn aba mme ikie ition (40,500).<verse eid="NUM 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 2:20" />Esiin Manase ediisaña idiana ammọ. Adadusʌñ ke aduuk Manase ado Kamaliel ayịn Pedasọ. <verse eid="NUM 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 2:21" />Ibad awo ke ikpeghe ubon amọ ado tọsịn edịb mme duob mme iba mme ikie iba (32,200).<verse eid="NUM 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 2:22" />Esiin Benyamin eyaesaña ediana do. Adadusʌñ ke aduuk Benyamin ado Abidan ayịn Kidiọni. <verse eid="NUM 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 2:23" />Ibad awo ke ikpeghe ubon amọ ado tọsịn edịb mme duob mme ition mme ikie inaañ (35,400).<verse eid="NUM 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 2:24" />Afịd ideen ekebatta esịn ke nnaaekọñ Ifrem, akeene ikpeghe ubon ammọ akedo tọsịn ikie mme itiaita mme ikie keed (108,100). Yak ammọ esaña ewuọ ke ayọhọ udịm ita.<verse eid="NUM 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 2:25" />Ikpeghe ubon nnaaekọñ Daan ediiba ke adoro ke idak ñkpọ idiọọñọ ammọ. Adadusʌñ ke atu ubon Daan ado Ahiesa ayịn Amisadai. <verse eid="NUM 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 2:26" />Ibad awo ke ikpeghe ubon amọ ado tọsịn ata mme iba mme ikie itiaba (62,700).<verse eid="NUM 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 2:27" />Esiin Asaa adiikeene Daan ke edem. Adadusʌñ ke aduuk Asaa ado Pakiel ayịn Okran. <verse eid="NUM 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 2:28" />Ibad awo ke ikpeghe ubon amọ ado tọsịn aba mme keed mme ikie ition (41,500).<verse eid="NUM 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 2:29" />Esiin Naftali eyaesaña ediana. Adadusʌñ ke aduuk Naftali ado Ahira ayịn Enan. <verse eid="NUM 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 2:30" />Ibad awo ke ikpeghe ubon amọ ado tọsịn aba mme duob mme ita mme ikie inaañ (53,400).<verse eid="NUM 2:30" /></para>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 2:31" />Afịd ideen se ekebat esịn ke nnaaekọñ Daan ekedo tọsịn ikie mme aba mme duob mme itiaba mme ikie itiokeed (157,600).<verse eid="NUM 2:31" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 2:32" />Mbon ami edo nditọ Isrel, ekebatta ekeene mme ufọk ammọ. Afịd ideen ke itie nnaaekọñ, akeene mme ikpeghe ammọ edo tọsịn ikie itiokeed mme ita mme ikie ition mme aba mme duob (603,550). <verse eid="NUM 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 2:33" />Ado awo ikibatta mme Lifai isịn ke atu nditọ Isrel mbon ñko kpa naña <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akenọọ Moses uyio.<verse eid="NUM 2:33" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 2:34" />Do ndin nditọ Isrel emaenam afịd ñkpọ ekeene naña <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akenọọ Moses uyio; naña ammọ ekenam nnaaekọñ ammọ ado ke idak mme ñkpọ idiọọñọ ammọ, naña ammọ ekenyʌñ esaña ado ado, ammọ keedekeed ye aduuk mme ubon ammọ.<verse eid="NUM 2:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="NUM 3" />
  <para style="s1">Mme Lifai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 3:1" />Anye ami ado ñwed emana ubon Erọn ye Moses ke ini <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> aketañña ikọ anọ Moses ke Abod Sainai.<verse eid="NUM 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 3:2" />Mme anyịñ nditọ ideen Erọn ekedo ami: Nadab akedo akpan, ye Abihu, Eliasa ye Itama. <verse eid="NUM 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 3:3" />Mme anyịñ nditọ ideen Erọn ekedo ado, mme aku e-emaekeyet adan, e-emaekedot ammọ ubọk adinam utom nte mme aku. <verse eid="NUM 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 3:4" />Ado Nadab ye Abihu emaekekpañña ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ke ini ammọ ekekamake ikañ i-imiidotto enam uwa ke Akpautatan Sainai. Ke ntoro, ammọ ikinieghe nditọ, ndin Eliasa ye Itama emaenam utom nte mme aku ke ayio uwem ete ammọ Erọn.<verse eid="NUM 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 3:5" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Moses ate, <verse eid="NUM 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 3:6" />“Ben esiin Lifai di, nyʌñ ben ammọ wọt aku Erọn nọ ammọ enwam anye. <verse eid="NUM 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 3:7" />Ammọ enie edinam utom nnọọ anye ye afịd esob Isrel ke atayad mbono ke adinam utom ke itieukpono. <verse eid="NUM 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 3:8" />Ammọ enie adikpeme afịd mme ñkpọ mbanaidem atayad mbono, enyʌñ ekịt ebo ke iminam ubiọñutom nditọ Isrel a-abañake utom ke tabanakịd. <verse eid="NUM 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 3:9" />Ben mme Lifai yaak nọ Erọn ye nditọ ideen amọ; ammọ edo nditọ Isrel a-anaaha ekappa afịd-afịd enọ Erọn. <verse eid="NUM 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 3:10" />Sio Erọn ye nditọ amọ ideen nịm nte mme aku; ana ewot awo ndomokeed mfen a-asañake akpere adisana itie.”<verse eid="NUM 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 3:11" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Moses ate, <verse eid="NUM 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 3:12" />“Ami mmeben mme Lifai nsio ke atu nditọ Isrel nnọ idem mmi ke iwuod afịd mme akpan a-afịd nditọ ibaan Isrel emanna. Mme Lifai edo ake mmi, <verse eid="NUM 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 3:13" />sia afịd mme akpan edo ake mmi. Ke ini ami ñkewotto afịd mme akpan ke Iyib, ami mmaasio afịd mme akpan ke Isrel nnịm nnọ idem mmi, me ake awo me ake unam. Ammọ ana edo ake mmi. Ami ndo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.”<verse eid="NUM 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 3:14" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Moses ke Akpautatan Sainai ate; <verse eid="NUM 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 3:15" />“Bat mbon Lifai ke mme ekpək ye mme ubon ammọ. Bat afịd nditọ ideen e-eyọhọke afiọñ keed me ekanna ado.” <verse eid="NUM 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 3:16" />Ndin Moses amaabat ammọ, naña uyio <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> aketemme anye.<verse eid="NUM 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 3:17" />Mme anyịñ nditọ ideen Lifai ekedo ami:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 3:17">Kesọn, Kohad ye Merari.<verse eid="NUM 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 3:18" />Mme anyịñ ake ubon Kesọn ekedo ami:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 3:18">Libni mme Simei.<verse eid="NUM 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 3:19" />Mme ubon mme Kohad ekedo:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 3:19">Amram, Isaa, Hibrọn mme Usiel.<verse eid="NUM 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 3:20" />Mbon ami ekedo mme ubon Merari:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 3:20">Mahli ye Musi.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="NUM 3:20" />
  <para style="li4" vid="NUM 3:20">Mme ubon mme Lifai ekedo ami, akeene ke ekpək mme ete ammọ.<verse eid="NUM 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 3:21" />Mme ubon mbon Libni ye ubon mbon Simei ekenie Kesọn; ammọ ekedo mme ubon Kesọn.<verse eid="NUM 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 3:22" />Ibad nditọ ideen e-ekedooho afiọñ keed me akanna ado ekedo tọsịn itiaba mme ikie ition (7,500).<verse eid="NUM 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 3:23" />Ubon Kesọn akenie adiba ke usobutịn, ke edem akebe edioomo Abasi.<verse eid="NUM 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 3:24" />Adadusʌñ ke mme ekpək Kesọn akedo Eliasaf, ayịn Lael.<verse eid="NUM 3:24" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 3:25" />Utom ubon Kesọn akedo adikpeme akebe edioomo Abasi ye atayad, mme ufʌkñkpọ amọ, afọñ anyenusʌñ ke nsañandʌk atayad mbono, <verse eid="NUM 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 3:26" />mme afọñ anyenusʌñ akwere, afọñ anyenusʌñ inuaatob a-akannake tabanakịd ye akpokoro uwa akʌk; ye mme udʌk ye afịd ñkpọ se ibaña naña ekama ammọ.<verse eid="NUM 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 3:27" />Kohad akesịne ke mme ubon Amram, Isaa, Hibrọn ye Usiel; ammọ ekedoñño mme ubon Kohad.<verse eid="NUM 3:27" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 3:28" />Ibad nditọ ideen se ikisọñ afiọñ keed me akanna ado akedo tọsịn itiaita mme ikie itiokeed (8,600). Ubon Kohad ekenie edise ñkpọ mbaña adisana itie.<verse eid="NUM 3:28" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 3:29" />Akena ubon Kohad eba ke edem usuuk mben tabanakịd.<verse eid="NUM 3:29" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 3:30" />Adadusʌñ ke mme ubon ake mme aduuk Kohad akedo Elisafan, ayịn Usiel.<verse eid="NUM 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 3:31" />Ubiọñutom ammọ akedo adise ñkpọ mbaña akebe edioomo, akpokoro, ñkpọ udodikañ, mme akpokoro uwa, mme ñkpoduoho adisana itie e-ekamake enam utom Abasi, afọñ anyenusʌñ, mme afịd ñkpọ se isaña ke esịd.<verse eid="NUM 3:31" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 3:32" />Ekamba adadusʌñ mme Lifai akedo Eliasa, ayịn aku Erọn. Ekenịm anye nte iwuod ke atu mbon u-utom ammọ akedooho adise ñkpọ mbaña adisana itie.<verse eid="NUM 3:32" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 3:33" />Merari akenie ubon Mahli ye mbon Musi; ammọ ekedo mbon ubon Merari.<verse eid="NUM 3:33" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 3:34" />Ibad nditọ ideen se ikiyọhọ afiọñ keed me se ikpoon ikan ado akedo tọsịn itiokeed mme ikie iba (6,200).<verse eid="NUM 3:34" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 3:35" />Adadusʌñ ke mme ekpək ke mme ubon Merari akedo Suriel, ayịn Abihel.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="NUM 3:35">Akena ammọ eba ke adoro mbeñ tabanakịd.<verse eid="NUM 3:35" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 3:36" />Ekesio mbon Merari nọ ese ñkpọ ebaña mme ntọọñ, abai, itịm, mme ñkpọ utom, ye afịd ñkpọ se ibaña utom ado, <verse eid="NUM 3:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 3:37" />ukem ye mme ntọọñ ñkanñkʌk akwere ye itịm ammọ, mme mboi atayad ye mme udʌk.<verse eid="NUM 3:37" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 3:38" />Akena Moses ye Erọn ye nditọ amọ eba ke mbeñ usakkautịn tabanakịd, ke ukañ u-utịn asakkake, ke iso atayad mbono.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="NUM 3:38">Ammọ ekenie utom adise ñkpọ mbaña adisana itie ke iwuod nditọ Isrel.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="NUM 3:38">Akena ewot awo ndomokeed mfen a-asañake akpere adisana itie.<verse eid="NUM 3:38" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 3:39" />Afịd mme Lifai e-ekebatta akeene uyio <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akenọọhọ Moses ye Erọn akeene mme ubon ammọ, ñwuọ afịd nditọ ideen e-ekedooho afiọñ keed me akanna ado akedo tọsịn edịb mme iba (22,000).<verse eid="NUM 3:39" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 3:40" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabọ Moses ate, “Bat afịd mme akpan ke Isrel e-edooho afiọñ keed me ekponno ekan ado, nyʌñ wet anyịñ ammọ. <verse eid="NUM 3:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 3:41" />Ben mbon Lifai nnọ miin ke iwuod afịd mme akpan ke atu nditọ Isrel, ye mme ufene mme Lifai ke iwuod afịd akpa ayaara mme ufene nditọ Isrel. Ami ndo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.”<verse eid="NUM 3:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 3:42" />Ndin Moses amaabat afịd mme akpan nditọ Isrel, naña <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akenọọ anye uyio. <verse eid="NUM 3:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 3:43" />Afịd ibad akpa nditọ ideen e-ekedooho afiọñ keed me akanna ado, e-ekewette anyịñ akedo tọsịn edịb mme iba mme ikie iba mme ata mme duob mme ita (22,273).<verse eid="NUM 3:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 3:44" />Ñko <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaadọkkọ Moses ate, <verse eid="NUM 3:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 3:45" />“Ben mme Lifai ke iwuod afịd mme akpan ke Isrel, ye mme ufene ammọ ke iwuod afịd mme ufene. Mme Lifai ediido ake mmi. Ami ndo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="NUM 3:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 3:46" />Adiibọ sekel ition ke iwuod awo keedekeed adifakka mme akpan ikie iba mme ata mme duob mme ita (273) nditọ Isrel ewakka ekan ibad mbon Lifai, <verse eid="NUM 3:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 3:47" />akeene sekel ake adisana itie, adoppoke nte kera edịb. <verse eid="NUM 3:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 3:48" />Nọ Erọn ye nditọ ideen ammọ akʌk edatta efakka nditọ Isrel se ikeene idiana.”<verse eid="NUM 3:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 3:49" />Ke ntoro Moses amaabọ akʌk ufakka ato mbon ekewakka ekan ibad mbon Lifai ekefakkake. <verse eid="NUM 3:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 3:50" />Tọọñọ ke akpa ayịn ke Isrel, anye amaabọ silfa akedoppoke sekel tọsịn keed mme ikie ita mme ata mme ition (1,365),<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:50 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ñkpọ nte kilokram 16</char></note> akeene naña sekel adisana itie ayem. <verse eid="NUM 3:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="NUM 3:51" />Moses amaanọ Erọn ye nditọ ideen amọ akʌk ufakka ado, naña ikọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> aketemme anye.<verse eid="NUM 3:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="NUM 4" />
  <para style="s1">Mbon Kohad</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 4:1" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Moses ye Erọn ate; <verse eid="NUM 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 4:2" />“Inam ubadawo ke atu mbon Kohad edooho ubakka Lifai ke mme ubon ye mme ufọk ammọ. <verse eid="NUM 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 4:3" />Bat afịd ideen tọọñọ ke awo isua edịb mme duob akewuọ isua aba mme duob e-esidinamma utom ke atayad mbono.<verse eid="NUM 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 4:4" />“Utom mbon Kohad ke atayad mbono ado ami: adise ñkpọ mbaña mme nsana ñkan ñkpọ. <verse eid="NUM 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 4:5" />Ñko udịm mbon Isrel emaetọọñọ isañ, Erọn ye nditọ ideen amọ ana edʌk eka ekekọññọ afọñ ikpeghe efʌk akebe edioomo mbed. <verse eid="NUM 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 4:6" />Ndin ammọ enie edidat eti uduud ikpa mfʌk afọñ ikpeghe, enyʌñ ekama adeghe bru anyen afọñ enyʌñ edọñ mme abai ke itie ammọ.<verse eid="NUM 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 4:7" />“Yak ebịt bru afọñ ke akpokoro Iso Enọ enyʌñ edot mme ñkara usan, ntəño usan, ye mme atu enọ ukọd, nọ uyo a-asinaaha do afịd ini akaiso anaa do. <verse eid="NUM 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 4:8" />Yak ammọ ebịt ndad-ndad afọñ ke anyọñ ammọ, enyʌñ efʌk ammọ eti uduud ikpa, ndin edọñ mme abai ke mme itie ammọ.<verse eid="NUM 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 4:9" />“Yak ammọ eben bru afọñ enyʌñ efʌk udod utuenikañ e-ekamake edomo ikañ, ukem ye mme utuenikañ, ñkpọ ukpịkke afọñikañ ye mme anainai, ye afịd mme atu adan ọlif amọ se ekama esịn ke utuenikañ. <verse eid="NUM 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 4:10" />Ndin yak ammọ efʌk anye ye mme afịd ñkpọ mbanaidem amọ ke ufʌkñkpọ eti uduud ikpa enyʌñ edot anye ke ukpadñkpọ.<verse eid="NUM 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 4:11" />“Yak ebịt bru afọñ ke akpokoro uwa a-kold enyʌñ efʌk anye ke eti uduud ikpa ndin edọñ mme abai ke itie.<verse eid="NUM 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 4:12" />“Ana ammọ ekoono afịd ñkpọ se ekama enam utom Abasi ke adisana itie, yak efʌk ammọ ke bru afọñ, enyʌñ efʌk anye ke eti uduud ikpa ndin edot anye ke ukpadñkpọ.<verse eid="NUM 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 4:13" />“Yak ammọ esio ntọñ akpokoro uwa brọns enyʌñ etat iduod-iduod afọñ efʌk anye. <verse eid="NUM 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 4:14" />Ndin ana ammọ etañ afịd ñkpọ ufọk a-ammọ ekekamake enam ñkpọ ke akpokoro uwa, mme akoikañ, akuum unam, anyan udọk ye mme usan usiime ñkpọ edot ke anyọñ amọ. Ndin yak ammọ ekama eti uduud ikpa efʌk anye enyʌñ edọñ mme abai ke itie.<verse eid="NUM 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 4:15" />“Erọn ye nditọ amọ ideen emaekweeñe adifʌk mme adisana ñkpọ mbanaidem ima ye afịd mme ndisana ñkpọ, nọ udịm Isrel eyem adidakka, ini ado ndin ke mbon Kohad ediidibenne mme ñkpọ ado. Ado inaaha ammọ etuuk mme ndisana ñkpọ imiidooho ammọ eyaekpañña. Mbon Kohad ana ekoono mme ñkpọ se ibañña ke atayad mbono.<verse eid="NUM 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 4:16" />“Aku Eliasa, ayịn Erọn, anie ubiọñutom adise ñkpọ mbaña adan utuenikañ, anemufịk insensi, enọ ñkpasi e-edooho afịd ini ye adan udodubọk. Yak anye ase ñkpọ abaña afịd tabanakịd ye afịd se idọñọ ke esịd, afịd ñkpọ mbanaidem amọ ye afịd mme adisana ñkpọ.”<verse eid="NUM 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 4:17" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Moses ye Erọn, <verse eid="NUM 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 4:18" />“Ndufo ikịt ibo ke awo isoboke mme esiin aduuk Kohad isio ke atu mbon Lifai. <verse eid="NUM 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 4:19" />Nọ ato do ammọ edu uwem inyʌññọ ikpañña ke ammọ emaedʌk ekpere ataa ndisana ñkpọ, enam ami enọ ammọ: Erọn ye nditọ ideen amọ enie edidʌk esịd adisana itie ekenọ mme awo keedekeed iso utom ye se ido mbiomo ammọ. <verse eid="NUM 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 4:20" />Ado inaaha mbon Kohad edʌk esịd ekese mme ndisana ñkpọ, ñkọm akpedo ke ataa etək ini, imiidooho ntoro ammọ eyaekpañña.”<verse eid="NUM 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mbon Kesọn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 4:21" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Moses ate, <verse eid="NUM 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 4:22" />“Nyʌñ nam ubadawo nditọ Kesọn keene mme ufọk ye mme ubon ammọ. <verse eid="NUM 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 4:23" />Bat afịd ideen eyọhọke isua edịb mme duob tutu asịm isua aba mme duob se isidi idinwam ke utom atayad mbono.<verse eid="NUM 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 4:24" />“Utom mme aduuk Kesọn ado ami ke adibobiom ye ke mme utom ammọ mfen: <verse eid="NUM 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 4:25" />Utom ammọ ado adibiom mme afọñ ikpeghe usʌñ tabanakịd, a-adooho atayad mbono, ufʌk ñkpọ amọ ye anye a-adoroke ke anyọñ amọ e-enamma ke eti uduud ikpa, mme afọñ anyenusʌñ atayad mbono, <verse eid="NUM 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 4:26" />ye mme afọñ ikpeghe akwere e-ekannake tabanakịd ye akpokoro uwa ekʌk, afọñ ikpeghe inuausʌñ akwere, mme udʌk ye afịd mme ñkpọ se ekama enam utom ke atayad. Mbon Kesọn enie adikama mme ñkpọ ami nnam afịd mme ñkpọ se enie adinam. <verse eid="NUM 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 4:27" />Afịd utom mbon Kesọn, me ado adibiom ñkpọ me adinam ñkpọ, ana asaña ke ndadusʌñ Erọn ye nditọ ideen amọ. Ndufo enie edinọ ammọ ubiọñutom afịd se ammọ enie edibiom. <verse eid="NUM 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 4:28" />Utom aduuk mbon Kesọn ado ami ke atayad mbono esob. Utom ammọ asaña ke ndadusʌñ aku Itama, ayịn Erọn.<verse eid="NUM 4:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mbon Merari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 4:29" />“Bat mbon Merari ke ubon ye aduuk ammọ. <verse eid="NUM 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 4:30" />Bat ideen e-edooho isua edịb mme duob tutu asịm isua aba mme duob, e-esidiighe edinwam ke utom atayad mbono. <verse eid="NUM 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 4:31" />Ke atu utom a-ammọ enieghe inam ke atayad mbono ado, yak ammọ ebiom mme akpara tabanakịd, mme ntọọñ, abai ye eko ammọ, <verse eid="NUM 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 4:32" />ukem ye mme abai e-ekannake akwere ekʌk ye mme eko ammọ, mboi atayad, mme udʌk, mme ñkpoduoho amọ mme afịd ñkpọ utom ammọ. Nam awo keedekeed adiọọñọ iso utom amọ ye mbiomo se anye anie adibiom. <verse eid="NUM 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 4:33" />Utom aduuk Merari naña ammọ edinam utom ke atayad mbono ke ndadusʌñ aku Itama, ayịn Erọn ado ami.”<verse eid="NUM 4:33" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Adibat Mme Ubon Lifai</para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 4:34" />Moses, Erọn ye mme adadusʌñ ke abio emaebat mbon Kohad ke mme aduuk ye ubon ammọ.<verse eid="NUM 4:34" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 4:35" />Afịd ideen tọọñọ ke isua edịb mme duob tutu akesịm isua aba mme duob e-ekediighe edinam utom ke atayad mbono, <verse eid="NUM 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 4:36" />ekebatta ke aduuk ekedo tọsịn iba mme ikie itiaba mme aba mme duob (2,750). <verse eid="NUM 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 4:37" />Afịd ibad awo ke mme aduuk Kohad se ikinam utom ke atayad mbono akedo ado. Moses ye Erọn ekebat ammọ ekeene uyio <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ke ndadusʌñ Moses.<verse eid="NUM 4:37" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 4:38" />Ekebat mbon Kesọn ekeene aduuk ye ubon ammọ.<verse eid="NUM 4:38" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 4:39" />Afịd ideen tọọñọ ke isua edịb mme duob tutu akesịm isua aba mme duob e-ekediighe edinwam ke utom atayad mbono, <verse eid="NUM 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 4:40" />e-ekebatta ekeene mme aduuk ye ubon ammọ ekedo tọsịn iba mme ikie itiokeed mme edịb mme duob (2,630). <verse eid="NUM 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 4:41" />Ami akedo afịd ibad awo ke mme aduuk Kesọn e-ekenamma utom ke atayad mbono. Moses ye Erọn ekebat ammọ ekeene uyio <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.<verse eid="NUM 4:41" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 4:42" />Ekebat mbon Merari ekeene mme aduuk ye ubon ammọ.<verse eid="NUM 4:42" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 4:43" />Afịd ideen e-ekedooho isua edịb mme duob tutu asịm isua aba mme duob e-ekediighe edinwam edinam utom ke atayad mbono, <verse eid="NUM 4:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 4:44" />e-ekebatta ekeene mme aduuk ammọ ekedo tọsịn ita mme ikie iba (3,200). <verse eid="NUM 4:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 4:45" />Afịd ibad awo e-eketooho mme aduuk ubon Merari ekedo ami. Moses ye Erọn ekebat ammọ ekeene uyio <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akenọọhọ Moses.<verse eid="NUM 4:45" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 4:46" />Ndin Moses ye Erọn ye mme adadusʌñ Isrel emaebat afịd mbon Lifai ekeene mme aduuk ye ubon ammọ. <verse eid="NUM 4:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 4:47" />Afịd ideen tọọñọ ke isua edịb mme duob tutu akesịm aba mme duob e-ekediighe edinam utom ñnyʌñ mbiom atayad mbono <verse eid="NUM 4:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 4:48" />ekedo tọsịn itiaita mme ikie ition mme anaañ (8,580). <verse eid="NUM 4:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 4:49" />Ke uyio <char style="nd">A-Abọọñ</char> akenọọhọ Moses, emaenọ awo keedekeed utom enyʌñ edọkkọ se anye anie adibiom.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="NUM 4:49" />
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 4:49">Ndin emaebat ammọ naña <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akenọ Moses uyio.<verse eid="NUM 4:49" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="NUM 5" />
  <para style="s1">Adinịm Nnaaekọñ Asana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 5:1" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Moses ate, <verse eid="NUM 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 5:2" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ke usem Hibru, ikọ a-adaaha anọ idiọọk udọñọ ikpaidem ado akpamfia a-anyʌññọ ada anọ nsio-nsio udọñọ ke ikpaidem.</char></note>“Nọ nditọ Isrel uyio bo esio awo akeedodo a-anieghe idiọọk udọñọ ke ikpaidem me ñkpọ awuọñọ ke idem me awo i-imiisanake ato ke ntak akpo awo efep ke nnaaekọñ. <verse eid="NUM 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 5:3" />Sịññe ammọ, ibaan ye ideen ukem-ukem; sio ammọ fep ke nnaaekọñ mbaak edisappa nnaaekọñ ammọ, a-ami ndʌññọ ke atu ammọ.” <verse eid="NUM 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 5:4" />Nditọ Isrel emaenam ntoro; emaesịññe utọ ibon ado ke nnaaekọñ efep. Ammọ emaenam kpa naña <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> aketemme Moses.<verse eid="NUM 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Usio Isob Idiọọkñkpọ (Usio Isob)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 5:5" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Moses ate, <verse eid="NUM 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 5:6" />“Dọkkọ nditọ Isrel bo: ‘Awodeen me awonwaan ndomokeed akpedue awo mfen ke usʌñ akeedodo, ke ntak ado anye inyʌññọ inam akpanikọ ye <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, anye a-adue <verse eid="NUM 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 5:7" />ndin ana ammọ eyaara idiọọkñkpọ a-ammọ ekenamma. Ana ammọ ekpe ayọhọ usiene ke ndudue a-ammọ ekenamma, edian ubaak keed ke itie ition ukem ñkpọ ado enọ awo a-ammọ ekedueghe. <verse eid="NUM 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 5:8" />Ado akpedo awo e-ekedueghe inieghe ayakka a-akpereke anye idem a-akemeke adibọ isob ke ndudue ado nnọọ anye, isob ado anie <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, ndin ana ekappa enọ aku, edian ye akukịmedọñ, nọ edat enam ñkpeubọk enọ anam ukwañ. <verse eid="NUM 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 5:9" />Afịd mme enọ ndisana ñkpọ a-nditọ Isrel ebenne esọk aku, anie aku ado. <verse eid="NUM 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 5:10" />Mme ndisana ñkpọ anie mme andinie, ado se ammọ enọ aku adiinie aku ado.’ ”<verse eid="NUM 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Idomo E-enọọhọ Anwaan A-asịnne Efịbe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 5:11" />Akema <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Moses, <verse eid="NUM 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 5:12" />“Tañ nọ nditọ Isrel nyʌñ dọkkọ ammọ bo: ‘Adieke anwaan awo awuọhọ akpọñ usʌñ inyʌññọ inam akpanikọ ye ebe amọ <verse eid="NUM 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 5:13" />ndin ato ke ado awodeen mfen anie ewuana ye anye, anam ebe amọ idiọọñọke ndin awo idiọọñọke ke anye adeghe (sia ntiense ibaaha, awo inyʌññọ imʌm anye naña anye anam), <verse eid="NUM 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 5:14" />ndin ebe amọ akpenie ufịb abaña anyʌñ akere ke anwaan amọ a-akaa awo me a-asịn efịbe ndin ke anye isanake, me ebe anie ufịb anyʌñ akere ntoro akpesʌkado anwaan amọ imiidegheke, <verse eid="NUM 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 5:15" />ndin ana anye aben anwaan amọ akaa iso aku. Ñko ana anye akama ke iwuod anwaan amọ mbaak keed ke itie duob enọ efa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ñkpọ nte kilokram 1.6</char></note> ndomuyo baali. Inaaha anye aduọk adan ọlif me asịn insensi ke esịd, sia ado enọ ñkpasi e-enọọhọ ke ntak ufịb, enọ aditoiyo, a-anamma nọ ediọọñọ ndudue.<verse eid="NUM 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 5:16" />“ ‘Yak aku aben awonwaan ado adi anyʌñ anam anye ada ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="NUM 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 5:17" />Ndin aku ayaakama atu mbad akoi adisana mmọọñ anyʌñ asịn abu a-atooho tabanakịd ke mmọọñ ado. <verse eid="NUM 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 5:18" />Ke aku amaakenam anwaan ado ada ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, aku ayaakpọk ided awonwaan ado anyʌñ asịn enọ aditoiyo, enọ ñkpasi ufịb ke ubọk amọ, ke ini anye aku ke idem amọ akamake idod mmọọñ a-akamake isuuñọ. <verse eid="NUM 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 5:19" />Ndin aku ayaanam awonwaan ado adat unwọñọ anyʌñ abo anye ate, “Adieke imiibaaha awodeen mfen ndomokeed a-anieghe ewuana ye afo, afo ñko udueghe idem, ukusappake idem tọọñọ akedọ ebe mfo, yak idod mmọọñ ami a-akamake isuuñọ akuunam fiin idiọọk. <verse eid="NUM 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 5:20" />Ado akpedo afo amedue idem ke ndọ ami ye ebe mfo, anyʌñ asappa idem ke adinie ewuana ye awodeen mfen i-imiidooho ebe mfo,” <verse eid="NUM 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 5:21" />mi aku ana asịn isuuñọ anọ awonwaan ado, anyʌñ abo, “yak <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> anam nọ afo ado ñkpọ isuuñọ ke atu mbon ndufo ke ini anye anamma yak idịb a-afo akeyommoke abʌññọ anyʌñ anam nọ idịb mfo atịt. <verse eid="NUM 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 5:22" />Yak mmọọñ ami a-akamake isuuñọ adọñọ idem mfo nọ idịb mfo atịt, idịb mfo anyʌñ abuuñ nditọ.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 5:22">“ ‘Ndin yak awonwaan ado abọọrọ, “Amen. Yak asu ntoro.”<verse eid="NUM 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 5:23" />“ ‘Ana aku awet mme isuuñọ ami ke ñwed anyʌñ ayet ammọ asịn ke idod mmọọñ ado. <verse eid="NUM 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 5:24" />Anye ayaanam awonwaan ado anwọñ idod mmọọñ ado a-akamake isuuñọ, ndin mmọọñ ado a-akamake isuuñọ anyʌññọ akama ndutʌhọ ayaadʌk anye idem. <verse eid="NUM 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 5:25" />Yak aku abọ ato ubọk awonwaan ado enọ ñkpasi ufịb, afʌñ ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ndin aben adi akpokoro uwa. <verse eid="NUM 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 5:26" />Aku ayaawoppo enọ ñkpasi ekpaubọk keed nte ñkpọ aditoiyo anyʌñ afọp ke akpokoro uwa; ndin ana anam awonwaan ado anwọñ mmọọñ ado. <verse eid="NUM 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 5:27" />Se idiitịppe ado ami adieke adooho anye amaasappa idem amọ, anyʌñ anie ewuana ye awodeen mfen: Emaenam nọ anye anwọñ mmọọñ a-akamake isuuñọ ye akpọsọñ ndutʌhọ do, anye ayaadọñọ anye idem, idịb amọ ayaayọọk ndin ntʌñidịb amọ ayaabuuñ nditọ, ndin anye adiido ñkpọ isuuñọ. <verse eid="NUM 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 5:28" />Ado akpedo awonwaan ado ikisappake idem amọ, ado asana, ñkpọ idiinamma anye, ndin anye ayaakan aman nditọ.<verse eid="NUM 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 5:29" />“ ‘Ndin ami ado mbed ufịb ke awonwaan amaadue idem anyʌñ asappa idem amọ ke ini anye asʌkkọ aba ke idak ndọ ye ebe amọ, <verse eid="NUM 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 5:30" />me idaha ufịb anamma ebe ke ini anye akereke abo ke anwaan amọ a-adue idem. Aku ayaanam awonwaan ado ada ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ndin enam mme afịd mbed ami ye anye. <verse eid="NUM 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 5:31" />Ebe idiinieghe ndudue ndomokeed, ado anwaan ayaabiom utịb idiọọkñkpọ amọ.’ ”<verse eid="NUM 5:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="NUM 6" />
  <para style="s1">Mbon Nasariin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 6:1" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Moses ate, <verse eid="NUM 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 6:2" />“Tañ ikọ nọ nditọ Isrel bo ammọ ate: ‘Adieke awodeen me awonwaan ayemme adinam asaña-asaña akaaña adinịm idem amọ nnọọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> nte Nasariin, <verse eid="NUM 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 6:3" />ammọ ana ebet ukọd ye mme ndañ ukọd mfen, inaaha ammọ enwọñ fineka e-enamma eto ukọd me ndañ ukọd. Inaaha ammọ enwọñ mmọọñ kreb me edia kreb me nsaad mfịd kreb. <verse eid="NUM 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 6:4" />Adaña nte ekpọnnọke ammọ enịm ke idak enwọñọ Nasariin, inaaha ammọ edia ñkpọ ndomokeed a-atooho inwañ fain, akpekọm ñkpasi me ikpọk.<verse eid="NUM 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 6:5" />“ ‘Inaaha akadañ akpịkke ided ammọ, ke afịd ini a-ammọ ebaaha ke unwọñọ nte Nasariin. Ana ammọ enịm idem ammọ ke adisana tutu ini adinịm idem ammọ asaña-asaña nnọọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akweeñe; ana ammọ eyaak ided ammọ ada ntoro anyan.<verse eid="NUM 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 6:6" />“ ‘Ke afịd ini a-ammọ enịmme idem ammọ asaña-asaña enọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, awo Nasariin inaaha asaña akpere akpo awo. <verse eid="NUM 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 6:7" />Akpọkọm ete, me eka, me ayịneka ammọ akpa, yak ammọ ekuusappa idem ke ntak ibon ado, sia idiọọñọ ammọ adinịm idem ammọ asaña-asaña nnọọ Abasi adoro ke iwuod ammọ. <verse eid="NUM 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 6:8" />Ke afịd ini a-ammọ enịmme idem ammọ enọ Abasi, e-enam ammọ esana enọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.<verse eid="NUM 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 6:9" />“ ‘Adieke awo akpaaha adiyịk-adiyịk ke itie a-awo Nasariin abaaha, ke ntoro asappa ided iwuod ammọ a-adooho idiọọñọ adisio ammọ nnịm nnọọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, ana ammọ ekwat ided ammọ ke ayọhọ usen itiaba, usen adinam ammọ esana. <verse eid="NUM 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 6:10" />Ndin ke ayọhọ usen itiaita ana ammọ eben ibiom iba me ñyịn abomoñkuku iba esọk aku ke inuausʌñ atayad mbono. <verse eid="NUM 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 6:11" />Aku ana awa keed nte uwa idiọọkñkpọ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Akeme ido uwa enọ adinam asana; se ñko ke Nọmba 6:14 ye 16</char></note> anyʌñ awa ayọhọ iba nte ufọfọb uwa nọ anam ñkpeubọk anọ Nasariin sia ammọ emaedue ke ammọ ediba ke itie akpo awo. Ana ammọ emaana enam ided ammọ asana kpa ke usen ado. <verse eid="NUM 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 6:12" />Ana ammọ emaana enịm idem ammọ asaña-asaña enọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> kpa ke ukem ibad ini ado enyʌñ eben ñyịn edọñ isua keed nte uwa ndudue edi. Awo idiibatta mme usen edem sia ammọ emaesappa idem ke ini ekenịmme idem asaña-asaña enọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.<verse eid="NUM 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 6:13" />“ ‘Mbed Nasariin ado ami ke ini edinịm idem ammọ asaña-asaña amaakweeñe. Ana eben ammọ edi inuausʌñ atayad mbono. <verse eid="NUM 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 6:14" />Do ke ammọ enie ediben mme enọ ammọ nnọọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>: ñyịn akukịmedọñ isua keed, i-imiinieghe ndo nte ufọfọb uwa; ñyịn umanedọñ isua keed i-imiinieghe ndo nte uwa idiọọkñkpọ, ekamba akukịmedọñ i-imiinieghe ndo nte uwa ewuana, <verse eid="NUM 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 6:15" />edian mme enọ ñkpasi ye mme enọ ukọd, ye ayọhọ akpasa uyo e-enamma eto ataa eti ndomuyo se yiis imiisịnneke, ikpọ eboho uyo ewuaha adan ọlif ke esịd ye ñkeñe eboho uyo e-eyette adan ọlif.<verse eid="NUM 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 6:16" />“ ‘Aku anie adikoono afịd mme ñkpọ ami nnọọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> nte uwa idiọọkñkpọ ye ufọfọb uwa. <verse eid="NUM 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 6:17" />Aku anie adiben akpasa uyo se yiis imiisịneke anyʌñ awa ekamba akukịmedọñ nte uwa ewuana anọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, adian ye mme uwa ñkpasi ye uwa ukọd.<verse eid="NUM 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 6:18" />“ ‘Ndin ke inuausʌñ atayad mbono, mme Nasariin ana ekwat ided ammọ esio nte ñkpọ idiọọñọ a-ammọ edinịm idem nnọọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. Ana ammọ ekoono ided ado esịn ke ikañ asakka ke idak akpokoro uwa ewuana.<verse eid="NUM 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 6:19" />“ ‘Mme Nasariin emaekwat ided a-adooho ñkpọ idiọọñọ unịm idem nnọọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ima, aku ana asịn afara akukịmedọñ emaeketem ke ubọk Nasariin, adian ekamba ye etək uyo e-esioho ke akpasa, enam naña iba awo isịnne yiis. <verse eid="NUM 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 6:20" />Aku ayaadịppe mme ñkpọ ami ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> nte ufọfʌñ uwa, ammọ edo ndisana enyʌñ enie aku, adian ye eba edọñ ekefʌññọ ye ifʌkkọ ekenọọhọ. Ke ado amaakweeñe mme Nasariin ekeme edinwọñ ukọd.<verse eid="NUM 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 6:21" />“ ‘Mbed mme Nasariin ado ami, e-enamma enwọñọ enọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akeene adinịm idem asaña-asaña, dian ke ñkpọ akeedodo mfen a-ammọ ekanna adinọ. Ana ammọ esio akaaña a-ammọ ekenamma, akeene mbed Nasariin.’ ”<verse eid="NUM 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Adidiọñ Ake Mme Aku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 6:22" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Moses ate, <verse eid="NUM 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 6:23" />“Dọkkọ Erọn ye nditọ ideen amọ bo, ‘Naña ndufo ediidiọñ nditọ Isrel ado ami. Bo ammọ ate:<verse eid="NUM 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 6:24" />“ ‘ “Yak <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> idiọñ ndufo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 6:24">anyʌñ ikpeme ndufo;<verse eid="NUM 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 6:25" />yak <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> anam iso amọ ayamma inọ ndufo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 6:25">anyʌñ afọn mfọn ye ndufo;<verse eid="NUM 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 6:26" />yak <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akanna iso amọ ise ndufo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 6:26">anyʌñ inọ ndufo emem.” ’<verse eid="NUM 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 6:27" />“Ndin ammọ eyaekoot anyịñ mmi edot nditọ Isrel ke idem, ndin ami ñyaadiọñ ammọ.”<verse eid="NUM 6:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="NUM 7" />
  <para style="s1">Mme Enọ ke Usọrọ Udiọñ Tabanakịd</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 7:1" />Ke ini Moses amaakebọp tabanakịd ama, anye amaayet adan anyʌñ anam anye asana ye mme afịd ñkpọ mbanaufọk amọ. Anye amaanyʌñ ayet adan, anam akpokoro uwa ye afịd ñkpọ utem ñkpọ esana. <verse eid="NUM 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 7:2" />Ndin mme adadusʌñ Isrel, mme adaiwuod ke mme ubon e-ekedooho mme adaiwuod ke mme esiin Isrel, e-ekeseeghe ñkpọ ebaña mbon se ekebat, emaenọ mme enọ. <verse eid="NUM 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 7:3" />Ammọ emaeben mme enọ ammọ edi ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>: ukpadñkpọ itiokeed e-efʌkkọfʌk ye abaakenañ duob mme iba, kwa adaiwuod kwa abaakenañ, mme adaiwuod iba ukpadñkpọ keed. Se ammọ ekeben edinọ ke iso tabanakịd ekedo ado.<verse eid="NUM 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 7:4" />Akema <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Moses ate, <verse eid="NUM 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 7:5" />“Bọ ammọ mme ñkpọ ami, nọ ekama enam utom ke atayad mbono. Kappa mme ñkpọ ami nọ mme Lifai akeene naña utom ammọ keedekeed ayem.”<verse eid="NUM 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 7:6" />Ndin Moses amaaben mme ukpadñkpọ ye mme abaakenañ ado anọ mme Lifai. <verse eid="NUM 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 7:7" />Anye amaanọ mbon ubon Kesọn ukpadñkpọ iba ye abaakenañ inaañ, akeene naña utom ammọ akedo, <verse eid="NUM 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 7:8" />ndin anye amaanyʌñ anọ mbon Merari ukpadñkpọ inaañ ye abaakenañ itiaita akeene naña utom ammọ akedo. Afịd ammọ ekeba ke idak ndadusʌñ aku Itama, ayịn Erọn. <verse eid="NUM 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 7:9" />Ado Moses ikinọọhọ mbon ubon Kohad ñkpọ ndomokeed, sia akena ammọ ebiom mme ndisana ñkpọ ke afara ammọ, nte ubiọñutom ammọ akedooho.<verse eid="NUM 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 7:10" />Ke emaekeyet adan ke akpokoro uwa ema, mme adadusʌñ Isrel emaekoono mme enọ ammọ edinịm asaña-asaña ke iso akpokoro uwa. <verse eid="NUM 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 7:11" />Sia <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaadọkkọ Moses ate, “Yak adadusʌñ keed aben enọ amọ ke usen enọ amọ adinịm asaña-asaña ke iso akpokoro uwa nọ ekama enam akpokoro uwa asana.”<verse eid="NUM 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 7:12" />Andikiben enọ amọ ndi ke akpa usen akedo Nasọn, ayịn Aminadab a-aketooho esiin Yuda.<verse eid="NUM 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 7:13" />Enọ amọ akedo:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 7:13">usan silfa keed adoppoke ke sekel ikie mme edịb mme duob,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ñkpọ nte kilokram 1.5; se ñko ke itie mfen ke iwuod ñwed ami</char></note> ye ntəño usan keed eduọkkọ silfa akedoppoke sekel ata mme duob,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ñkpọ nte kram 800; se ñko ke itie mfen ke iwuod ñwed ami</char></note> afịd iba ekesaña ekeene udomo sekel adisana itie, ekedọññọ ammọ keedekeed eyọhọ ye ataa eti ndomuyo ye adan ọlif nte enọ ñkpasi;<verse eid="NUM 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 7:14" />usan kold keed akedoppoke sekel duob,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ñkpọ nte kram 115; se ñko ke itie mfen ke iwuod ñwed ami</char></note> ayọhọ ye insensi;<verse eid="NUM 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 7:15" />ñyịn ayaaraenañ keed, akukịmedọñ keed ye ñyịn edọñ isua keed nte ufọfọb uwa;<verse eid="NUM 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 7:16" />akpoebod keed nte uwa idiọọkñkpọ;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Akeme ido uwa enọ adinam asana; se ñko ke itie mfen ke iwuod ñwed ami</char></note><verse eid="NUM 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 7:17" />mme ñyaara abaakenañ iba, akukịmedọñ ition, akpoebod ition mme ñyịn edọñ ition esọññọ isua keed ekem se ekama enam uwa ewuana.</para>
  <para style="lh" vid="NUM 7:17">Ami akedo enọ Nasọn, ayịn Aminadab.<verse eid="NUM 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 7:18" />Ke ayọhọ usen iba Natandiel ayịn Suaa, adadusʌñ ke esiin Isaka, amaaben enọ amọ adi.<verse eid="NUM 7:18" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 7:19" />Enọ a-anye akebenne adi akedo:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 7:19">usan silfa keed a-akenieghe udob sekel ikie keed mme edịb mme duob, mme ntəño usan usiime ñkpọ silfa keed a-akenieghe udob sekel ata mme duob, afịd iba ekesaña ekeene udomo sekel adisana itie, edọñ ataa eti ndomuyo mme adan ọlif nte enọ ñkpasi eyọhọ ammọ keedekeed;<verse eid="NUM 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 7:20" />usan kold keed a-akenieghe udob sekel duob, ayọhọ ye insensi;<verse eid="NUM 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 7:21" />ñyịn ayaaraenañ keed, akukịmedọñ keed ye ñyịn edọñ isua keed nte ufọfọb uwa;<verse eid="NUM 7:21" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 7:22" />akpoebod keed nte uwa idiọọkñkpọ;<verse eid="NUM 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 7:23" />mme abaakenañ iba, akukịmedọñ ition, akpoebod ition mme ikpọ ñyịn edọñ ition ekponno ekem se ekama enam uwa ewuana.</para>
  <para style="li4" vid="NUM 7:23">Ami akedo enọ Natandiel, ayịn Suaa.<verse eid="NUM 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 7:24" />Ke ayọhọ usen ita, Eliab ayịn Helọn, adadusʌñ ke esiin Sebulọn, amaaben enọ amọ adi.<verse eid="NUM 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 7:25" />Uwa amọ akedo usan silfa keed akedoppoke sekel ikie keed mme edịb mme duob, mme ntəño usan usiime ñkpọ silfa keed akedoppoke sekel ata mme duob, afịd iba ekesaña ekeene udomo sekel adisana itie, edọñ ataa eti ndomuyo mme adan ọlif nte enọ ñkpasi eyọhọ ammọ keedekeed;<verse eid="NUM 7:25" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 7:26" />usan kold keed akedoppoke sekel duob, ayọhọ ye insensi;<verse eid="NUM 7:26" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 7:27" />ñyịn ayaaraenañ keed, akukịmedọñ keed ye ñyịn edọñ isua keed nte ufọfọb uwa;<verse eid="NUM 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 7:28" />akpoebod keed nte uwa idiọọkñkpọ;<verse eid="NUM 7:28" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 7:29" />abaakenañ iba, akukịmedọñ ition, akpoebod ition mme ñyịn akukịmedọñ ition ekponno ekem se ekama enam uwa ewuana.</para>
  <para style="li4" vid="NUM 7:29">Ami akedo enọ Eliab ayịn Helọn.<verse eid="NUM 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 7:30" />Ke ayọhọ usen inaañ Elisọ ayịn Sedọọ, adadusʌñ ke esiin Rubịn, amaaben enọ amọ adi.<verse eid="NUM 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 7:31" />Uwa amọ akedo:</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="NUM 7:31">usan silfa keed akedoppoke sekel ikie keed mme edịb mme duob, ye ntəño usan usiime ñkpọ silfa keed akedoppoke sekel ata mme duob, afịd iba ekesaña ekeene udomo sekel adisana itie, edọñ ataa eti ndomuyo mme adan ọlif nte enọ ñkpasi eyọhọ ammọ keedekeed;<verse eid="NUM 7:31" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 7:32" />usan kold keed akedoppoke sekel duob, ayọhọ ye insensi;<verse eid="NUM 7:32" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 7:33" />ñyịn ayaaraenañ keed, akukịmedọñ keed ye ñyịn edọñ isua keed nte ufọfọb uwa;<verse eid="NUM 7:33" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 7:34" />akpoebod keed nte uwa idiọọkñkpọ;<verse eid="NUM 7:34" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 7:35" />abaakenañ iba, akukịmedọñ ition, akpoebod ition mme ñyịn akukịmedọñ ition ekponno ekem se ekama enam uwa ewuana.</para>
  <para style="li4" vid="NUM 7:35">Ami akedo enọ Elisọ ayịn Sedọọ.<verse eid="NUM 7:35" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 7:36" />Ke ayọhọ usen ition Selumiel ayịn Surisadai, adadusʌñ ke esiin Simiọn amaaben enọ amọ adi.<verse eid="NUM 7:36" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 7:37" />Uwa amọ akedo:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 7:37">usan silfa keed akedoppoke sekel ikie keed mme edịb mme duob, ye ntəño usan usiime ñkpọ silfa keed akedoppoke sekel ata mme duob, afịd iba ekesaña ekeene udomo sekel adisana itie, edọñ ataa eti ndomuyo mme adan ọlif nte enọ ñkpasi eyọhọ ammọ keedekeed;<verse eid="NUM 7:37" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 7:38" />usan kold keed akedoppoke sekel duob ayọhọ ye insensi;<verse eid="NUM 7:38" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 7:39" />ñyịn ayaaraenañ keed, akukịmedọñ keed ye ñyịn edọñ isua keed nte ufọfọb uwa;<verse eid="NUM 7:39" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 7:40" />akpoebod keed nte uwa idiọọkñkpọ;<verse eid="NUM 7:40" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 7:41" />abaakenañ iba, akukịmedọñ ition, akpoebod ition ye ñyịn akukịmedọñ ition ekpoono ekem se ekama enam uwa ewuana.</para>
  <para style="li4" vid="NUM 7:41">Ami akedo enọ Selumiel ayịn Surisadai.<verse eid="NUM 7:41" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 7:42" />Ke ayọhọ usen itiokeed Eliasaf ayịn Dewel, adadusʌñ ke esiin Kad, amaaben enọ amọ adi.<verse eid="NUM 7:42" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 7:43" />Enọ amọ akedo:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 7:43">usan silfa keed akedoppoke sekel ikie keed mme edịb mme duob, ye ntəño usan usiime ñkpọ silfa keed akedoppoke sekel ata mme duob, afịd iba ekesaña ekeene udomo sekel adisana itie, edọñ ataa eti ndomuyo mme adan ọlif nte enọ ñkpasi eyọhọ ammọ keedekeed;<verse eid="NUM 7:43" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 7:44" />usan kold keed akedoppoke sekel duob ayọhọ ye insensi;<verse eid="NUM 7:44" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 7:45" />ñyịn ayaaraenañ keed, akukịmedọñ keed ye ñyịn edọñ isua keed nte ufọfọb uwa;<verse eid="NUM 7:45" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 7:46" />akpoebod keed nte uwa idiọọkñkpọ;<verse eid="NUM 7:46" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 7:47" />abaakenañ iba, akukịmedọñ ition, akpoebod ition ye ñyaara ñyịn edọñ ition ekpoono ekem se ekama enam uwa ewuana.</para>
  <para style="li4" vid="NUM 7:47">Ami akedo enọ Eliasaf ayịn Dewel.<verse eid="NUM 7:47" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 7:48" />Ke ayọhọ usen itiaba Elisama ayịn Amihud, adadusʌñ ke Ifrem, amaaben enọ amọ adi.<verse eid="NUM 7:48" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 7:49" />Enọ amọ akedo:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 7:49">usan silfa keed akedoppoke sekel ikie keed mme edịb mme duob, ye ntəño usan usiime ñkpọ silfa keed akedoppoke sekel ata mme duob, afịd iba ekesaña ekeene udomo sekel adisana itie, edọñ ataa eti ndomuyo ye adan ọlif nte enọ ñkpasi eyọhọ ammọ keedekeed;<verse eid="NUM 7:49" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 7:50" />usan kold keed akedoppoke sekel duob, ayọhọ ye insensi;<verse eid="NUM 7:50" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="NUM 7:51" />ñyịn ayaaraenañ keed, akukịmedọñ keed ye ñyịn edọñ isua keed nte ufọfọb uwa;<verse eid="NUM 7:51" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="NUM 7:52" />akpoebod keed nte uwa idiọọkñkpọ;<verse eid="NUM 7:52" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="NUM 7:53" />abaakenañ iba, akukịmedọñ ition, akpoebod ition ye ñyịn akukịmedọñ ition ekponno ekem se ekama enam uwa ewuana.</para>
  <para style="li4" vid="NUM 7:53">Ami akedo enọ Elisama ayịn Amihud.<verse eid="NUM 7:53" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="NUM 7:54" />Ke ayọhọ usen itiaita Kamaliel ayịn Pedasọ, adadusʌñ ke esiin Manase, amaaben enọ amọ adi.<verse eid="NUM 7:54" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="NUM 7:55" />Enọ amọ akedo:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 7:55">usan silfa keed akedoppoke sekel ikie keed mme edịb mme duob, mme ntəño usan usiime ñkpọ silfa keed adoppoke sekel ata mme duob, afịd iba ekesaña ekeene udomo sekel adisana itie, edọñ ataa eti ndomuyo ye adan ọlif nte enọ ñkpasi eyọhọ ammọ keedekeed;<verse eid="NUM 7:55" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="NUM 7:56" />usan kold keed akedoppoke sekel duob, ayọhọ ye insensi;<verse eid="NUM 7:56" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="NUM 7:57" />ñyịn ayaaraenañ keed, akukịmedọñ keed ye ñyịn edọñ isua keed nte ufọfọb uwa;<verse eid="NUM 7:57" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="NUM 7:58" />akpoebod keed nte uwa idiọọkñkpọ;<verse eid="NUM 7:58" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="NUM 7:59" />abaakenañ iba, akukịmedọñ ition, akpoebod ition ye ñyịn akukịmedọñ ition ekponno ekem se ekama enam uwa ewuana.</para>
  <para style="li4" vid="NUM 7:59">Ami akedo enọ Kamaliel ayịn Pedasọ.<verse eid="NUM 7:59" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="NUM 7:60" />Ke ayọhọ usen usʌkkeed Abidan ayịn Kidiọni, adadusʌñ ke esiin Benyamin, amaaben enọ amọ adi.<verse eid="NUM 7:60" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="NUM 7:61" />Enọ uwa amọ akedo:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 7:61">usan silfa keed akedoppoke sekel ikie keed mme edịb mme duob, mme ntəño usan usiime ñkpọ silfa keed akedoppoke sekel ata mme duob, afịd iba ekesaña ekeene udomo sekel adisana itie, edọñ ataa eti ndomuyo ye adan ọlif nte enọ ñkpasi eyọhọ ammọ keedekeed;<verse eid="NUM 7:61" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="NUM 7:62" />usan kold keed akedoppoke sekel duob, ayọhọ ye insensi;<verse eid="NUM 7:62" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="NUM 7:63" />ñyịn ayaaraenañ keed, akukịmedọñ keed ye ñyịn edọñ isua keed nte ufọfọb uwa;<verse eid="NUM 7:63" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="NUM 7:64" />akpoebod keed nte uwa idiọọkñkpọ;<verse eid="NUM 7:64" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="NUM 7:65" />abaakenañ iba, akukịmedọñ ition, akpoebod ition ye ñyịn akukịmedọñ ition ekponno ekem se ekama enam uwa ewuana.</para>
  <para style="li4" vid="NUM 7:65">Ami akedo enọ Abidan ayịn Kidiọni.<verse eid="NUM 7:65" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="NUM 7:66" />Ke ayọhọ usen duob Ahiesa ayịn Amisadai, adadusʌñ ke esiin Daan, amaaben enọ amọ adi.<verse eid="NUM 7:66" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="NUM 7:67" />Enọ amọ akedo:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 7:67">usan silfa keed akedoppoke sekel ikie keed mme edịb mme duob, ye ntəño usan usiime ñkpọ silfa keed adoppoke sekel ata mme duob, afịd iba ekesaña ekeene udomo sekel adisana itie, edọñ ataa eti ndomuyo ye adan ọlif nte enọ ñkpasi eyọhọ ammọ keedekeed;<verse eid="NUM 7:67" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="NUM 7:68" />usan kold keed akedoppoke sekel duob, ayọhọ ye insensi;<verse eid="NUM 7:68" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="NUM 7:69" />ñyịn ayaaraenañ keed, akukịmedọñ keed ye ñyịn edọñ isua keed nte ufọfọb uwa;<verse eid="NUM 7:69" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="NUM 7:70" />akpoebod keed nte uwa idiọọkñkpọ;<verse eid="NUM 7:70" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="NUM 7:71" />abaakenañ iba, akukịmedọñ ition, akpoebod ition ye ñyịn akukịmedọñ ition ekponno ekem se ekama enam uwa ewuana.</para>
  <para style="li4" vid="NUM 7:71">Ami akedo enọ Ahiesa ayịn Amisadai.<verse eid="NUM 7:71" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="NUM 7:72" />Ke ayọhọ usen duob mme keed Pakiel ayịn Okran, adadusʌñ ke esiin Asaa, amaaben enọ amọ adi.<verse eid="NUM 7:72" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="NUM 7:73" />Enọ amọ akedo:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 7:73">usan silfa keed akedoppoke sekel ikie keed mme edịb mme duob, ye ntəño usan usiime ñkpọ silfa keed adoppoke sekel ata mme duob, afịd iba ekesaña ekeene udomo sekel adisana itie, edọñ ataa eti ndomuyo ye adan ọlif nte enọ ñkpasi eyọhọ ammọ keedekeed;<verse eid="NUM 7:73" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="NUM 7:74" />usan kold keed akedoppoke sekel duob, ayọhọ ye insensi;<verse eid="NUM 7:74" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="75" style="v" sid="NUM 7:75" />ñyịn ayaaraenañ keed, akukịmedọñ keed ye ñyịn edọñ isua keed nte ufọfọb uwa;<verse eid="NUM 7:75" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="76" style="v" sid="NUM 7:76" />akpoebod keed nte uwa idiọọkñkpọ;<verse eid="NUM 7:76" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="77" style="v" sid="NUM 7:77" />abaakenañ iba, akukịmedọñ ition, akpoebod ition ye ñyịn akukịmedọñ ition ekpoono ekem se ekama enam uwa ewuana.</para>
  <para style="li4" vid="NUM 7:77">Ami akedo enọ Pakiel ayịn Okran.<verse eid="NUM 7:77" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="78" style="v" sid="NUM 7:78" />Ke ayọhọ usen duob mme iba Ahira ayịn Enan, adadusʌñ ke esiin Naftali, amaaben enọ amọ adi.<verse eid="NUM 7:78" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="79" style="v" sid="NUM 7:79" />Enọ amọ akedo:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 7:79">usan silfa keed akedoppoke sekel ikie keed mme edịb mme duob, ye ntəño usan usiime ñkpọ silfa keed akedoppoke sekel ata mme duob, afịd iba ekesaña ekeene udomo sekel adisana itie, edọñ ataa eti ndomuyo mme adan ọlif nte enọ ñkpasi eyọhọ ammọ keedekeed;<verse eid="NUM 7:79" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="80" style="v" sid="NUM 7:80" />usan kold keed akedoppoke sekel duob, ayọhọ ye insensi;<verse eid="NUM 7:80" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="81" style="v" sid="NUM 7:81" />ñyịn ayaaraenañ keed, akukịmedọñ keed ye ñyịn edọñ isua keed nte ufọfọb uwa;<verse eid="NUM 7:81" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="82" style="v" sid="NUM 7:82" />akpoebod keed nte uwa idiọọkñkpọ;<verse eid="NUM 7:82" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="83" style="v" sid="NUM 7:83" />abaakenañ iba, akukịmedọñ ition, akpoebod ition ye ñyịn akukịmedọñ ition ekponno ekem se ekama enam uwa ewuana.</para>
  <para style="li4" vid="NUM 7:83">Ami akedo enọ Ahira ayịn Enan.<verse eid="NUM 7:83" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="84" style="v" sid="NUM 7:84" />Mme enọ mme adadusʌñ nditọ Isrel ke usen adidiọñ akpokoro uwa asaña-asaña, ke ini ekeyette adan edo ami:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 7:84">usan silfa duob mme iba, ntəño usan usiime ñkpọ silfa duob mme iba ye ako a-kold duob mme iba. <verse eid="NUM 7:84" /><verse number="85" style="v" sid="NUM 7:85" />Usan silfa keedekeed akedoppoke sekel ikie mme edịb mme duob, ntəño usan usiime ñkpọ keedekeed akedo sekel ata mme duob. Ke afịd-afịd, mme ako silfa ekedoppo tọsịn sekel iba mme ikie inaañ,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:85 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A-adooho ñkpọ nte kilokram 28</char></note> akeene udomo sekel adisana itie. <verse eid="NUM 7:85" /><verse number="86" style="v" sid="NUM 7:86" />Mme ako a-kold duob mme iba ado ekeyọhọ ye insensi ekedoppoke sekel duoboduob, akeene udomo sekel adisana itie. Ke afịd-afịd, mme ako a-kold ekedoppo sekel ikie keed mme edịb.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:86 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A-adooho ñkpọ nte kilokram mbaak keed ke itie inañ (1.4)</char></note><verse eid="NUM 7:86" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="87" style="v" sid="NUM 7:87" />Afịd ibad unam se ekekama enam ufọfọb uwa ekedo ñyaaraenañ duob mme iba, akukịmedọñ duob mme iba ye ñkpʌk ñyịn akukịmedọñ isua keed duob mme iba, edian mme enọ ñkpasi ammọ. Ekekama akpoebod duob mme iba enam uwa idiọọkñkpọ.<verse eid="NUM 7:87" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="88" style="v" sid="NUM 7:88" />Afịd ibad unam se ekekama enam uwa ewuana ekedo abaakenañ edịb mme inaañ, akukịmedọñ ata, akpoebod ata ye ñkpʌk ñyịn akukịmedọñ isua keed ata.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="NUM 7:88" />
  <para style="li4" vid="NUM 7:88">Mme enọ e-ekekamake ediọñ akpokoro uwa ke emaekeyet adan ado ami.<verse eid="NUM 7:88" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="89" style="v" sid="NUM 7:89" />Ke Moses akedʌkkọ atayad mbono adikitañ ikọ ye <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, anye amaakop uyio naña atañ ikọ anọ anye ke ufọọd itie mme serubim iba ke anyọñ itie ikpeghe usio isob ke anyọñ akebe edioomo mbed. <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akedat utọ usʌñ ado atañ ikọ anọ anye.<verse eid="NUM 7:89" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="NUM 8" />
  <para style="s1">Adibono Mme Utuenikañ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 8:1" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Moses ate, <verse eid="NUM 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 8:2" />“Tañ nọ Erọn nyʌñ dọkkọ anye bo, ‘Afo umaudomo mme utuenikañ, kịt bo ke afịd utuenikañ itiaba ado esịn unwana ke mbeñ iso ñkpọ udodikañ.’ ”<verse eid="NUM 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 8:3" />Erọn amaanam ntoro, anye amaadomo mme utuenikañ abon nọ ese mbeñ iso ñkpọ udodikañ, kpa naña <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> aketañ anọ Moses. <verse eid="NUM 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 8:4" />Naña ekenam ñkpọ udodikañ ado ami: Ekekama kold e-emiahamia, tọọñọ ke idak tutu asịm anyọñ. Ekenam ñkpọ udodikañ ado ukem-ukem usʌñ naña <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akewọt Moses.<verse eid="NUM 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Adisio Mme Lifai Nnịm Asaña-Asaña</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 8:5" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Moses ate: <verse eid="NUM 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 8:6" />“Sịññe mme Lifai kpọñ afịd nditọ Isrel nyʌñ nam ammọ esana. <verse eid="NUM 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 8:7" />Naña afo adiinam ammọ esana ado ami: Siime ammọ mmọọñ adinam asana ke idem, ndin nam ammọ ekwat afịd ided ke idem ammọ enyʌñ eyet afọñ ammọ. Ntom ke ammọ ediinam idem ammọ asana. <verse eid="NUM 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 8:8" />Nam ammọ edat ñyịn ayaaraenañ ye enọ ñkpasi ake ataa eti ndomuyo e-ewuaha ye adan ọlif, ndin ana afo adat ayọhọ ñyịn ayaaraenañ iba se ekama enam uwa idiọọkñkpọ.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Akeme ido uwa enọ adinam asana; se ñko ke Nọmba 8:12</char></note> <verse eid="NUM 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 8:9" />Dat mme Lifai di ke iso atayad mbono nyʌñ bok afịd esiin Isrel ke itie keed. <verse eid="NUM 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 8:10" />Ana afo aben mbon Lifai adi ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, ndin yak nditọ Isrel edot ammọ ubọk. <verse eid="NUM 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 8:11" />Erọn ana aben mme Lifai awọt ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> nte ufọfʌñ uwa a-atooho nditọ Isrel, nọ ammọ ekan enam utom <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.<verse eid="NUM 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 8:12" />“Ndin ana mme Lifai edot ubọk ammọ ke iwuod ñyaaraenañ,eben keed enam uwa idiọọkñkpọ enọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> enyʌñ eben anye ako enam ufọfọb uwa, adinam ñkpeubọk nnọọ mme Lifai. <verse eid="NUM 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 8:13" />Nam mme Lifai eda ke iso Erọn ye nditọ amọ, ndin nyʌñ ben ammọ wọt nte ufọfʌñ uwa nnọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="NUM 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 8:14" />Ke utọ usʌñ ami ke afo uduubakka mme Lifai usio unịm asaña-asaña ke atu nditọ Isrel mbon ñko. Ndin mme Lifai ediido ake mmi.<verse eid="NUM 8:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 8:15" />“Ke afo amaakenam mme Lifai esana anyʌñ aben ammọ awọt nte ufọfʌñ uwa ama, ammọ ana edi edinam utom ammọ ke atayad mbono. <verse eid="NUM 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 8:16" />Ammọ edo mbon Isrel a-anaaha eyaak ennọ miin afịd-afịd. Ami mmedat ammọ ke iwuod mme akpan, mme akpa nditọ ideen nto afịd ibaan ke Isrel. <verse eid="NUM 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 8:17" />Afịd akpan ke Isrel, me ake awo me ake unam, annie miin. Ami mmaasio ammọ nnịm nnọ idem mmi ke ini ñkesoboke afịd akpan ke isọñ Iyib. <verse eid="NUM 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 8:18" />Ndin ami mmedat mme Lifai ke itie mme afịd akpan ke Isrel. <verse eid="NUM 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 8:19" />Ami mmeyaak mme Lifai nnọ Erọn ye nditọ amọ ideen nte mme enọ ansioho nto atu nditọ Isrel, nọ enam utom ke atayad mbono ke iwuod nditọ Isrel, enyʌñ enam ñkpeubọk enọ ammọ mbaak udọñọ ñkpa adisobo nditọ Isrel ke ini ammọ esañake ekpere adisana itie.”<verse eid="NUM 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 8:20" />Moses, Erọn ye afịd esob Isrel emaenam ye mme Lifai naña <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> aketemme Moses. <verse eid="NUM 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 8:21" />Mme Lifai emaenam idem ammọ esana enyʌñ eyet mme afọñ ammọ. Ndin Erọn amaaben ammọ anọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> nte ufọfʌñ uwa ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> anyʌñ anam ñkpeubọk anọ ammọ anyʌñ anam ammọ esana. <verse eid="NUM 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 8:22" />Ado akekweeñe, mme Lifai emaedi ke atayad mbono edinam utom ammọ ke ndadusʌñ Erọn ye nditọ ideen amọ. Ammọ emaenam ye mme Lifai kpa naña <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akenọọ Moses uyio.<verse eid="NUM 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 8:23" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaadọkkọ Moses ate, <verse eid="NUM 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 8:24" />“Anyem abaña mme Lifai; yak ideen e-edooho isua edịb mme ition me ekanna ado enam utom ke atayad mbono. <verse eid="NUM 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 8:25" />Ado yak ammọ etre utom emaeyọhọ isua emana aba mme duob. <verse eid="NUM 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 8:26" />Ammọ ekeme edinwam nditọeka ammọ ke iso utom ammọ ke atayad mbono, ado inaaha ammọ ke idem ammọ enam utom ado. Naña afo adiideeme mme iso utom inọ mme Lifai ado ami.”<verse eid="NUM 8:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="NUM 9" />
  <para style="s1">Nsaña Mboiyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 9:1" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaatañ ikọ anọ Moses ke Akpautatan Sainai ke akpa afiọñ ke ayọhọ isua iba ke ammọ emaekewuọ ekpọñ Iyib. Anye amaabo, <verse eid="NUM 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 9:2" />“Nam nditọ Isrel edia Usọrọ Nsaña Mboiyo ke ini ekenịmme. <verse eid="NUM 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 9:3" />Inam usọrọ ado ke ini amọ, ke usuuhọ ndubiayio ke ayọhọ usen duob mme inaañ ke afiọñ ami, akeene afịd mme mbed ye item amọ.” <verse eid="NUM 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 9:4" />Ndin Moses amaadọkkọ nditọ Isrel abo enam Usọrọ Nsaña Mboiyo, <verse eid="NUM 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 9:5" />ammọ emaenyʌñ enam usọrọ Nsaña Mboiyo ke Akpautatan Sainai ke usuuhọ ndubiayio ke ayọhọ usen duob mme inaañ ke akpa afiọñ. Nditọ Isrel emaenam afịd ñkpọ kpa naña <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akenọọ Moses uyio.<verse eid="NUM 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 9:6" />Ado ubaak ammọ ikikanna inam Usọrọ Nsaña Mboiyo ke usen ado sia ammọ ikisanake ke ntak akpo awo a-akebaaha ke atu ammọ. Ndin ammọ emaekaa ebịne Moses ye Erọn kpa usen ado <verse eid="NUM 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 9:7" />enyʌñ ekebo Moses ete, “Ñnyịn isanake ke ntak akpo awo, ado nsoo ido yak ikpan ñnyịn edinọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> enọ ñnyịn ukem nte nditọ Isrel mbon ñko ke ini amaakem?”<verse eid="NUM 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 9:8" />Moses amaabọọrọ ammọ abo, “Ibet tutu ami mbịp nto <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> me nsoo ke anye atemme ibaña ndufo.”<verse eid="NUM 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 9:9" />Ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaadọkkọ Moses ate, <verse eid="NUM 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 9:10" />“Dọkkọ nditọ Isrel bo: ‘Ini akeedodo awo ke atu ndufo me ubon ndufo imiisanake ke ntak akpo awo me ekeka isañ, ammọ ediisʌk inanam Usọrọ Nsaña Mboiyo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, <verse eid="NUM 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 9:11" />ado yak ammọ enam anye ke ayọhọ usen duob mme inaañ ke ayọhọ afiọñ iba ke ñkịmnsiere. Ammọ enie edita ñkpʌk ñyịn edọñ ye uyo a-yiis imiisịneke ye idod mfañ. <verse eid="NUM 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 9:12" />Ammọ inaaha esʌhọ ñkpọ ndomokeed nọ ayio asiere me ebuuñ akpọ ndomokeed. Ammọ ana etʌm afịd edu adinam ke ini ediaha Usọrọ Nsaña Mboiyo. <verse eid="NUM 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 9:13" />Ado akpeba awo a-adooho a-asana inyʌññọ ika isañ ado atre adidia Usọrọ Nsaña Mboiyo, yak esio utọ awo ado ke atu aduuk ammọ sia ammọ esịn edinọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> enọ ke ini ekemekke enịm. Ammọ eyaekpe utịb idiọọkñkpọ ammọ.<verse eid="NUM 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 9:14" />“ ‘Asenawo a-adʌññọ ke atu ndufo akeme adidia Usọrọ Nsaña Mboiyo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akeene mme mbed ye mme item amọ. Ana ndufo enịm ukem edu adinam ami enọ afịd awo, me ado asenawo me ado amanaisọñ.’ ”<verse eid="NUM 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ntọñanyọñ ke Anyọñ Tabanakịd Abasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 9:15" />Ke usen e-ekesioho tabanakịd, atayad edioomo mbed ewuuk, ntọñanyọñ amaafʌk anye. Tọọñọ ke ndubiayio tutu ubakusen ntọñanyọñ se ikiba ke anyọñ tabanakịd Abasi akeba nte ikañ. <verse eid="NUM 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 9:16" />Amaakaa iso aba ntom; ntọñanyọñ amaafʌk anye, ndin ke akonayio anye amaakappa aba nte ikañ. <verse eid="NUM 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 9:17" />Ini akeedodo a-ntọñanyọñ ado akedịppeke idem akpọñ atayad, nditọ Isrel emaetọọñọ isañ, itie akeedodo se ntọñanyọñ ado aketuak ada, nditọ Isrel emaewuuk atayad. <verse eid="NUM 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 9:18" />Ke uyio <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Isrel emaetọọñọ isañ, ndin ke uyio amọ, ammọ emaenyʌñ ewuuk atayad. Ini akeedodo a-ntọñanyọñ akekaaha iso adoro ke anyọñ tabanakịd, Isrel emaesọñ eba ke nnaaekọñ. <verse eid="NUM 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 9:19" />Ntọñanyọñ amaadoro ke anyọñ atayad Abasi akpeene, mbon Isrel emaenịm ewʌhọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> inyʌññọ idakka isañ. <verse eid="NUM 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 9:20" />Ubaak ini ntọñanyọñ akesiba ke anyọñ tabanakịd ke ibad-ibad usen; ke uyio <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ammọ eyaenam nnaaekọñ, ndin kpa ke uyio amọ Isrel emaenyʌñ edakka isañ. <verse eid="NUM 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 9:21" />Ubaak ini ntọñanyọñ akesiba tọọñọ ndubiayio tutu ubakusen kpọd, ndin anye amaadịppe idem ubakusen, ammọ etọọñọ isañ. Me ado uweemeayio me ado akonayio, ini akeedodo a-ntọñanyọñ akedịppeke idem, ammọ emaedaaña isañ. <verse eid="NUM 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 9:22" />Me ntọñanyọñ akeba ke anyọñ tabanakịd ke usen iba me afiọñ keed me isua keed, nditọ Isrel eyaeba ke nnaaekọñ, inyʌññọ idakka isañ. <verse eid="NUM 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 9:23" />Ke uyio <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ammọ emaenam nnaaekọñ, ndin ke uyio <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ammọ enyʌñ edaaña isañ. Ammọ emaenịm ewʌhọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, akeene uyio a-anye akenọọhọ ato Moses.<verse eid="NUM 9:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="NUM 10" />
  <para style="s1">Mme Adukpoñ Silfa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 10:1" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Moses ate: <verse eid="NUM 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 10:2" />“Nam adukpoñ silfa iba ndin kama ammọ koot esob bok nyʌñ kama nam ammọ edakka isañ. <verse eid="NUM 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 10:3" />Emaefịt ammọ naña iba, afịd abio ana ewuọñọ edisoobo ke iso mfo ke inuausʌñ atayad mbono. <verse eid="NUM 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 10:4" />Ekpefịt adukpoñ keed, mme adadusʌñ, e-edooho mme adaiwuod ke mme aduuk Isrel, enie adiwuọñọ ndisoobo ke iso mfo. <verse eid="NUM 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 10:5" />Emaeduat adukpoñ ke akpọsọñ uyio, mme esiin Isrel e-ebaaha ke usakkautịn ana etọọñọ ewuọñọ. <verse eid="NUM 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 10:6" />Emaeduat adukpoñ ayọhọ akañ iba ana mbon se ibañña ke usuuk edakka isañ. Uyio adukpoñ adiido idiọọñọ adidakka isañ. <verse eid="NUM 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 10:7" />Emaeyem mme awo ewuọ eboho itie keed, yak efịt mme adukpoñ, ado ke efịt ye idiọọñọ adidakka isañ.<verse eid="NUM 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 10:8" />“Nditọ Erọn, mme aku, enie edifịt mme adukpoñ. Yak ami ado ewʌhọ ke nsi-nsi inọ ndufo ye mme emana ke iso. <verse eid="NUM 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 10:9" />Ndufo emaekaa ekọñ ke isọñ abio ndufo ye asua i-ifiighe ndufo, iduat mme adukpoñ. Ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ayaitoiyo ndufo anyʌñ ifak asio ke ubọk mme asua. <verse eid="NUM 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 10:10" />Ñko ke ini idaara ndufo ye asaña-asaña ini usọrọ ndia ye usọrọ Ufa Afiọñ, ana ndufo efịt mme adukpoñ enọ mme ufọfọb uwa ye mme uwa ewuana, ndin ammọ eyaedo mme ñkpọ aditoiyo inọ ndufo ke iso Abasi. Ami ndo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo.”<verse eid="NUM 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nditọ Isrel Ekpọñ Sainai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 10:11" />Ke ayọhọ usen duob mme iba ke ayọhọ afiọñ iba ke ayọhọ isua iba, ntọñanyọñ amaadịppe idem akpọñ anyọñ tabanakịd akebe edioomo. <verse eid="NUM 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 10:12" />Ndin nditọ Isrel emaetọọñọ isañ eto Akpautatan Sainai ekewuọ mme itie mme itie tutu ntọñanyọñ aketuak ada ke Akpautatan Paran. <verse eid="NUM 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 10:13" />Ammọ emaedakka isañ, ke akpa ini ami, ato uyio <char style="nd">A-Abọọñ</char> akenọọhọ Moses.<verse eid="NUM 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 10:14" />Mme ikpeghe nnaaekọñ ake Yuda eketo edakka isañ, ke idak ñkpọ idiọọñọ ammọ. Nasọn ayịn Aminadab akedat ammọ usʌñ. <verse eid="NUM 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 10:15" />Natandiel ayịn Suaa akedat ikpeghe esiin Isaka usʌñ, <verse eid="NUM 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 10:16" />ndin Eliab ayịn Helọn akekara ikpeghe esiin Sebulọn. <verse eid="NUM 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 10:17" />Ndin emaedooro tabanakịd enịm, ndin mbon Kesọn ye mbon Merari, e-ekebiommo anye emaetọọñọ isañ.<verse eid="NUM 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 10:18" />Mme ikpeghe nnaaekọñ ake Rubịn ekediana, ke idak ñkpọ idiọọñọ ammọ. Elisọ ayịn Sedọọ akedat ammọ usʌñ. <verse eid="NUM 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 10:19" />Selumiel ayịn Surisadai akekara ikpeghe esiin Simiọn, <verse eid="NUM 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 10:20" />Eliasaf ayịn Dewel akekara ikpeghe esiin Kad. <verse eid="NUM 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 10:21" />Ndin mbon Kohad emaedakka isañ, ekama mme ndisana ñkpọ. Akena esio tabanakịd ewuuk mbemiso ammọ ediwuọ.<verse eid="NUM 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 10:22" />Ndin mme ikpeghe nnaaekọñ Ifrem ekesaña ediana, ke idak ñkpọ idiọọñọ ammọ. Elisama ayịn Amihud akeda iwuod. <verse eid="NUM 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 10:23" />Kamaliel ayịn Pedasọ akeda iwuod ke ikpeghe esiin Manase, <verse eid="NUM 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 10:24" />Abidan ayịn Kidiọni akeda iwuod ke ikpeghe esiin Benyamin.<verse eid="NUM 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 10:25" />Ke akpatre, mme ikpeghe nnaaekọñ Daan emaedakka, nte mme andikpeme edem afịd ikpeghe mbon ñko, ke idak ñkpọ idiọọñọ ammọ. Ahiesa ayịn Amisadai akeda iwuod. <verse eid="NUM 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 10:26" />Pakiel ayịn Okran akeda iwuod ke ikpeghe esiin Asaa, <verse eid="NUM 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 10:27" />ndin Ahira ayịn Enan akeda iwuod ke ikpeghe esiin Naftali. <verse eid="NUM 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 10:28" />Usʌñ naña mme ikpeghe nditọ Isrel ekesaña ke udịm ewuọñọ akedo ado.<verse eid="NUM 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 10:29" />Akema Moses amaabo Hobab ayịn Rewel awo Midian, ete anwaan Moses ate, “Ñnyịn ibiiwuọ ikaa itie <char style="nd">A-Abọọñ</char> aketañña abaña ibo ñnyịn, ‘Ami ñyaaben anye inọ ndufo.’ Di yak ñnyịn isaña keed ika ndin ñnyịn iyainam nọ afọn ye afo, sia <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaanwọñọ adinọ Isrel nti ñkpọ.”<verse eid="NUM 10:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 10:30" />Anye amaabọọrọ Moses abo, “Iyoo, ndiikaaha; mbo ntịmme ñnyọñ abio mmi mbịne ubon mmi.”<verse eid="NUM 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 10:31" />Ado Moses amaabo anye, “Mbọk kuukpọñ ñnyịn. Afo amediọọñọ itie nte ñnyịn ikeme adiba ke anaan, ndin afo ayaado anyen inọ ñnyịn. <verse eid="NUM 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 10:32" />Adieke afo ikeeneke ñnyịn akaa, ñnyịn iyaideeme ye afo se utọ nti ñkpọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> inọọhọ ñnyịn.”<verse eid="NUM 10:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 10:33" />Do ndin ammọ emaedakka eto ekamba abod <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> enyʌñ esaña ke usen ita. Akebe edioomo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akebem ammọ iso ke usen ita ado nọ ayem itie nduọkadudu anọ ammọ. <verse eid="NUM 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 10:34" />Ntọñanyọñ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaaba ke anyọñ ammọ ke uweemeayio ke ini ammọ ekekpọññọ nnaaekọñ.<verse eid="NUM 10:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 10:35" />Ke ini akeedodo a-akebe edioomo akedakkake isañ, Moses amaabo ate,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 10:35">“<char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Dakka da!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 10:35">Yak mme asua mfo esuana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 10:35">yak mbon usua mfo efeeñe ke iso mfo.”<verse eid="NUM 10:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 10:36" />Ke ini akeedodo a-anye akesọññọ ada, Moses amaabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 10:36">“<char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Tịmme di keene,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 10:36">ananaibad tọsịn nditọ Isrel.”<verse eid="NUM 10:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="NUM 11" />
  <para style="s1">Ikañ A-atooho <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 11:1" />Akem, nditọ Isrel emaedukuunọ ebaña ufen se ammọ ekekịt yak <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akop, ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akekop ammọ iyadesịd amọ amaabịmme. Ndin ikañ amaato <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> abịppe ke atu ammọ anyʌñ asobo ubaak itie nnaa. <verse eid="NUM 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 11:2" />Ke nditọ Isrel emaekebọñ eseeme ikoot Moses, anye amaabọñ akam anọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ndin ikañ amaanịme. <verse eid="NUM 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 11:3" />Ndin, ekekoot itie ado Tabera,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tabera awuọñọ adifọp</char></note> sia ikañ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaasak ke atu ammọ.<verse eid="NUM 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Asasa A-atooho <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 11:4" />Mme ndiọi awo ke atu ammọ emaetọọñọ adiyem utọ ndidia mfen, ndin nditọ Isrel emaetọọñọ ayịd enyʌñ ebo ete, “Akpekapado ñnyịn imikịt unam ita! <verse eid="NUM 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 11:5" />Ñnyịn imitoiyo mme iyak a-ñnyịn ikitaaha ke mfọn ke Iyib, ye mme kukumba, mme ikon, mme ayịmeto, mme ayịm, ye mme kalik. <verse eid="NUM 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 11:6" />Ado idahami, ndidia i-idooro ñnyịn sia ñnyịn ikịtte ñkpọ se idia ibọhọke mana ami!”<verse eid="NUM 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 11:7" />Mana akeba nte ñkpasi korianda anyʌñ aba anyen nte resịn. <verse eid="NUM 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 11:8" />Mme awo emaesaña etañ anye, ndin ekọk ke ukọkñkpọ ubọk enyʌñ etetịm ke udʌñ. Ammọ eketem anye ke ako enyʌñ enam anye nte mme eboho uyo. Ndin anye akesiba awo ke inua nte ñkpọ e-ekamake adan ọlif enam. <verse eid="NUM 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 11:9" />Ke ini mbara akeduọkkọke ke itie nnaa ke akonayio, mana amaakeene aduọ.<verse eid="NUM 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 11:10" />Moses amaakop naña mme awo ke afịd ubon etuaha ke inuausʌñ atayad ammọ. Ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaanekke ayat esịd, ndin ami amaafịna Moses. <verse eid="NUM 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 11:11" />Moses amaabịp <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> abo, “Nsoo ido nọ afo aben mfịna ami adot awo mfo ke idem? Nsoo ke ami nnam i-imuunemme fiin esịd nọ afo aben mbiomo afịd ibon ami andot miin ke iwuod? <verse eid="NUM 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 11:12" />Ado nte ami ñkeyommo afịd ibon ami? Ado nte ami ñkeman afịd ammọ? Afo anam die abo yak ami ñkama ammọ ke ekaubọk, nte adeb akama nsekayịn ñka isọñ a-afo akenwọñọke adinọ mme eteete ammọ? <verse eid="NUM 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 11:13" />Ke mmọọ ke ami ndiikan ñkịt unam nnọ afịd ibon ami? Ammọ eka iso etua ennọ miin ebo, ‘Inọ ñnyịn unam nọ ita!’ <verse eid="NUM 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 11:14" />Ami ñkanna mbiom mbiomo afịd ibon ami ikpọọñ; mbiomo ami adoppo añkan miin. <verse eid="NUM 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 11:15" />Akpedo naña afo ayem innam miin ado ami, mbọk, ñwot miin sio akañ keed, adieke ñkịtte mfọn ke iso mfo, kuuyak ami ñkịt nsobo mmi.”<verse eid="NUM 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 11:16" />Akema <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Moses: “Ben mme ñkpisọñ Isrel ata mme duob a-afo adiọọñọke nte adadusʌñ ye adaaha ke atu nditọ Isrel di. Nam nọ ammọ edʌk edi ke atayad mbono, ndin yak ammọ eda do ye afo. <verse eid="NUM 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 11:17" />Ami ñyaasọiyọ ndi nditañ ikọ ye afo do, ami ñyaanyʌñ ndat ubaak adudu Sịbidịd a-abaaha ke idem mfo ndot ammọ. Ammọ eyaewuana ye afo ebiom mbiomo mbon awo mbaak afo udubiom anye ikpọọñ.<verse eid="NUM 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 11:18" />“Dọkkọ nditọ Isrel bo, ‘Inịm idem ndufo asana, ibeeñe idem inọ ñkpọñ, a-ndufo ediita unam. <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaakop naña ndufo etuaha ebo, “Akpekapado ñnyịn imikịt unam ita! Amaafọn ye ñnyịn ke Iyib akan ami!” Idahami <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ayainọ ndufo unam, ndufo eyaenyʌñ eta anye. <verse eid="NUM 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 11:19" />Idooho usen keed, me usen iba, me usen ition, duob me edịb, <verse eid="NUM 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 11:20" />ado eyaeta ke afịd afiọñ tutu anye adiwuọñọ ndufo ke aduiwuo, anyʌñ itek ndufo esịd sia ndufo emesịn <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, a-abaaha ke atu ndufo, enyʌñ etua ke iso amọ ebo, “Nsoo ikinam nọ ñnyịn iwuọ ikpọñ Iyib?” ’ ”<verse eid="NUM 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 11:21" />Ado Moses amaabo, “Se ami mi ke ufọọd ideen tọsịn ikie itiokeed e-esañake ke ukod, ndin afo abo, ‘Ami ñyaanọ ammọ unam nọ eta ke afịd afiọñ keed!’ <verse eid="NUM 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 11:22" />Akpọkọm ekpewot afịd udịmedọñ ye afịd mme udịmenañ ami me akpaakem se afịd ammọ eta? Ekpemʌm afịd iyak ke mmọọñ akpainyañ akpaakem afịd ammọ?”<verse eid="NUM 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 11:23" />Ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabọọrọ Moses abo, “Ado nte ubọk <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> aməho abọhọ? Do ndin afo ayaakịt me se ami ntañ ayaawuọ asu unọ fiin.”<verse eid="NUM 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 11:24" />Ndin Moses amaawuọ akedọkkọ afịd awo se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> aketañ. Anye amaakoono mme ñkpisọñ ata mme duob anyʌñ anam nọ ammọ eda ekanna atayad. <verse eid="NUM 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 11:25" />Akema <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaasọiyọ adi ke ntọñanyọñ aditañ ikọ ye anye, anyʌñ adat usʌk adudu Sịbidịd a-akebaaha anye ke idem adot mme ñkpisọñ ata mme duob ado. Ke ini Sịbidịd ado amaakedoro ammọ ke idem, ammọ emaetañ brọfesi, ado ammọ ikikaaha iso inam ntoro aba.<verse eid="NUM 11:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 11:26" />Ado, ideen iba, a-anyịñ ammọ akedooho Eldad ye Medad, emaesọñ eba ke nnaaekọñ. Emaewet anyịñ ammọ esịn ke atu mme ñkpisọñ, ado ammọ ikiwuọhọ ikpọñ atayad. Kpayeado, Sịbidịd amaanyʌñ adoro ammọ ke idem, ndin ammọ emaetañ brọfesi ke itie nnaaekọñ. <verse eid="NUM 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 11:27" />Akparawa keed amaafeghe akedọkkọ Moses abo, “Eldad ye Medad esʌk etañ brọfesi ke itie nnaa.”<verse eid="NUM 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 11:28" />Yọsua, ayịn Nọn, a-akedooho asañautom anọ Moses tọọñọ ke uyịn, amaabo Moses ate, “abọọñ mmi, Moses, kpan ammọ!”<verse eid="NUM 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 11:29" />Ado Moses amaabọọrọ ate, “Ado nte afo abọ ufịb mmi afịbe? Ami ñkpekap mmama nọ afịd ikọd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> edo mme prọfed, ñko yak <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akpedot Sịbidịd amọ ke idem ammọ!” <verse eid="NUM 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 11:30" />Ndin Moses ye mme ñkpisọñ Isrel emaetịmme enyọñ ekaa itie nnaaekọñ.<verse eid="NUM 11:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 11:31" />Ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaasio afịm, ndin anye amaafịm asasa asịññe ke akpainyañ. Afịm amaasuan ammọ ke afịd nnaaekọñ a-akenyọọñọ ñkpọ nte kubid iba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ñkpọ nte ikpad 3 me ñkpọ nte sentimita 90</char></note> tọọñọ ke isọñ kaa anyọñ, ndin anyọọñ usʌñ ñkpọ nte isañ usen keed ke afịd mbeñ itie nnaa. <verse eid="NUM 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 11:32" />Mbon awo emaewuọñọ ekekoono asasa afịd akonayio ye uweemeayio ye ke udiana usen. Ibaaha awo a-akekoonoke nọ asịp akan homa duob.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:32 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ñkpọ nte tọọn 1 3/4 me metrịk tọọn 1.6</char></note> Ndin ammọ emaesuan ammọ ekanna eyọhọ itie nnaa. <verse eid="NUM 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 11:33" />Ado naña unam ado akesʌkkọ atotuuk ammọ eded, mbemiso ammọ ekap etata, ataa ifiobesịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabịmme ye ammọ, ndin anye amaasobo ammọ ye ataa idiọọk udọñọ. <verse eid="NUM 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 11:34" />Ke ntoro emaeben itie ado ekoot Kibrod Hatafa,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kibrod Hatafa awuọñọ udi udọñ</char></note> sia ke ndo ke ekebuuk mbon se ikidọrọ itọñ iyem ndidia mfen.<verse eid="NUM 11:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 11:35" />Tọọñọ ke Kibrod Hatafa ammọ emaekpọñ ekaa Haserọd enyʌñ ekeba do.<verse eid="NUM 11:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="NUM 12" />
  <para style="s1">Miriam ye Erọn Esọñ Iwuod ye Moses</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 12:1" />Akema Miriam ye Erọn emaetọọñọ editañ idiọọk ikọ ndian Moses ke ntak a-anwaan amọ akedooho awo Kuus, sia anye amaadọ awonwaan Kuus. <verse eid="NUM 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 12:2" />Ammọ emaetañ ebo, “Ado nte Moses ikpọọñ ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> asitañ ikọ anọ? Ado nte <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> isinyʌññọ itañ ikọ inọ ñnyịn?” Ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaakop ami.<verse eid="NUM 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 12:3" />(Ado Moses akedo ataa awo nsuukidem, amaasuuk idem akan afịd awo ke iso isọñ.)<verse eid="NUM 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 12:4" />Inikeed <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaadọkkọ Moses, Erọn ye Miriam abo, “Iwuọñọ idi atayad mbono, afịd ndufo awo ita.” Ke ntoro, ammọ awo ita emaewuọñọ ekaa. <verse eid="NUM 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 12:5" />Ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaasọiyọ adi ke adaaha ntọñanyọñ; anye akeda ke inuausʌñ atayad mbono anyʌñ akoot Erọn ye Miriam. Ke ini ammọ awo iba emaekesaña edida do, <verse eid="NUM 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 12:6" />anye amaabo ammọ ate, “Ikpañ utọñ inọ ikọ mmi:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 12:6">“Ke ini prọfed abaaha ke ufọọd ndufo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 12:6">ami, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, ñyaara idem mmi nnọ anye ke ñkukịd,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 12:6">ami ntañ ikọ nnọ anye ke ndab.<verse eid="NUM 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 12:7" />Ado idooho ntoro ye awo mmi Moses;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 12:7">anye anam akpanikọ ke afịd ufọk mmi.<verse eid="NUM 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 12:8" />Ami ntañ ikọ ye anye iso ye iso,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 12:8">ñnwaña-ñnwaña, idooho ke ñke;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 12:8">anye akịt mbid <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 12:8">Nsoo ido ndin yak ndufo imiikinieghe mbaak</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 12:8">editañ idiọọk ikọ ndian awo mmi Moses?”<verse eid="NUM 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 12:9" />Ifiobesịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabịppe ye ammọ, ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaakpọñ ammọ.<verse eid="NUM 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 12:10" />Ntọñanyọñ akedịppe akpọñ anyọñ atayad, ikpọkidem Miriam amaakappa akpamfia,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ke usem Hibru akpamfia akeda anọ nsio-nsio udọñọ ke ikpọkidem.</char></note> amaakappa asana nte sino. Erọn akekanna iso awọt anye, ndin akịt ke Miriam amaanie idiọọk mfad ke idem, <verse eid="NUM 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 12:11" />Erọn amaabo Moses, “Mbọk, abọọñ mmi, ami mmukpe fiin ubọk, kuudot ñnyịn idiọọkñkpọ a-ñnyịn unamma fiin ke unana iwuod. <verse eid="NUM 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 12:12" />Kuuyak anye aba nte nsekayịn a-akpaaha asịne ke ntʌñidịb eka nọ ubaak ikpọkidem amọ abʌttọ.”<verse eid="NUM 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 12:13" />Moses amaabọñ akam akpeiye <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> abo, “Abasi, mbọk, kọk anye!”<verse eid="NUM 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 12:14" />Ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabọọrọ Moses ate, “Akpedo ete ammọ amaafiat anye etab ke iso, nte anye ikpikịtte abuud ke usen itiaba? Kʌk anye sịn ke itie keed ke mben itie nnaa ado ke usen itiaba; ndin ado amaakweeñe ekeme ediben anye ntịmme ndʌk ndi.” <verse eid="NUM 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 12:15" />Ndin emaekʌk usʌñ itie nnaa ebaha Miriam usen itiaba, ndin mme awo ikidakkake isañ tutu ekeben anye enyọñ edi.<verse eid="NUM 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 12:16" />Ado akeboiyo, nditọ Isrel emaekpọñ Haserọd enyọñ ekeba ke Akpautatan Paran.<verse eid="NUM 12:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="NUM 13" />
  <para style="s1">Uyeb Isọñ Kenan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 13:1" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Moses, <verse eid="NUM 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 13:2" />“Dọñ usʌk ideen nọ eka ekeyep isọñ Kenan, a-ami nnọọhọ nditọ Isrel. Sio keed ke atu mme adadusʌñ ke esiin mme eteete keedekeed dọñ.”<verse eid="NUM 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 13:3" />Ndin ke uyio <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Moses amaatie ke Akpautatan ke Paran adọñ ammọ ekaa. Afịd ammọ ekedo mme adadusʌñ ke Isrel.<verse eid="NUM 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 13:4" />Mme anyịñ ammọ edoñño ami:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="NUM 13:4" />
  <para style="li1" vid="NUM 13:4">ke esiin Rubịn, Samua ayịn Saku;<verse eid="NUM 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 13:5" />ke esiin Simiọn, Safad ayịn Hori;<verse eid="NUM 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 13:6" />ke esiin Yuda, Kaleb ayịn Yefune;<verse eid="NUM 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 13:7" />ke esiin Isaka, Ikal ayịn Yosef;<verse eid="NUM 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 13:8" />ke esiin Ifrem, Hosie ayịn Nọn;<verse eid="NUM 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 13:9" />ke esiin Benyamin, Palti ayịn Rafu;<verse eid="NUM 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 13:10" />ke esiin Sebulọn, Kadiel ayịn Sodi;<verse eid="NUM 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 13:11" />ke esiin Manase (esiin Yosef), Kaddi ayịn Susi;<verse eid="NUM 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 13:12" />ke esiin Daan, Amiel ayịn Kemali;<verse eid="NUM 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 13:13" />ke esiin Asaa, Setọ ayịn Maikel;<verse eid="NUM 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 13:14" />ke esiin Naftali, Nahbi ayịn Fosi;<verse eid="NUM 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 13:15" />ke esiin Kad, Kuel ayịn Maki.<verse eid="NUM 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 13:16" />Mbon ami edoñño anyịñ mbon ake Moses akedọññọ abo ekeyep isọñ ado. (Moses amaanọ Hosie ayịn Nọn anyịñ Yọsua.)<verse eid="NUM 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 13:17" />Ke ini Moses akedọññọ ammọ ate ekeyep Kenan, anye amaabo, “Idọọk ika anyọñ ikanna isaña usʌk-usʌk idọọk ke Nekef abod-abod abio. <verse eid="NUM 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 13:18" />Ise naña isọñ ado aba ye mme awo se idʌñọ do, me edoñño ñkpọsọñ ibon, me edoñño mmeem-mmeem, me iwakka me ewak. <verse eid="NUM 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 13:19" />Nsoo utọ isọñ ke ammọ edʌñọ? Nte isọñ a-afọn me ifọnnọ? Mme abio se ammọ edʌñọ aba die? Me ammọ ebono inwañ me ebọbọp ekanna? <verse eid="NUM 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 13:20" />Isọñ abadie? A-anie ñkpadia me ado ikrọk? Nte mme eto eda ke esịd me idaaha? Idomo ukeme adidat usʌk mfịd eto se ida ke isọñ ado idi.” (Akedo ini a-akpa kreb adatta.)<verse eid="NUM 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 13:21" />Ndin ammọ emaedakka edọọk ekeyep isọñ ado tọọñọ ke Akpautatan Sịn tutu akewuọ Rehob, a-akaaha Lebo Hamad. <verse eid="NUM 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 13:22" />Ammọ emaedakka edọọk esaña eboiyo ke Nekef enyʌñ ediwuọ Hibrọn, itie ake Ahiman, Sesai ye Talmai, mbon ubon Anak, ekedʌñọke. (Emaebọp Hibrọn ñkpọ nte isua itiaba mbemiso Soan ke Iyib.) <verse eid="NUM 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 13:23" />Ke ini ammọ ekewuọhọ Abedeñ Eskol,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Eskol awuọñọ eboho; se ñko ke Nọmba 13:24</char></note> ammọ emaewaak ñkọk e-eboho kreb keed akeyịreke. Awo iba ke atu ammọ emaeben anye edot ke ufọọd eto ebiom, edian ye mme kpomekrened ye fik. <verse eid="NUM 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 13:24" />Ekekoot itie ado Abedeñ Eskol sia mbon Isrel ekekpịkke eboho kreb ke itie ado. <verse eid="NUM 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 13:25" />Ke usen aba amaakeboiyo ammọ emaetịmme enyọñọ uyeb isọñ ado.<verse eid="NUM 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Unọ Ibọọrọ Uyeb Isọñ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 13:26" />Ammọ emaetịmme enyọñọ edibịne Moses ye Erọn ye afịd mbon Isrel ke Kades ke Akpautatan Paran. Ke itie ado ke ammọ ekenọọ afịd mbono mbʌk enyʌñ ewọọt ammọ mme mfịd eto se ito isọñ ado. <verse eid="NUM 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 13:27" />Ndin ammọ emaenọ Moses mbʌk ami: “Ñnyịn imaikaa ikidʌk isọñ a-afo akidọññọ ñnyịn, ndin anye ado isọñ a-afiọọrọke ye mmọọñeba ye adanakwọọk! Se mfịd amọ mi. <verse eid="NUM 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 13:28" />Ado mme awo se idʌñọ do edoñño ñkpọsọñ awo, ndin mme abio ammọ enieñe ndibene enyʌñ enekke ekpoon. Ñnyịn imainyʌñ ikịt mbon ntịppe ubon Anak do. <verse eid="NUM 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 13:29" />Mbon Amalek edʌñọ ke Nekef; mbon Hed, mbon Yebus, ye mbon Amọọ edʌñọ ke abod-abod abio; mbon Kenan edʌñọ ekpere akpainyañ ye ke mben inyañ Yọdan.”<verse eid="NUM 13:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 13:30" />Akema Kaleb amaanam afịd awo edop uyio ke iso Moses anyʌñ abo, “Akpena ñnyịn idọọk ikaa ikidat isọñ ado, sia ñnyịn imine ayọhọ ukeme adinam ado.”<verse eid="NUM 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 13:31" />Ado ideen mfen ekedọọhọ eka ye anye emaebo, “Ñnyịn idiikanna adinwana ye ibon ado; ammọ esọñ adudu ikan ñnyịn.” <verse eid="NUM 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 13:32" />Ndin ammọ emaesuan idiọọk mbʌk ke atu nditọ Isrel ebaña isọñ a-ammọ ekekaaha ekeyep. Ammọ emaebo, “Isọñ a-ñnyịn ikiyeppe adadia mbon se idʌñọ ke esịd. Afịd mbon se ñnyịn ikikịt do ekedoñño ñkpoon-ñkpoon ke idaha. <verse eid="NUM 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 13:33" />Ñnyịn imaikịt mme Nefilim (mbon uko e-etooho ubon Anak eto Nefilim). Ñnyịn ikikịt idem ñnyịn nte mme ataktak ke anyen ñnyịn, ndin ammọ ekenyʌñ ikịt ñnyịn ukem ado ke anyen ammọ.”<verse eid="NUM 13:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="NUM 14" />
  <para style="s1">Nditọ Isrel Esịn Ntịme</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 14:1" />Ke akonayio ado afịd awo ke abio emaebenne uyio ammọ enyʌñ etua akpọsọñ ayịd. <verse eid="NUM 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 14:2" />Afịd nditọ Isrel emaedukuunọ ebaña Moses ye Erọn, ndin afịd atu awo emaebo ammọ, “Akpaakefọn adieke ñnyịn ikikpaññake ke Iyib! Me ke anaan ami! <verse eid="NUM 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 14:3" />Ntak <char style="nd">A-Abọọñ</char> ibenne ñnyịn adi ke isọñ ami nọ ñnyịn ididuọññọ ke akañkañ-a? Eyaeben ibaan ñnyịn ye nditọ ñnyịn nte mbịme. Nte ikpifọnnọ ñnyịn aditịmme ñkaa Iyib?” <verse eid="NUM 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 14:4" />Akema ammọ emaebo emọ-emọ, “Yak ñnyịn imek adadusʌñ itịmme inyọñ ika Iyib.”<verse eid="NUM 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 14:5" />Ndin Moses ye Erọn emaeduọ ekʌp iso ke isọñ ke iso afịd atu nditọ Isrel e-ekebohoke do. <verse eid="NUM 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 14:6" />Yọsua ayịn Nọn ye Kaleb ayịn Yefune, e-ekesịneke ke atu mbon e-ekekaaha uyeb isọñ, emaewak afọñ ammọ <verse eid="NUM 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 14:7" />enyʌñ ebo afịd atu nditọ Isrel, “Isọñ a-ñnyịn ikisañake iboiyo ikaa ikiyep ado ataa eti isọñ. <verse eid="NUM 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 14:8" />Adieke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> anemme esịd ye ñnyịn, anye ayaidat akesịn ke isọñ ado, isọñ a-afiọọrọke ye mmọọñeba ye adanakwọọk, ayaanyʌñ aben inọ ñnyịn. <verse eid="NUM 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 14:9" />Ukweeñe ñkpọ ado ndufo ikiisịn ntịme ye <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. Ikiinyʌñ ifeghe mme mbon e-edʌññọ ke isọñ ado, sia ñnyịn iyaisobo ammọ. Ukpeme ammọ amaakpọñ ammọ, ado <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> mmọdo ye ñnyịn. Ikiiyak ndịk ammọ inam ndufo.”<verse eid="NUM 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 14:10" />Ado afịd atu awo eketañ ebaña aditọọñ ammọ ke itiad. Akema ubọọñ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaasọiyọ ke atayad mbono afịd nditọ Isrel. <verse eid="NUM 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 14:11" /><char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Moses, “Adiikpeene die mbon ami edika iso innọọ miin emiom? Adiikpeene die ammọ editre edinnịm miin ke akpanikọ, kpa ye afịd idiọọñọ a-ami nnamma ke atu ammọ? <verse eid="NUM 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 14:12" />Ami ñyaanọmọ ammọ ye idiọọk udọñọ ñnyʌñ nsobo ammọ, ndin ñyaanam afo ado akpọsọñ idịd akponno akan anyʌñ asọñ idem akan ammọ.”<verse eid="NUM 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 14:13" />Moses amaabo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, “Mbon Iyib eyaekop ebaña ñkpọ ami! Akedat adudu mfo asịññe mbon ami ke atu ammọ. <verse eid="NUM 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 14:14" />Ammọ eyaenyʌñ edọkkọ mbon e-edʌñọke ke isọñ ami ebaña ñkpọ ami. Ammọ e-ekokop ke afo, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, mmọdo ye ibon ami ndin ke afo, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, e-esukịt fiin iso ye iso, ñko ke ntọñanyọñ mfo asida ke anyọñ ammọ, ndin ke afo asisaña ke iso ammọ ye adaaha ntọñanyọñ ke uweemeayio ye ke adaaha ikañ ke akonayio. <verse eid="NUM 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 14:15" />Adieke afo awotto afịd ibon ami, uyakka ndomokeed adu uwem, mme idịd e-ekekoppo mbʌk ami ubaña fiin eyaebo, <verse eid="NUM 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 14:16" />‘<char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ikikanna iben ammọ ikisịn ke isọñ a-anye akenwọñọke anọ ammọ, ke ntak ado anye amaawoot ammọ ke anaan.’<verse eid="NUM 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 14:17" />“Idahami adudu Abọọñ akpekap awuọ awọt idem, kpa naña afo amaaketañ ate: <verse eid="NUM 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 14:18" />‘<char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> isọppọ iyadesịd, ado awak ima anyʌñ afeen idiọọkñkpọ ye nsọñiwuod. Ndin anye itreke adimia mme adueñkpọ ufen; ndin anye amaamia nditọ ufen ke idiọọkñkpọ mme ete tutu asịm emana ayọhọ ita ye ayọhọ inaañ.’ <verse eid="NUM 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 14:19" />Nte asañake akekem ye ekamba ima mfo, feen idiọọkñkpọ mbon ami, kpa naña afo akedakka anọọ ammọ tọọñọ ke ini ammọ ekekpọññọ Iyib tutu awuọ idahami.”<verse eid="NUM 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 14:20" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabọọrọ ate, “Ami mmefeen nnọ ammọ, naña afo akebeeñe. <verse eid="NUM 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 14:21" />Kpayeado, adaña nte ami ñkaaha iso nsʌk ndu uwem ye adaña nte ubọọñ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ayọhọke ke afịd ederimbod, <verse eid="NUM 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 14:22" />ndomo awo ammọ keed akekịtte ubọọñ mmi ye mme idiọọñọ a-ami ñkenamma ke Iyib ye ke anaan ado atreutọñ ye ami anyʌñ andomo miin idomo akañ duob, <verse eid="NUM 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 14:23" />awo ammọ ndomokeed idiikịtte isọñ a-ami ñkenwọñọke nnọ mme eteete ammọ. Awo ammọ ndomokeed a-akensịnne miin ke ndek idiikịtte anye. <verse eid="NUM 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 14:24" />Ndin sia ayịnufọk mmi Kaleb anieghe sịbidịd mfen anyʌñ añkeene miin ke afịd esịd amọ, ami ñyaadat anye ñkesịn ke isọñ a-anye akekaaha, ndin ubon amọ se ikeene anye eyaedat isọñ ado enie. <verse eid="NUM 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 14:25" />Sia mbon Amalek ye mbon Kenan edʌñọke ke mme itịkke, ndufo itịmme edem ñkpọñ inyʌñ inen iso ise akpautatan a-abaaha ke usʌñ a-akaaha Ndad-ndad Akpainyañ.”<verse eid="NUM 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 14:26" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Moses ye Erọn: <verse eid="NUM 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 14:27" />“Adiikpeene die mbon ibak ke idʌñ ami edikuun ñkuun ye ami? Ami mmekop mme nsuukuyio ye ndukuun nditọ Isrel. <verse eid="NUM 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 14:28" />Ndin dọkkọ ammọ, ‘Adaña nte ami ñkaaha iso nsʌk ndu uwem, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ, ami ñyaunam fiin ukem ñkpọ añkekoppo naña afo atañ: <verse eid="NUM 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 14:29" />Ke anaan ami akpo ndufo eyaeduọññọ, afịd ndufo e-esọññọ isua edịb me akanna ado e-ekebatta ke ini ubadawo e-ekenyʌññọ edukuunọ ye ami. <verse eid="NUM 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 14:30" />Kpak awo ndufo keed idiidʌkkọ isọñ a-ami ñkenwọñọke ye adidịppe ubọk nte ado itie idʌñ ndufo, ke ibọhọke Kaleb ayịn Yefune ye Yọsua ayịn Nọn. <verse eid="NUM 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 14:31" />Amaado nditọ ndufo a-ndufo ekebooho ke eyaetañ nte mbịme, ami ñyaaben ammọ ñkesịn nọ edaara ke isọñ a-ndufo ekesịnne. <verse eid="NUM 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 14:32" />Ndin amaado ndufo, akpo ndufo ayaaduọññọ ke anaan ami. <verse eid="NUM 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 14:33" />Nditọ ndufo ediidoñño mme akpemeedọñ mi ke isua aba, ebọ ufen ke unana mbuọdidem ndufo, tutu akpatre akpo ndufo anaa mi ke anaan. <verse eid="NUM 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 14:34" />Ke isua aba, isua keed ada anọ usen keed ke usen aba a-ndufo ekekaaha uyeb isọñ ado, ndufo eyaebọ ufen ke idiọọkñkpọ ndufo ndin enyʌñ ediọọñọ naña aba adinam nọ ami isua ndufo.’ <verse eid="NUM 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 14:35" />Ami, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, mmetañ, ñyaanyʌñ nnam mme ñkpọ ami ye afịd mbon idʌñ ibak ami, e-edianake itie keed ediñkọbọ miin. Ammọ eyaekịt utịd ammọ ke anaan ami; mi ke ammọ ediikpañña.”<verse eid="NUM 14:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 14:36" />Ndin emaeketọ mbon ake Moses akesioho adọñ ekeyep isọñ, e-ekenyʌññọ enyọñọ edinam afịd atu awo edukuunọ ye anye ke adisuan idiọọk mbʌk a-akebañake isọñ ado enịm, <verse eid="NUM 14:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 14:37" />ideen ami edo mbon e-ekenamma nọ esuan idiọọk mbʌk a-abañake isọñ, ndin ammọ emaekpañña ye idiọọk udọñọ ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="NUM 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 14:38" />Ke atu afịd mbon se ikikaa ikiyep isọñ ado, Yọsua ayịn Nọn ye Kaleb ayịn Yefune ikpọọñ ekebọkkọ.<verse eid="NUM 14:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 14:39" />Ke ini Moses aketañña ñkpọ ami anọ afịd nditọ Isrel, ammọ emaefʌhọ enyʌñ eseeme ataa eti-eti. <verse eid="NUM 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 14:40" />Ke ndañ nsiere edem usen ammọ emaenen iso ese itie akoñño akan ke abod-abod abio, enyʌñ ebo, “Idahami ñnyịn imibeeñeidem adidọọk ñkaa isọñ <char style="nd">A-Abọọñ</char> akenwọñọke. Ke akpanikọ ñnyịn imidue!”<verse eid="NUM 14:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 14:41" />Ado Moses amaabo, “Nsoo ido nọ ndufo etre utọñ inamma ewʌhọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>? Idiikịtte unen! <verse eid="NUM 14:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 14:42" />Ikiidọọk ikaa, sia <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> idaaha ye ndufo. Mme asua ndufo eyaikan ndufo, <verse eid="NUM 14:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 14:43" />sia mbon Amalek ye mbon Kenan eyaenwana ye ndufo do. Sia ndufo emaewọññọ edem ekpọñ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, anye idiibaaha ye ndufo ndin eyaiwot ndufo ke akañkañ.”<verse eid="NUM 14:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 14:44" />Ado, ke akikere esịd ammọ, ammọ emaedọọk esaña ekaa itie a-akekoñño akan ke abod-abod abio, akpesʌkado Moses me akebe edioomo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ikikpọññọ itie nnaa. <verse eid="NUM 14:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 14:45" />Ndin mbon Amalek ye mbon Kenan ekedʌñọke ke abod-abod abio emaesọiyọ edinwana ye ammọ enyʌñ ekan ammọ tutu akewuọ Họma.<verse eid="NUM 14:45" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="NUM 15" />
  <para style="s1">Mme Uwa Mfen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 15:1" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Moses, <verse eid="NUM 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 15:2" />“Tañ ikọ nọ nditọ Isrel nyʌñ bo ammọ: ‘Ndufo emaekedʌk isọñ a-ami inọọhọ ndufo nte itie idʌñ <verse eid="NUM 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 15:3" />ndin ndufo enọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> mme uwa ndidia e-etooho ke udịmenañ me ke udịmedọñ, nte inemufịk a-anemme <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> esịd, me ado mme ufọfọb uwa me mme uwa, asaña-asaña akaaña me enọ ima esịd me uwa usọrọ, <verse eid="NUM 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 15:4" />ndin awo a-abenne uwa adi, ana anọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> uwa abakpa ke mbaak duob ke udomo efa keed<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ñkpọ nte kilokram 1.6</char></note> ake ataa eti ndomuyo ewuaha ye mbakka inaañ ke hin keed<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ñkpọ nte lita keed; se ñko ke Nọmba 15:5</char></note> ke adan ọlif. <verse eid="NUM 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 15:5" />Dat ñyịn edọñ keedekeed ke ufọfọb uwa me adiwa uwa, nam mbaak inaañ ke hin ukọd keed nte uwa emem.<verse eid="NUM 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 15:6" />“ ‘Dat akukịmedọñ nam uwa udia ke mbaak iba ke itie duob ke efa ataa eti ndomuyio keed ewuaha ye mbaak ita ke hin<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ñkpọ nte lita 1.3; se ñko ke Nọmba 15:7</char></note> adan ọlif keed, <verse eid="NUM 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 15:7" />ye mbaak atu ukọd ita nte ñkpọ adinwọñ uwa. Dat anye nte inemufịk a-anemme <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> esịd.<verse eid="NUM 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 15:8" />“ ‘Ke ini afo anamma ñyịn ayaaraenañ nte ufọfọb uwa me adiwa uwa, asaña-asaña akaaña me uwa ewuana anọọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, <verse eid="NUM 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 15:9" />ana adat uwa abakpa ke mbaak ita efa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ñkpọ nte kilokram 5</char></note> keed ataa eti ndomuyo ewuaha ye mbaak iba ake hin<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ñkpọ nte lita 1.9; se ñko ke Nọmba 15:10</char></note> adan ọlif asaña ye ayaraenañ ado, <verse eid="NUM 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 15:10" />nyʌñ dat mbaak iba hin ukọd keed nte unwọnwọñ uwa. Ami ayaado uwa ndidia, a-adooho inemufịk a-anemme <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> esịd. <verse eid="NUM 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 15:11" />Enie adidiọñ ayaaraenañ me akukịmedọñ keedekeed, ñyịn edọñ me ñyịn ebod keedekeed, ke usʌñ ami. <verse eid="NUM 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 15:12" />Inam ntom ke awo keedekeed, inam ke naña akpewawak.<verse eid="NUM 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 15:13" />“ ‘Afịd awo e-edooho mme amanaisọñ ana enam mme ñkpọ ami ke usʌñ ami ke ini ammọ enamma uwa ndidia nte eti inemufịk enọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="NUM 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 15:14" />Ke mme emana e-ediighe, ini keed akeedodo a-asenawo me awo mfen akeedodo a-adʌññọ ye ndufo anamma uwa ndidia nte inemufịk a-anemme <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> esịd, ana nte ammọ enam ukem-ukem naña ndufo enam. <verse eid="NUM 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 15:15" />Abio ana enie ukem-ukem mbed inọ ndufo ye adidʌñ a-adʌññọ ke atu ndufo; ami ado nsi-nsi ewʌhọ anọ mme emana e-ediighe. Ndufo ye mme adidʌñ ediiba ukem-ukem ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>: <verse eid="NUM 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 15:16" />Mme mbed ye mme edu adinam ñkpọ eyaedo ukem-ukem inọ ndufo ye asenawo a-adʌññọ ke atu ndufo.’ ”<verse eid="NUM 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 15:17" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Moses, <verse eid="NUM 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 15:18" />“Tañ nọ nditọ Isrel nyʌñ bo ammọ: ‘Ke ini ndufo edʌkkọ isọñ a-ami idatta ndufo ñka, <verse eid="NUM 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 15:19" />ndin ndufo edia ndidia isọñ ado, inọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ubaak nte uwa. <verse eid="NUM 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 15:20" />Ndufo inọ eboho uyo keed ke akpa mbunwịm abakpa nte ndidia a-atooho isọñ inyʌñ inọ anye nte uwa a-atooho afe ubeek abakpa. <verse eid="NUM 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 15:21" />Tutu awuọ mme emana e-ediighe ke iso ana ndufo enọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> enọ ami nte akpa mbunwịm a-atooho isọñ ndufo.<verse eid="NUM 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Uwa Idiọọkñkpọ Ammiidooho Ñkoinnam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 15:22" />“ ‘Ndin adieke ndufo nte atu awo ifiọkkọfiọk itre edinịm mme ewʌhọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akenọọhọ Moses, <verse eid="NUM 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 15:23" />ewʌhọ akeedodo ake <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> inọọhọ ndufo ato ubọk Moses, tọọñọ ke usen ake <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akenọọhọ ammọ anyʌññọ adiika iso ke mme emana e-ediighe ke iso, <verse eid="NUM 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 15:24" />ndin adieke enamma ami ke ndudue ndin atu awo idiọọñọke ibaña, ana afịd atu awo enọ ñyịn ayaaraenañ ke ufọfọb uwa nte inemufịk a-anemme <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> esịd, a-asañake ye se esio enịm nte uwa abakpa ye unwọnwọñ uwa emem, ye akpoebod ke uwa idiọọkñkpọ.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Akeme ido uwa enọ adinam asana; se ñko Nọmba 15:25 ye 27</char></note> <verse eid="NUM 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 15:25" />Ndin ana aku anam uwa ñkpeubọk anọ afịd atu nditọ Isrel, ndin eyaenyʌñ efeen enọ ammọ, sia ikidooho ñkoinnam ndin ammọ emaenyʌñ enọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> uwa ndidia ye uwa idiọọkñkpọ ke idiọọk adinam ammọ. <verse eid="NUM 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 15:26" />Eyaefeen afịd Isrel ye mme adidʌñ e-edʌññọ ke atu ammọ, sia afịd awo emaenie udeeme ke unana ifiọk ndudue ado.<verse eid="NUM 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 15:27" />“ ‘Ado adieke awo keed kpọd anamma idiọọkñkpọ i-imiidooho ñkoinnam, awo ado ana aben uman ebod isua keed adi nọ ekama enam uwa idiọọkñkpọ. <verse eid="NUM 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 15:28" />Ana aku anam uwa ñkpeubọk ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> anọ awo a-adueghe ñkpọ ke adinam idiọọkñkpọ i-imiidooho ñkoinnam, ndin ke emaenam ñkpeubọk ema, eyaefeen enọ awo ado. <verse eid="NUM 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 15:29" />Mbed keed ami ado ukem-ukem anọ afịd awo e-enamma ndudue ke unana ifiọk, me ado amanaisọñ ayịn Isrel me ado asenawo a-adʌññọ ke atu ndufo.<verse eid="NUM 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 15:30" />“ ‘Ndin awo a-akoiyokoi anam idiọọkñkpọ, me ado amanaisọñ me ado asenawo, asuenne <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ndin ana nte ebịne anye esio ke atu mbon Isrel. <verse eid="NUM 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 15:31" />Sia ammọ emaesịn ikọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> enyʌñ ebiat mme mbed amọ, ana nte ebịne ammọ esio; idiọọkñkpọ ammọ adoro ammọ ke idem.’ ”<verse eid="NUM 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ewot Abiad Mbed Sabad</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 15:32" />Ke ini nditọ Isrel ekebaaha ke anaan, emaekịt awo keed naña atañña ifia ke usen Sabad. <verse eid="NUM 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 15:33" />Mbon e-ekekịtte anye naña atañña ifia emaeben anye esọk Moses ye Erọn ye afịd atu esob, <verse eid="NUM 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 15:34" />ndin ammọ emaenyʌñ enịm anye ke idak ukpeme, sia ikinwañake awo se ana nte enam ye anye. <verse eid="NUM 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 15:35" />Ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Moses, “Awo ado ana akpa. Ukeed esob ana ewuọ ekpọñ itie nnaa eketọọñ anye ke itiad.” <verse eid="NUM 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 15:36" />Ndin esob emaeben anye ewuọ ekpọñ itie nnaa enyʌñ eketọọñ anye ke itiad ewot, kpa naña ewʌhọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akenọọhọ Moses akedo.<verse eid="NUM 15:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mme Ñyeriye ke Mme Nsiine</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 15:37" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Moses, <verse eid="NUM 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 15:38" />“Tañ ikọ nọ nditọ Isrel nyʌñ bo ammọ ate: ‘Tutu awuọ mme emana se idiidi ana ndufo enam ñyeriye ke mme inuuk nsiine ndufo, ye bru idʌk ke ñyeriye keedekeed. <verse eid="NUM 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 15:39" />Ndufo eyaenie mme ñyeriye ami enyʌñ esise anye nọ etoiyo afịd mme ewʌhọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, nọ ato do ndufo ekeme adinịm ammọ, enyʌñ etre adikama idem ndufo nte akpara ke adifeghe ñkeene idiọọk itọñ esịd ye ake anyen ndufo. <verse eid="NUM 15:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 15:40" />Ndin ndufo eyaetoiyo adinịm afịd ewʌhọ ndin enam idem ndufo asana enọ Abasi ndufo. <verse eid="NUM 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 15:41" />Ami ndo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo, a-akibenne ndufo asio ke isọñ Iyib adido Abasi ndufo. Ami ndo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo.’ ”<verse eid="NUM 15:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="NUM 16" />
  <para style="s1">Kora, Datan ye Abiram</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 16:1" />Kora ayịn Isaa, ayịn Kohad, ayịn Lifai, ye usʌk ubon Rubịn, e-ekedooho Datan ye Abiram, nditọ ideen Eliab, ye Ọn ayịn Peled, emaekappa edo mbon usọñanyen <verse eid="NUM 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 16:2" />enyʌñ edakka eda enam ntịme ye Moses. Ammọ emaedat ideen Isrel awo ikie iba mme aba mme duob (250) edian idem, mbon e-ekenekkeke ediọọñọ nte mme adadusʌñ e-ekenyʌññọ emek esịn ke atu mbon esob. <verse eid="NUM 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 16:3" />Ammọ emaedi edinam ikọ ye Moses ye Erọn enyʌñ ebo ammọ, “Ndufo emenam eboiyo adaña! Afịd abio ado adisana, afịd ammọ, ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> mmọdo aba ye ammọ. Nsoo ndin inam nọ ndufo eben idem ndufo enịm ke itie akoñño akan esob <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>?”<verse eid="NUM 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 16:4" />Ke ini Moses akekoppo ami, anye amaaduọ asịn iso ke isọñ. <verse eid="NUM 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 16:5" />Akema anye amaabo Kora ye udịm amọ ate: “Ñkpọñ ubakusen <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ayaawọt awo a-adooho ake amọ ye awo a-adooho adisana, ndin anye ayaanam awo ado asaña akpere anye. Awo ake anye amek anye ayaanam anye asaña akpere anye. <verse eid="NUM 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 16:6" />Ndin afo, Kora ye afịd udịm mfo ana nte enam ami: Idat mme ñkpọ usịn insensi <verse eid="NUM 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 16:7" />ndin ñkpọñ isịn ukañ ye insensi ke ammọ ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. Awo <char style="nd">A-Abọọñ</char> amekke adiido anye a-asanake. Ndufo mme Lifai emenam eboiyo adaña!”<verse eid="NUM 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 16:8" />Moses amaanyʌñ abo Kora, “Ikpañ utọñ idahami, ndufo mme Lifai! <verse eid="NUM 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 16:9" />Nte ikemme ndufo ke Abasi Isrel amaibakka ndufo asio ke atu mbon Isrel mfen anyʌñ idat ndufo nọ ekpere anye idem enam utom ke itieukpono <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> enyʌñ eda ke iso atu awo enam ñkpọ enọ ammọ? <verse eid="NUM 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 16:10" />Anye amaikoono ndufo ye afịd mme Lifai akpere idem amọ, ado idahami ndufo eyem itie aku ñko. <verse eid="NUM 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 16:11" />Afo ye mme nsaña mfo ediana keed enam ikọ ye <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. Erọn ado anie nọ ndufo edukuunọ ebaña anye?”<verse eid="NUM 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 16:12" />Akema Moses amaakoot Datan ye Abiram, nditọ ideen Eliab. Ado ammọ emaebo, “Ñnyịn idiidiighe! <verse eid="NUM 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 16:13" />Nte ikemme ke afo adikisịññe ñnyịn ke isọñ a-afiọọrọke ye mmọọñeba ye adanakwọọk nọ adiwot ñnyịn ke anaan? Idahami ñko afo ayem adinyʌñ ikara ñnyịn! <verse eid="NUM 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 16:14" />Mfen ñko, afo udatta ñnyịn udʌk ke isọñ a-afiọọrọke ye mmọọñeba ye adanakwọọk unyʌññọ unọ ñnyịn udeeme ke inwañ ye mme inwañ fain. Nte afo ayem adidat mbon ami nte mme ifʌn? Iyoo, ñnyịn idiidiighe!”<verse eid="NUM 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 16:15" />Ndin Moses amaayat esịd eti-eti anyʌñ abo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, “Kuubọọ enọ ammọ. Ami ñkebọọhọ ñkpọ nte dọñki nto ammọ, ñkenyʌññọ nnam ammọ idiọọk.”<verse eid="NUM 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 16:16" />Moses amaabo Kora, “Afo ye afịd mme udịm mfo ana ewuọñọ edi iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ñkpọñ, afo ye ammọ ye Erọn. <verse eid="NUM 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 16:17" />Awo keedekeed ana aben ñkpọ usịn insensi amọ anyʌñ asịn insensi ke esịd, ñkpọ usịn insensi ikie iba mme aba mme duob (250) ke afịd, enyʌñ eben edi ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. Afo ye Erọn eyaeben ñkpọ usịn insensi edi ekọrọ.” <verse eid="NUM 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 16:18" />Ndin awo keedekeed amaaben ñkpọ usịn insensi amọ, asịn ukañ ye insensi ke esịd, ndin ada ye Moses ye Erọn ke anyenusʌñ atayad mbono. <verse eid="NUM 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 16:19" />Ke ini Kora amaakebok afịd nsaña amọ ke adinam ikọ ye ammọ ke anyenusʌñ atayad mbono, ubọọñ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaasọiyọ adʌk ke afịd esob. <verse eid="NUM 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 16:20" /><char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Moses ye Erọn, <verse eid="NUM 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 16:21" />“Ibakka idem ndufo ikpọñ esob ami yak ami ñkan nsobo ammọ ini keed.”<verse eid="NUM 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 16:22" />Ado Moses ye Erọn emaeduọ ekʌp iso ke isọñ etua, “O Abasi, Abasi a-anọọhọ afịd mme aduuwem ñkpọ ibifịk uwem, nte afo adiiyat esịd ye afịd esob ke ini awo keed anamma idiọọkñkpọ?”<verse eid="NUM 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 16:23" />Ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Moses, <verse eid="NUM 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 16:24" />“Tañ nọ esob, ‘Isịkke ikpọñ mme atayad Kora, Datan ye Abiram.’ ”<verse eid="NUM 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 16:25" />Moses amaadakka ada anyʌñ abịne Datan ye Abiram, ndin mme ñkpisọñ Isrel emaekeene anye. <verse eid="NUM 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 16:26" />Anye amaanọ esob ikpan ate, “Isịkke ikaa edem ikpọñ atayad mbon ibak ami! Ikiituuk ñkpọ ndomokeed a-adooho ammọ enie, imiidooho eyaikwuọk ndufo esio ke ntak idiọọkñkpọ ammọ.” <verse eid="NUM 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 16:27" />Ndin ammọ emaesịkke ekpọñ mme atayad Kora, Datan ye Abiram. Datan ye Abiram emaewuọñọ edi enyʌñ eda ye mme ibaan ammọ, nditọ ye ntəkayịn ke mme anyenusʌñ atayad ammọ.<verse eid="NUM 16:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 16:28" />Ndin Moses amaabo, “Ami ado naña ndufo ediidiọọñọ ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> andọñ miin nnam afịd mme ñkpọ ami ndin ke ikidooho akikere mmi: <verse eid="NUM 16:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 16:29" />Adieke ideen ami ekpaaha ñkpa nte naña afịd awo ekpañña enyʌñ eben ufen ubonawo, awuọ idooho <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akendọñ miin. <verse eid="NUM 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 16:30" />Ado adieke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atịppeke ufa ñkpọ anam, ndin isọñ akʌppọ inua amọ atañ ammọ amen, ye afịd ñkpọ se ammọ enie, ndin ammọ etịkke ekaa ndisi ye uwem ke abio mme akpañkpa, ndin ndufo eyaediọọñọ ebo ke mbon ami eben <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> esịn ke ndek.”<verse eid="NUM 16:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 16:31" />Kpasʌk ke idaha Moses akweeñeke aditañ afịd ikọ ami; isọñ a-ammọ ekedaaha amaabakka iba <verse eid="NUM 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 16:32" />ndin amaatat inua amọ anyʌñ aben ammọ amen ye afịd ufọk ammọ, ye afịd mbon se ikinie ewuana ye Kora, adiana ye mme inie ammọ. <verse eid="NUM 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 16:33" />Ndin ammọ emaetịkke ndisi ekaa ke abio mme akpañkpa, ye afịd ñkpọ se ammọ ekenie, isọñ anyʌñ afʌk ammọ, ndin ammọ emaetak enyʌñ ewuọñọ ekpọñ atu awo. <verse eid="NUM 16:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 16:34" />Ndin naña ammọ ekesʌkkọ etuaha, afịd nditọ Isrel e-ekedaaha ekpere ammọ emaefeeñe, ebọñ ñkpo, “Isọñ ayaitañ ñnyịn imen ñko!”<verse eid="NUM 16:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 16:35" />Ndin ikañ amaato <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> anyʌñ ata awo ikie iba mme aba mme duob (250) e-ekefọppọ insensi.<verse eid="NUM 16:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 16:36" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Moses, <verse eid="NUM 16:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 16:37" />“Dọkkọ Eliasa ayịn Erọn, aku, yak asịññe mme ñkpọ ufọp insensi akpọñ mme akpo anyʌñ asuan mme ukañ asịññe ke anyan usʌñ, sia mme ñkpọ ufọp insensi edoñño ndisana, <verse eid="NUM 16:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 16:38" />mme ñkpọ ufọp insensi mbon e-ekenamma idiọọk enyʌñ etaba uwem ammọ. Mia mme ñkpọ ufọp insensi ado nọ edette nyʌñ kama ammọ fʌk ke itie unam uwa, sia emaeben ammọ edi iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ndin ammọ ekanna edo ndisana. Yak ammọ eba nte idiọọñọ enọ nditọ Isrel.”<verse eid="NUM 16:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 16:39" />Ndin Eliasa aku amaakoono mme ñkpọ ufọp insensi brọns a-mbon ikañ aketaaha awot ekebenne edi; ndin anye amaanam emia ammọ mbaak efʌk ke itie unam uwa, <verse eid="NUM 16:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 16:40" />kpasʌk naña <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> aketemme anye ato inua Moses. Ami akedo aditoiyo nditọ Isrel ke awo ndomokeed mfen ke imiibọhọke mbon e-etooho ubon Erọn inaaha edifọp insensi ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, imiidooho anye adiitie nte Kora ye mme nsaña amọ.<verse eid="NUM 16:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 16:41" />Akema ke edemusen afịd nditọ Isrel emaedukuunọ ebaña Moses ye Erọn ete. “Ndufo emewot ikọd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.”<verse eid="NUM 16:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 16:42" />Ado ke ini esob ekebohoke idem adinam ikọ nsuukuyio ye Moses ye Erọn enyʌñ ekanna iso ese atayad mbono, ntuhube amaafʌk anye ndin ubọọñ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaawuọ. <verse eid="NUM 16:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 16:43" />Ndin Moses ye Erọn emaekaa ke iso atayad mbono, ndin <verse eid="NUM 16:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 16:44" /><char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Moses, <verse eid="NUM 16:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 16:45" />“Idakka ikpọñ esob ami nọ ñkweeñe ye ammọ ini keed.” Ndin ammọ emaeduọ ekʌp iso ke isọñ.<verse eid="NUM 16:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 16:46" />Ndin Moses amaabo Erọn, “Ben sensa mfo nyʌñ sịn insensi ke esịd, ye mme ufọfọb ukañ a-atooho akpokoro uwa, nyʌñ sọsọp kaa ke esob kenam ñkpeubọk nọ ammọ. Iyadesịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> a-abịmme; idiọọk udọñọ a-atọọñọ.” <verse eid="NUM 16:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 16:47" />Ndin Erọn amaanam se Moses aketemme, anyʌñ afeghe adʌk ke esob. Idiọọk udọñọ ado amaatọtọọñọ ke atu mme awo, ado Erọn amaafọp insensi anyʌñ anam ñkpeubọk anọ ammọ. <verse eid="NUM 16:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 16:48" />Ndin anye amaada ke ufọọd mme aduuwem ye mme akpañkpa, ndin idiọọk udọñọ ado amaanyʌñ atre. <verse eid="NUM 16:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 16:49" />Ado awo tọsịn duob mme inaañ mme ikie itiaba (14,700) emaekpañña ke idiọọk udọñọ ado, eben edian ye mbon ekekpaññake ke ntak Kora. <verse eid="NUM 16:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 16:50" />Akema Erọn amaatịmme abịne Moses ke anyenusʌñ atayad mbono, sia idiọọk udọñọ ado amaatre.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:50 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ke ikpañwed Hibru ewet Nọmba 16:36-50 nte Nọmba 17:1-15.</char></note><verse eid="NUM 16:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="NUM 17" />
  <para style="s1">Esañ Erọn Asio Emịne</para>
  <para style="p">
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">17: </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Ke ikpañwed Hibru ewet Nọmba 17:1-13 nte Nọmba 17:16-28.</char>
    </note> <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 17:1" /><char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Moses, <verse eid="NUM 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 17:2" />“Tañ ikọ nọ nditọ Isrel nyʌñ bọ esañ duob mme iba a-atooho ammọ, keed ato mme adadusʌñ keedekeed ke esiin mme eteete ammọ. Wet anyịñ awo keedekeed ke esañ amọ. <verse eid="NUM 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 17:3" />Ke esañ Lifai wet anyịñ Erọn, sia ana esañ keed anie adaiwuod ke esiin eteete keedekeed. <verse eid="NUM 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 17:4" />Bon ammọ ke atayad mbono ke iso akebe edioomo mbed, ke itie a-ami nsisooboke ye afo. <verse eid="NUM 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 17:5" />Esañ a-anieghe awo a-ami mmekke ayaaseghe, ndin ami ñyaasio idem mmi mfep ke ndukuun nsuukuyio u-ubañake fiin mbañ-mbañ ato nditọ Isrel.”<verse eid="NUM 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 17:6" />Ndin Moses amaatañ anọ nditọ Isrel, ndin mme adadusʌñ ammọ emaenyʌñ enọ anye esañ duob mme iba, ndin esañ Erọn amaasịne ke atu ammọ. <verse eid="NUM 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 17:7" />Moses amaaboon mme esañ ami ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ke atayad mbono edioomo mbed.<verse eid="NUM 17:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 17:8" />Edem usen Moses amaadʌk atayad anyʌñ akekịt ke esañ Erọn, a-akedaaha anọ esiin Lifai, ikitịppeketịppe kpọd, ado amaanie emịne, asịññe ñkọñ ye mfịd anyʌñ anwịm mmansañ mbakara. <verse eid="NUM 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 17:9" />Ndin Moses amaasịññe afịd mme esañ ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> adat asọk afịd nditọ Isrel. Ammọ eseet ammọ, ndin mme adadusʌñ keedekeed amaado anie esañ amọ asio.<verse eid="NUM 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 17:10" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Moses, “Tịmme ben esañ Erọn kaa kenịm ke iso akebe edioomo mbed, nọ ana nte idiọọñọ anọ mbon nsọñiwuod. Ami ayaasịn utịd ke ndukuun a-ammọ enieghe embaña miin, mbaak ammọ idikpañña.” <verse eid="NUM 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 17:11" />Ndin Moses amaanam kpa naña <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> aketemmeke anye.<verse eid="NUM 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 17:12" />Nditọ Isrel emaebo Moses ete, “Ñnyịn iyaikpañña! Ñnyịn imitak, afịd ñnyịn imitak! <verse eid="NUM 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 17:13" />Awo keed akeedodo a-asañake akpere tabanakịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ayaakpa. Nte afịd ñnyịn iyaikpañña?”<verse eid="NUM 17:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="NUM 18" />
  <para style="s1">Ubiọñutom Mme Aku ye Mme Lifai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 18:1" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Erọn, “Afo, nditọ ideen mfo ye ufọk mfo enie edibiom mme ndudue e-ebañake adisana itie, ndin afo ye nditọ mfo ideen enyʌñ enie edibiom mme ndudue e-ebañake utom mme aku. <verse eid="NUM 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 18:2" />Dat mme Lifai mbon mfo e-etooho esiin eteete ndufo yak ediana ye ndufo enyʌñ inwam ndufo ke ini a-afo ye nditọ ideen mfo enamma utom ke iso atayad edioomo mbed. <verse eid="NUM 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 18:3" />Ammọ ana esịne ke idak mfo enyʌñ enam afịd utom ke atayad, ado inaaha ammọ esaña ekpere mme ñkpọ se ibono ke adisana itie me ke akpokoro uwa. Imiidooho ntoro ammọ ye afo eyaekpañña. <verse eid="NUM 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 18:4" />Ana nte ammọ ediana ye afo ekama utom adise ñkpọ mbaña atayad mbono, afịd utom ke atayad, inaaha nte awo mfen ndomokeed asaña akpere itie a-ndufo ebaaha.<verse eid="NUM 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 18:5" />“Ubiọñutom ndufo ado adise ñkpọ mbaña atayad ye akpokoro uwa, mbaak iyadesịd mmi adimaana adoro nditọ Isrel ke idem. <verse eid="NUM 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 18:6" />Ami ke idem mmi mmaasịññe nditọ Lifai ndufo ke atu nditọ Isrel nte enọ unọ fiin, emaekpọnnọ ammọ enịm enọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> adinam utom ke atayad mbono. <verse eid="NUM 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 18:7" />Ado afo kpọd ye nditọ ideen mfo ekeme edinam utom nte aku ke se ibeghe afịd ñkpọ ke akpokoro uwa ye ke esịd ikpeghe. Ami unọ fiin utom ami adido aku nte enọ. Awo mfen ndomokeed a-adiighe akpere adisana itie ana nte ewot anye.”<verse eid="NUM 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Enọ Mme Aku ye Mme Lifai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 18:8" />Ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Erọn, “Ami ke idem mmi mmunọ fiin ewʌhọ nte ase ñkpọ abaña mme enọ edatta ensọk miin; afịd mme ndisana enọ a-nditọ Isrel ennọọhọ miin ami mmuunọ fiin ye nditọ mfo nte udeeme ndufo, nsi-nsi ubakka mfo. <verse eid="NUM 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 18:9" />Ana afo anie ubaak ataa adisana enọ awo imiifọppọ ke ikañ. Ke afịd mme enọ a-ammọ edatta ensọk miin nte ataa adisana uwa, me ado ake ndidia me ake idiọọkñkpọ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Akeme ido adinam asana</char></note> me ake uwa ndudue, mbaak ado unie fiin ye nditọ mfo. <verse eid="NUM 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 18:10" />Ta anye nte ñkpọ a-adooho ataa adisana; afịd ideen ana eta anye. Ana afo adat anye nte adisana.<verse eid="NUM 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 18:11" />“Anyem ñko ado ake mfo: Ñkpọ akeedodo e-esioho enịm ke atu mme enọ afịd ufọfʌñ uwa a-atooho nditọ Isrel. Ami mmuunọ fiin ye nditọ mfo ideen ye ibaan nte ewʌhọ nsi-nsi udeeme mfo. Afịd awo ke ufọk mfo e-edooho adisana ekeme edita anye.<verse eid="NUM 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 18:12" />“Ami mmuunọ fiin afịd mfọọn nti adan ọlif ye afịd nti ufa ukọd ye abakpa a-ammọ enọọhọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> nte akpa mbunwịm mfịd a-atooho ke idọk ammọ. <verse eid="NUM 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 18:13" />Afịd mme akpa mfịd a-atooho isọñ a-ammọ ebenne esọk <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> adiido ake mfo. Afịd awo ke ufọk mfo e-edooho adisana ekeme adita anye.<verse eid="NUM 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 18:14" />“Afịd ñkpọ ke Isrel e-esioho enịm enọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> unie fiin. <verse eid="NUM 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 18:15" />Akpa enọ a-atooho mfịdidịb, ye ke adooho awo me unam, e-enọọhọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ado ake mfo. Ado ana afo afakka afịd akpan a-adooho awo ye afịd akpa ndedeghe unam a-adooho ayaara. <verse eid="NUM 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 18:16" />Ke ini ammọ esọññọ eyọhọ afiọñ keed, ana afo afak ammọ ke ekọmudua ufak a-adooho udomo silfa sekel ition,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ñkpọ nte kram 58</char></note> asañake akekem ye udomo adisana itie, a-adomoke kera edịb.<verse eid="NUM 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 18:17" />“Ado inaaha afo afakka akpa mfịdidịb umanenañ, edọñ me ebod; ammọ edoñño ndisana. Siime iyiib ammọ ke akpokoro uwa nyʌñ fọp akpọñ ammọ nte uwa ndidia, inemufịk a-anemme <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> esịd. <verse eid="NUM 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 18:18" />Unam ammọ adiido ake ndufo, kpa naña ikọñesịd ufọfʌñ uwa ye ifʌkkọ nnasia edooho ake mfo. <verse eid="NUM 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 18:19" />Ndin se adodo a-adooho adisana enọ a-nditọ Isrel ebenne edinọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ami mmuunọ fiin ye nditọ mfo ideen ye ibaan nte nsi-nsi udeeme mfo. Anye ado nsi-nsi edioomo inʌñ ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> unọ fiin ye nditọ mfo.”<verse eid="NUM 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 18:20" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Erọn, “Afo uduunieghe udeeme ke isọñ ammọ, afo uduunyʌññọ unie udeeme ke atu ammọ; ami ndo udeeme mfo ye inie mfo ke atu nditọ Isrel.<verse eid="NUM 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 18:21" />“Ami mmenọ mme Lifai afịd mbaak keed ke itie duob ke Isrel nte inie ammọ ke utom a-ammọ enamma ke atayad mbono. <verse eid="NUM 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 18:22" />Tọọñọ ke ami inaaha nditọ Isrel esaña ekpere atayad mbono, imiidooho ammọ eyaebiom se idiitịppe ke idiọọkñkpọ ammọ ndin eyaekpañña. <verse eid="NUM 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 18:23" />Ado mme Lifai ediinam utom ke atayad mbono enyʌñ edo mbon usio isob ke ndudue a-ammọ enamma ke atayad. Anye ami ado nsi-nsi ewʌhọ anọ mme emana e-ediighe ke iso. Ammọ idiibọọhọ inie ke atu nditọ Isrel. <verse eid="NUM 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 18:24" />Ado, ami mmenọ nditọ Lifai mbaak keed ke itie duob nte inie ke se nditọ Isrel eben edinọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> nte enọ. Ami ado ntak a-ami ñketañña mbaña ammọ mbo: ‘Ammọ idiinieghe udeeme ke atu nditọ Isrel.’ ”<verse eid="NUM 18:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 18:25" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Moses, <verse eid="NUM 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 18:26" />“Tañ ikọ nọ mme Lifai nyʌñ bo ammọ: ‘ke ini ndufo ebọọhọ nditọ Isrel mbaak keed ke itie duob ake ami inọọhọ ndufo nte inie, ana ndufo eben mbaak keed ke itie duob ñko edi nte enọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="NUM 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 18:27" />Eyaebat enọ ndufo inọ ndufo nte mfịdinwañ a-atooho afe ubeek abakpa me nte mmịn a-atooho afe unyịmme ukọd. <verse eid="NUM 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 18:28" />Ke ntoro ndufo eyaenyʌñ enọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> enọ eto afịd mme mbaak keed ke itie duob a-ndufo ebọọhọ eto nditọ Isrel. Ke mme mbaak keed ke itie duob ami ana ndufo enọ Erọn nte aku ubaak a-anieghe <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> <verse eid="NUM 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 18:29" />Ana ndufo enọ nte ubaak ake <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> se ido ataa eti ye andisana ñkan ke afịd ñkpọ i-inọọhọ ndufo.’<verse eid="NUM 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 18:30" />“Dọkkọ mme Lifai bo: ‘Ke ini ndufo enọọhọ ataa eti ubaak, eyaebat inọ ndufo nte ñkpọ a-atooho afe ubeek abakpa me afe unyịmme ukọd. <verse eid="NUM 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 18:31" />Ndufo ye afịd ufọk ndufo emekeme edidia se isʌhọ ke itie akeedodo, sia anye ado utịb utom a-ndufo enamma ke atayad mbono. <verse eid="NUM 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 18:32" />Ke adinọ ataa eti ubaak awo idiikịtte ndudue inọ ndufo ke ñkpọ ami; ndin ndufo idiisappake ndisana enọ nditọ Isrel, ndufo idiinyʌññọ ikpa.’ ”<verse eid="NUM 18:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="NUM 19" />
  <para style="s1">Mmọọñ Uyet Idiọọkñkpọ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 19:1" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Moses ye Erọn: <verse eid="NUM 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 19:2" />“Ami ado se mbed ayem <char style="nd">A-Abọọñ</char> akewuuhọ: Dọkkọ nditọ Isrel yak edat ndad-ndad ñyịn umanenañ a-afọnnọ, imiinieghe ndo inyʌññọ isịne ke akpọnọ. <verse eid="NUM 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 19:3" />Ben anye nọ Eliasa a-adooho aku; yak eben anye ewuọ ekpọñ itie nnaa enyʌñ ewot anye ke iso amọ. <verse eid="NUM 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 19:4" />Ndin Eliasa a-adooho aku anie adideep usʌk iyiib ke nnuunubọk ammọ anyʌñ asiime ke iso atayad mbono akañ itiaba. <verse eid="NUM 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 19:5" />Ke ini anye adaaha akpeme, ana efọp ñyịn umanenañ ado, ikpa amọ, abʌk, iyiib ye mme nsia. <verse eid="NUM 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 19:6" />Aku ayaadat eto sida, haisọb ye ndad-ndad idededọñ anyʌñ atoomo ammọ adọñ ke ikañ e-efọppọ ñyịn umanenañ ado. <verse eid="NUM 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 19:7" />Ke ami aboiyoke, ana aku ayeet mme afọñ amọ anyʌñ akama mmọọñ ayie idem. Ndin anye akeme adidọọk ndi ke itie nnaa, ado anye adiido ndedeghe tutu ndubiayio. <verse eid="NUM 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 19:8" />Awo andifọp anye ñko ana ayeet mme afọñ amọ anyʌñ akama mmọọñ ayie idem, ndin anye ñko ayaado ndedeghe tutu ndubiayio.<verse eid="NUM 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 19:9" />“Awo a-asanake ayaawoppo ntọñ ñyịn umanenañ ado anyʌñ abon ammọ ke itie a-asanake ke esiin itie nnaa. Ana nditọ Isrel enịm ntọñ ado nọ esisịn ammọ ke mmọọñ e-ekamake enam ñkpọ asana; anye ado ke edat enam uwa idiọọkñkpọ. <verse eid="NUM 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 19:10" />Ana awo a-awoppoke ntọñ ñyịn umanenañ ami ñko ayeet afọñ amọ; anye ayaanyʌñ ado ndedeghe tutu ndubiayio. Anye ami ayaado nsi-nsi ewʌhọ anọ nditọ Isrel ye mme adidʌñ e-edʌññọ ke atu ammọ.<verse eid="NUM 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 19:11" />“Awo akeedodo a-atuuhọ akpo awo ñkpa ayaado ndedeghe ke usen itiaba. <verse eid="NUM 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 19:12" />Ana nte ammọ eyie idem ammọ ke mmọọñ ado ke ayọhọ usen ita ye ke ayọhọ usen itiaba, ndin ammọ eyaesana. Ado adieke ammọ imiiyieghe idem ke ayọhọ usen ita ye ke ayọhọ usen itiaba, ammọ idiisanake. <verse eid="NUM 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 19:13" />Adieke ammọ etreke ediyie idem ke emaeketuuk akpo awo, ammọ esappa adisana itie <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. Ana ebịne ammọ esio ke Isrel. Sia awo ikisiimeke ammọ mmọọñ uyet idiọọkñkpọ, ammọ edo ndedeghe; ndek ammọ adiana ammọ ke idem.<verse eid="NUM 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 19:14" />“Ami ado mbed a-anaaha enịm adieke awo akpaaha ke atayad: Awo akeedodo a-adʌkkọ atayad ye awo akeedodo a-asịneke ke esịd eyaedo ndedeghe ke usen itiaba, <verse eid="NUM 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 19:15" />ndin afịd iko a-anaaha inwañ i-imiinieghe ukʌb se ekʌp anye emʌm ekama ayaado ndedeghe.<verse eid="NUM 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 19:16" />“Awo keed akeedodo ke anwa a-atuuhọ awo e-ekewotto ke akañkañ me awo a-akpaaha ñkaña ñkpa, me awo a-atuuhọ akpọ awo ñkpa me udi, ayaado ndedeghe ke usen itiaba.<verse eid="NUM 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 19:17" />“Amaado ake ndedeghe awo, sịn etək ntọñ a-atooho uwa e-ekefọppọ adinam asana ke usan nyʌñ tọkkọ mmọọñ idịm duọk. <verse eid="NUM 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 19:18" />Ndin awo a-adooho adisana anie adidat etək haisọb, anyiin anye ke mmọọñ ado anyʌñ asiime ke atayad ye afịd ñkpọ mbana ufọk ye mme awo e-ebaaha do. Ana anye anyʌñ asiime awo akeedodo a-aketuuho akpọ awo ñkpa me udi me awo akeedodo e-ekewotto me awo akeedodo a-akekpaaha ñkaña ñkpa. <verse eid="NUM 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 19:19" />Awo a-asanake anie adisiime mbon se imiisanake ke ayọhọ usen ita ye ke ayọhọ usen itiaba, ndin ke ayọhọ usen itiaba anye anie adinam ammọ esana. Ana mbon e-enamma nọ esana eyeet afọñ ammọ enyʌñ eyie idem ke mmọọñ, ndin ke ndubiayio ado ammọ eyaesana. <verse eid="NUM 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 19:20" />Ado adieke mbon e-edegheke imiiyieghe idem ammọ, ana ebịne ammọ esio ke abio, sia ammọ e-esappa adisana itie <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. Awo isiimeke ammọ mmọọñ uyet idiọọkñkpọ, ammọ edoñño ndedeghe. <verse eid="NUM 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 19:21" />Ami ado nsi-nsi ewʌhọ anọ ammọ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 19:21">“Awo a-asiimeke mmọọñ uyet idiọọkñkpọ ana anyʌñ ayeet afọñ amọ ñko, ndin awo akeedodo a-atuuhọ mmọọñ uyet idiọọkñkpọ ayaanyʌñ ado ndedeghe tutu ndubiayio. <verse eid="NUM 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 19:22" />Ñkpọ akeedodo a-ndedeghe awo atuuhọ akappa ado ndedeghe, ndin awo akeedodo a-atuuhọ anye akappa ado ndedeghe tutu ndubiayio.”<verse eid="NUM 19:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="NUM 20" />
  <para style="s1">Mmọọñ A-awuọhọ ke Itiad</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 20:1" />Ke akpa afiọñ, afịd atu nditọ Isrel emaediwuọ Akpautatan Sịn, ndin ammọ ekedʌñ ke Kades. Do ke Miriam akekpa enyʌñ ebuuk anye.<verse eid="NUM 20:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 20:2" />Ke ini ado mmọọñ ikibaaha inọ atu awo, ndin mme awo emaesoobo idem adinam ikọ ye Moses ye Erọn. <verse eid="NUM 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 20:3" />Ammọ emaetọhọ ye Moses enyʌñ ebo, “Akpekapado ñnyịn imaikpañña ke ini nditọeka ñnyịn ekekpaññake ke iso Abọọñ! <verse eid="NUM 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 20:4" />Ntak a-afo akedatta ikọd Abọọñ adi anaan ami, nọ ñnyịn ye ufene ñnyịn idiikpañña mi-e? <verse eid="NUM 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 20:5" />Ntak a-afo akisịññeke ñnyịn ke isọñ Iyib adọọk adi ke idiọọk itie ami-e? Abakpa me fik ibaaha, inwañ fain me ñkpasi pomekrened ñko inyʌññọ iba. Ñko mmọọñ se enwọñ ibaaha!”<verse eid="NUM 20:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 20:6" />Moses ye Erọn emaewuọ ke esob ekaa ke anyenusʌñ atayad mbono, enyʌñ eduọ ekʌp iso ke isọñ, ndin ubọọñ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabiọññọ anọ ammọ. <verse eid="NUM 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 20:7" /><char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Moses, <verse eid="NUM 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 20:8" />“Ben esañ ado, ndin afo ye ayịneka mfo Erọn ikoot esob ibon itie keed. Tañ ikọ nọ itiad ado ke iso ammọ ndin anye ayaanyʌñ asio mmọọñ. Afo ayaasio mmọọñ ke itiad anọ atu awo nọ ammọ ye mme ufene ammọ enwọñ.”<verse eid="NUM 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 20:9" />Ndin Moses amaaben esañ ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, kpa naña anye akenyʌñ atemme anye. <verse eid="NUM 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 20:10" />Anye ye Erọn emaekoot mme awo ebon ke esob itie keed ke iso itiad ndin Moses amaabo ammọ, “Ikpañ utọñ, ndufo mbon ntịme, nte ana ñnyịn isio mmọọñ ke itiad ami inọ ndufo?” <verse eid="NUM 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 20:11" />Ndin Moses amaadịppe ubọk ammọ amia itiad akañ iba ke esañ amọ. Mmọọñ amaasakka awuọ, ndin atu awo ye mme ufene ammọ emaenwọñ.<verse eid="NUM 20:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 20:12" />Ado <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Moses ye Erọn, “Sia ndufo imiikinnịmme miin ke akpanikọ inyʌññọ iñkpono miin nte adisana ke iso nditọ Isrel, ndufo idiidatta atu awo ami idʌk isọñ a-ami nnọọhọ ammọ.”<verse eid="NUM 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 20:13" />Anye ami akedo mmọọñ Meriba,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Meriba awuọñọ aditọhọ.</char></note> itie a-nditọ Isrel eketọhọke ye <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ñko itie e-ekediọọñọke ebo ke anye ado adisana ke atu ammọ.<verse eid="NUM 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Edọm Inọọhọ Isrel Usʌñ Eboiyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 20:14" />Moses amaadọñ isʌñutom ke Kades anọ adidem Edọm, abo:</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="NUM 20:14">“Ami ado se ayịneka mfo Isrel abo: Afo amediọọñọ abaña afịd nsọñọñkpọ a-akediighe ibịne ñnyịn. <verse eid="NUM 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 20:15" />Mme eteete ñnyịn emaesọiyọ ekaa Iyib, ñnyịn ñko inyʌñ idʌñọ do ke uwak isua. Mbon Iyib emaifʌnnọ ñnyịn ye mme eteete ñnyịn, <verse eid="NUM 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 20:16" />ado ke ini ñnyịn ikituaha inọọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, anye amaakop ntuaña ñnyịn anyʌñ anọ enyere adisio ñnyịn ke Iyib.</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="NUM 20:16">“Idahami ñnyịn iba mi ke Kades, abio a-abaaha ke adaña isọñ mfo. <verse eid="NUM 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 20:17" />Mbọk yak ñnyịn isaña iboiyo ke abio mfo. Ñnyịn idiiwakkake idʌk inwañ me inwañ fain, me adinwọñ mmọọñ ke ube mmọọñ. Ñnyịn iyaisaña ke Ekamba Akpọusʌñ Adidem, inyʌññọ iwakka nnasia me ufiin tutu ñnyịn iboiyo ke idịd mfo.”<verse eid="NUM 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 20:18" />Ado Edọm amaabọọrọ:</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="NUM 20:18">“Ndufo idiisañake iboiyo mi; adieke edomoke, ñnyịn iyaiwuọ ida inwana ye ndufo ye akañkañ.”<verse eid="NUM 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 20:19" />Nditọ Isrel emaenyʌñ ebọọrọ:</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="NUM 20:19">“Ñnyịn idiisaña ke akpọusʌñ, ndin adieke ñnyịn me ufene ñnyịn inwọññọ mmọọñ mfo, ñnyịn iyaikpe ekọmudua. Ñnyịn iyem adisaña mboiyo ke ukod kpọd, ñkpọ mfen ibaaha.”<verse eid="NUM 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 20:20" />Ammọ emaetịmme ebọọrọ:</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="NUM 20:20">“Ndufo ikemeke adiboiyo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 20:20">Ndin Edọm emaewuọñọ uwak-uwak ye akpọsọñ mbon ekọñ. <verse eid="NUM 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 20:21" />Sia Edọm imiikiyakka ammọ esaña eboiyo ke idʌñ ammọ, Isrel emaetịmme edem ekpọñ ammọ.<verse eid="NUM 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ñkpa Erọn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 20:22" />Afịd atu nditọ Isrel emaewuọñọ ke Kades enyʌñ edi ke Abod Họọ. <verse eid="NUM 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 20:23" />Ke Abod Họọ, a-akpereke adaña Edọm, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Moses ye Erọn, <verse eid="NUM 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 20:24" />“Eyaeben Erọn ekenịm ye mbon amọ. Anye idiidʌkkọ isọñ a-ami ñkenọọhọ nditọ Isrel, sia ndufo awo iba emaesọñ iwuod ke ewʌhọ mmi ke mme mmọọñ Meriba. <verse eid="NUM 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 20:25" />Dat Erọn ye ayịn amọ Eliasa nyʌñ ben ammọ dọọk kaa Abod Họọ. <verse eid="NUM 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 20:26" />Sịññe Erọn mme nsiine amọ nyʌñ sịn Eliasa ayịn amọ, sia eyaeben Erọn ekenịm ye mbon ammọ; anye adiikpa do.”<verse eid="NUM 20:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 20:27" />Moses amaanam se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> aketemme: Ammọ emaewuọ edọọk Abod Họọ ke anyen afịd atu awo. <verse eid="NUM 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 20:28" />Moses amaasịññe afọñ Erọn anyʌñ aben asịn ayịn amọ Eliasa. Ndin Erọn amaakpa do ke anyọñ ekamba abod. Akema Moses ye Eliasa emaeto abod esọiyọ edi, <verse eid="NUM 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 20:29" />ndin ke ini afịd atu awo ekoppo ke Erọn amaakpa, afịd nditọ Isrel emaefʌhọ anye ke usen edịb mme duob.<verse eid="NUM 20:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="NUM 21" />
  <para style="s1">Esobo Arad</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 21:1" />Ke ini awo Kenan adidem Arad, akedʌññọ ke Nekef, akekoppo ke nditọ Isrel asʌk adi ke usʌñ a-akaaha Atarim, anye amaanwana ye ammọ anyʌñ amuum usʌk ammọ. <verse eid="NUM 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 21:2" />Ndin Isrel amaanam akaaña ami anọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>: “Adieke adooho afo ayaayaak mbon ami isịn ñnyịn ke ubọk, ñnyịn iyaisobo mme abio ammọ afịd-afịd.” <verse eid="NUM 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 21:3" /><char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaakop ebeeñe Isrel anyʌñ ayaak mbon Kenan anọ ammọ. Ammọ emaesobo ammọ ye mme abio ammọ afịd-afịd; ndin esio itie ado anyịñ Họma.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Homa awuọñọ nsobo</char></note><verse eid="NUM 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Udʌkikọd Brọns</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 21:4" />Ammọ emaenam isañ eto ke Abod Họọ edʌk ke usʌñ a-akaaha Ndad-Ndad Inyañ, adikanna abio Edọm nsio. Ado mbon awo ikinieghe ime ke usʌñ; <verse eid="NUM 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 21:5" />ammọ emaesuuk Abasi ye Moses uyio, enyʌñ ebo, “Ntak a-afo akisioho ñnyịn ke Iyib abo nọ idikpañña ke anaan ami-e? Uyo ibaaha! Mmọọñ ibaaha! Ndin ñnyịn imaaha uweene-uweene ndidia ami!”<verse eid="NUM 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 21:6" />Ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaadọñ mme ndiọi udʌkikọd ke atu ammọ; ammọ emaekọñ mme awo ndin uwak nditọ Isrel emaekpañña. <verse eid="NUM 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 21:7" />Mme awo emaebịne Moses enyʌñ ebo, “Ñnyịn imainam idiọọkñkpọ ke ini ñnyịn ikitañña idiọọk ikọ idian <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ye afo. Kpe <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ubọk nọ anye aben mme udʌkikọd asio ke atu ñnyịn.” Ndin Moses amaanam ñkpeubọk anọ mmọ.<verse eid="NUM 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 21:8" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Moses, “Bot udʌkikọd nyʌñ kọọñ anye ke eto; awo ndomokeed ake udʌkikọd adommo akeme adise udʌkikọd brọns ami ñnyʌñ adu uwem.” <verse eid="NUM 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 21:9" />Ndin Moses amaabot udʌkikọd ke brọns anyʌñ akọọñ anye ke eto. Awo akeedodo u-udʌkikọd akedommo a-akenyʌññọ adịppe anyen ase udʌkikọd brọns, ammọ emaedu uwem.<verse eid="NUM 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isañ Uka Mọb</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 21:10" />Nditọ Isrel emaedakka enyʌñ ekena ke Obod. <verse eid="NUM 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 21:11" />Ndin ammọ emaewuọñọ ke Obod enyʌñ ekena ke Iye Abarim, ke anaan a-asakkaiso ase Mọb ke ukañ usakkautịn. <verse eid="NUM 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 21:12" />Ammọ emaekpọñ itie ado edakka enyʌñ ekena ke Abedeñ Sered. <verse eid="NUM 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 21:13" />Ammọ emaedakka ekaa ekena ke mben Anọn, a-adaaha keed ye anaan a-anaaha akesịm idʌñ mbon Amọọ. Anọn ado adaña keed ye Mọb, ke ufọọd Mọb ye mbon Amọọ. <verse eid="NUM 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 21:14" />Ntak ado anam nọ Ñwed Mme Ekọñ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> abo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 21:14">“Sahab ke Sọfa ye mme itịkke,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 21:14">a-adooho Anọn <verse eid="NUM 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 21:15" />ye mme ndiatta itịkke</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 21:15">a-adatta akaa itie idʌñ Ar</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 21:15">anyʌññọ ana ke adaña Mọb.”<verse eid="NUM 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 21:16" />Ndin ammọ emaedakka ekaa Bee, ke ube mmọọñ ake <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akebooho Moses, “Bon nditọ Isrel itie keed ndin ami ñyaanọ ammọ mmọọñ.”<verse eid="NUM 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 21:17" />Akema nditọ Isrel emaekwọ ikwọ ami:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 21:17">“Sakka mmọọñ, O ube!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 21:17">Kwọ baña anye,<verse eid="NUM 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 21:18" />baña mme ube a-mme nditọ ideen mbọọñ eketịppeke,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 21:18">a-mme ñkpoonawo ekedọkkọ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 21:18">mme ñkpoonawo ye esañubọọñ ye mme esañeto.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="NUM 21:18">Ndin ammọ emaedakka ke anaan ekaa Matana, <verse eid="NUM 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 21:19" />enyʌñ etọọñọ ke Matana ekaa Nahaliel, ekpọñ Nahaliel ekaa Bamod, <verse eid="NUM 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 21:20" />ndin ammọ emaekpọñ Bamod ekaa abedeñ ke Mọb ke ukañ anyọñ Piska aseeghe mbiadaisọñ.<verse eid="NUM 21:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ekan Sihọn ye Ọk</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 21:21" />Nditọ Isrel emaedọñ mme isʌñutom ekaa ekebo Sihọn adidem mbon Amọọ:<verse eid="NUM 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 21:22" />“Yak ñnyịn isaña iboiyo ke idịd ndufo. Ñnyịn idiiwọññọke idʌk inwañ ndomokeed me inwañ fain, idiinyʌññọ inwọñ mmọọñ ke ube mmọọñ ndomokeed. Ñnyịn idiisaña ke Akpọusʌñ Adidem tutu ñnyịn iboiyo ke idʌñ mfo.”<verse eid="NUM 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 21:23" />Ado Sihọn ikiyakka Isrel aboiyo ke idʌñ amọ. Anye amaabeeñe mbon ekọñ idem anyʌñ asịññe afịd ammọ ekenwana ye Isrel ke anaan. Ke ini ammọ ekesịmme Yahas, anye amaanwana ye Isrel. <verse eid="NUM 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 21:24" />Kpayeado, nditọ Isrel emaewot anye ke akañkañ enyʌñ ebọ isọñ ammọ edat tọọñọ ke Anọn tutu ke Yabọk, ado akeben aketre ke mbon Amọn, sia adaña ammọ amaanie ndibene. <verse eid="NUM 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 21:25" />Nditọ Isrel emaemʌm afịd abio mbon Amọọ enyʌñ edʌñ ke esịd, adiana ye Hesbọn ye afịd ñkanñkʌk idʌñ ado. <verse eid="NUM 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 21:26" />Hesbọn akedo abio Adidem Sihọn mbon Amọọ, a-akenwanake ye akaan adidem Mọb anyʌñ abọ anye afịd isọñ tutu awuọ Anọn.<verse eid="NUM 21:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 21:27" />Ami ado ntak a-mme atañuto ebooho:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 21:27">“Di ke Hesbọn yak etịmme ebọp anye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 21:27">yak enam abio Sihọn atịmme asọọñọ ada.<verse eid="NUM 21:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 21:28" />“Ikañ amaabịppe ato Hesbọn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 21:28">edemeikañ ato abio Sihọn.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 21:28">Anye amaata Ar ke Mọb,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 21:28">mme ñkpisọñ amanaisọñ mme abod Anọn.<verse eid="NUM 21:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 21:29" />Adọdiọọk unọ fiin, Mọb!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 21:29">Emaisobo ndufo, mbon Kemos!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 21:29">Anye amaaben nditọ ideen amọ anọ nte mbon itọkekọñ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 21:29">ye nditọ ibaan amọ nte mbon e-emʌmmọ ke ekọñ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 21:29">enọ Sihọn adidem mbon Amọọ.<verse eid="NUM 21:29" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 21:30" />“Ado ñnyịn imaisio ammọ iduọọk;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 21:30">Esobo adudu Hesbọn afịd tutu awuọ Dibon.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 21:30">Ñnyịn imaiwuut ammọ tutu awuọ Nofa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 21:30">a-asannake akewuọ Medeba.”<verse eid="NUM 21:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 21:31" />Akema Isrel emaedʌñọ ke isọñ mbon Amọọ.<verse eid="NUM 21:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 21:32" />Ke Moses amaakenọ mme uyeb eka Yasa, nditọ Isrel emaedat mme ñkanñkʌk abio enyʌñ ebịne mbon Amọọ ekedʌñọke do esio. <verse eid="NUM 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 21:33" />Ndin ammọ emaewọññọ iso esaña edọọk ekaa ke usʌñ a-akaaha Basan, ndin Ọk adidem Basan ye afịd mbon ekọñ amọ emaewuọ ekaa edisoobo ye ammọ ke anwan ke Edrei.<verse eid="NUM 21:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 21:34" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Moses, “Kuuyak ndịk amọ unam fiin, sia ami mmeyaak anye usịn fiin ke ubọk, ye afịd mbon ekọñ amọ ye isọñ amọ. Nam ye anye ukem se afo akenam ye Sihọn adidem mbon Amọọ, a-akekarake ke Hesbọn.”<verse eid="NUM 21:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 21:35" />Ndin ammọ emaewot anye, ye nditọ ideen amọ ye afịd mbon ekọñ amọ, isʌhọke ndomokeed ke uwem. Ndin ammọ emaedat isọñ amọ enie.<verse eid="NUM 21:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="NUM 22" />
  <para style="s1">Balak Akoot Balaam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 22:1" />Ndin nditọ Isrel emaesaña ke unaisọñ Mọb enyʌñ ekena ekpere Inyañ Yọdan a-akekaañake ato Yeriko.<verse eid="NUM 22:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 22:2" />Ndin Balak ayịn Sipọọ amaakịt afịd se Isrel akenam ye mbon Amọọ, <verse eid="NUM 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 22:3" />Mọb amaanyʌñ akop akpọsọñ ndịk sia mme awo emaewak eti-eti. Ke akpanikọ, Mọb amaakop akpọsọñ ndịk ke ntak nditọ Isrel.<verse eid="NUM 22:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 22:4" />Mbon Mọb emaebo mme ñkpisọñ Midian, “Ekamba atu awo ami eyaenweem afịd ñkpọ se iba ikanna ñnyịn, kpa naña enañ anweem mbid ke inwañ.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 22:4">Ndin Balak ayịn Sipọọ, a-akedooho adidem Mọb ke ini ado, <verse eid="NUM 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 22:5" />amaanọ mme isʌñutom uyio nọ ekekoot Balaam ayịn Beo, a-akebaaha ke Petọ, a-akpereke Inyañ Yufretis, ke isọñ idʌñ a-anye atooho. Balak amaabo:</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="NUM 22:5">“Aba mme awo ewuọñọke ke Iyib; ammọ eyọyọhọ efʌk iso isọñ enyʌñ edʌñọ endiana miin. <verse eid="NUM 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 22:6" />Di idahami nyʌñ disịn isuuñọ nọ ibon ami, sia ammọ e-esọñ adudu eñkan miin. Akeme ido ami ñyaakan ammọ ñnyʌñ mbịne ammọ nsio ke isọñ. Sia ami mmediọọñọ ke e-ediọñ awo akeedodo a-afo adiọññọ, ndin e-esuuñọ awo akeedodo a-afo asuuñọke.”<verse eid="NUM 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 22:7" />Mme ñkpisọñ Mọb ye Midian emaedakka, enyʌñ eben akʌk ubre idiọñ ekama. Ke ini ammọ edisịmme Balaam, ammọ emaedọkkọ anye se Balak aketañ.<verse eid="NUM 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 22:8" />Balaam amaabo ammọ, “Inaa mi ke akonayio ami, ndin ami ñyaidokkọ ndufo ibọọrọ se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> annọ miin.” Ndin mme ñkpisọñ Mọb emaedañ ye anye.<verse eid="NUM 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 22:9" />Abasi amaadi abịne Balaam anyʌñ abịp anye, “Mme anie awo ido ami ye afo?”<verse eid="NUM 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 22:10" />Balaam amaabọọrọ Abasi ate, “Balak ayịn Sipọọ, adidem ke Mọb, annọ miin etob ami: <verse eid="NUM 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 22:11" />‘Mme awo e-etoho isọñ Iyib ewuọ efʌk iso isọñ. Di idahami nyʌñ suuñọ ammọ nnọ miin. Akemeido umaunam ntoro ami ñyaanwana ñkan ammọ ñnyʌñ mbịne ammọ nsio.’ ”<verse eid="NUM 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 22:12" />Ado Abasi amaabo Balaam, “Kuukeene ammọ. Inaaha afo asịn isuuñọ anọ ibon ami, sia edọdiọñ ammọ.”<verse eid="NUM 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 22:13" />Ke usiere ubakusen Balaam amaadakka ada anyʌñ abo mme ñkpisọñ Balak, “Itịmme inyọñọ idʌñ ndufo, sia <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> inyịmmeke ami ikeene ndufo.”<verse eid="NUM 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 22:14" />Akema mme ñkpisọñ Mọb emaetịmme ebịne Balak enyʌñ ekebo, “Balaam ikinyịmmeke adikeene ñnyịn.”<verse eid="NUM 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 22:15" />Ndin Balak amaadọñ mme ñkpisọñ mfen, e-ekewakka enyʌñ enie ukpono ekan ake akpa. <verse eid="NUM 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 22:16" />Ammọ emaedi ebịne Balaam enyʌñ ekebo:</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="NUM 22:16">“Ami ado se Balak ayịn Sipọọ abo: Kuuyak ñkpọ ndomokeed anam afo atre adidi imbịne miin, <verse eid="NUM 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 22:17" />sia ami ñyaunọ fiin utịb mfọn-mfọn ñnyʌñ nnam se adodo a-afo ayemme ami nnam. Di nyʌñ sueeñ ibon ami nnọ miin.”<verse eid="NUM 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 22:18" />Ado Balaam amaabọọrọ ammọ, “Akpekọm Balak akpennọ miin afịd silfa ye kold e-ebaaha ke ebekpo amọ, ami ñkpikikanna nnam ñkpọ ndomokeed a-adooho ekamba me etək-etək mbọhọ ewʌhọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi mmi. <verse eid="NUM 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 22:19" />Idahami ndin iba mi ke akonayio ami nọ ami nse ñkpọ mfen se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> adiitañ innọ miin.”<verse eid="NUM 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 22:20" />Ke akonayio ado Abasi amaadi abịne Balaam anyʌñ abo anye, “Sia mbon ami ekedi edukoot fiin, keene ammọ, ado nam se ami udọkkọ fiin kpọd.”<verse eid="NUM 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dọñki Balaam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 22:21" />Balaam amaadakka ada ke ubakusen, adọọk adoro ke dọñki amọ anyʌñ akeene mme ñkpisọñ mbon Mọb. <verse eid="NUM 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 22:22" />Ado Abasi amaayat esịd eti-eti ke ini anye akekaaha, ndin enyere <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaawuọ ada ke usʌñ adinam ikọ ye anye. Balaam akewat ke dọñki amọ, ye nditọufọk amọ iba ekesañake ye anye. <verse eid="NUM 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 22:23" />Ke ini dọñki akịtte enyere <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> naña ada ke usʌñ akama akañkañ ke ubọk, anye amaatịmme awuọ akpọñ usʌñ anyʌñ adʌk ikọd. Balaam amaamia anye nọ anye atịmme edem adʌk usʌñ.<verse eid="NUM 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 22:24" />Ndin enyere <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaada ke mfafaha usʌñ ke inwañ fain, ye ndibene ke edem iba usʌñ. <verse eid="NUM 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 22:25" />Ke ini dọñki akekịtte enyere <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, anye amaadian idem ke ndibene, akwọkkọ ukod Balaam ke ndibene. Ndin anye amaamaana amia dọñki.<verse eid="NUM 22:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 22:26" />Ndin enyere <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaadakka akaa iso anyʌñ akeda ke ataa mfafaha itie ake ufañ imikibaaha adiwọññọ, me ke nnasia me ke ufiin. <verse eid="NUM 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 22:27" />Ke ini dọñki akekịtte enyere <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, anye amaasuuk akʌbọ ke idak Balaam, ndin anye amaayat esịd anyʌñ amaana amia dọñki ke esañ amọ. <verse eid="NUM 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 22:28" />Ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaatat dọñki inua, anye amaanyʌñ abo Balaam, “Nsoo ke ami unam fiin a-anamma nọ afo ammia miin akañ ita?”<verse eid="NUM 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 22:29" />Balaam amaabọọrọ dọñki, “Afo amendat miin anam ndisịme! Akpekedo ami mmaakama akañkañ ke ubọk mmi, ñkpauwot fiin idahami.”<verse eid="NUM 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 22:30" />Ndin dọñki amaabo Balaam, “Nte ami ndooho dọñki mfo, a-afo asiwatta afịd ini tutu asịm usen mfịn? Kpaanam ami mmenam se nnam ami ye afo?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 22:30">Anye amaabọọrọ, “Iyoo.”<verse eid="NUM 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 22:31" />Ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaatat Balaam anyen, anye amaanyʌñ akịt enyere <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> naña ada ke usʌñ ye akañkañ amọ. Ndin anye amaanyuuk iwuod anyʌñ akʌp iso ke isọñ.<verse eid="NUM 22:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 22:32" />Enyere <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabịp anye, “Ntak afo akemiaha dọñki ado akañ ita-a? Ami ñkedi mi adinam ikọ ye afo sia usʌñ mfo inekkeke ke iso mmi. <verse eid="NUM 22:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 22:33" />Dọñki ado amañkịt miin anyʌñ awọññọ añkpọñ miin akañ ita. Adieke anye imiikpikiwọññọke iñkpọñ, ami ñkpaakuwot fiin idahami, ado ñkpaakeyaak anye ñyaak.”<verse eid="NUM 22:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 22:34" />Balaam amaabo enyere <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, “Ami mmenam se idiọọk. Ami ñkidiọọñọke ke afo mmọdo ada ke usʌñ adinam ikọ ye ami. Idahami adieke afo umuunemme esịd, ami ñyaatịmme ñnyọñ.”<verse eid="NUM 22:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 22:35" />Enyere <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Balaam, “Kaa ye mme ideen ado, ado tañ se ami udọkkọ fiin kpọd.” Akema Balaam amaakaa ye mme ñkpisọñ Balak.<verse eid="NUM 22:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 22:36" />Balak akekop ke Balaam asʌk adi, anye amaawuọ akesoobo ye anye ke abio Mọb ke adaña Anọn, ke mben idʌñ amọ. <verse eid="NUM 22:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 22:37" />Balak amaabo Balaam, “Nte ami ñkunọọhọ fiin usọp-usọp ikood? Ntak afo umuukudieghe umbịne miin-e? Anekke ado nte ami ñkanna adunọọ fiin utịb?”<verse eid="NUM 22:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 22:38" />Balaam amaabọọrọ Balak. “A-afọn, ami mmedi ubịne fiin ndin, ado ñkanna ndiitañ se ami mmama. Ana ntañ se Abasi ansịn miin ke inua.”<verse eid="NUM 22:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 22:39" />Ndin Balaam amaasaña ye Balak akaa Kiriad Husọd. <verse eid="NUM 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 22:40" />Balak amaawa enañ ye edọñ, anyʌñ anọ Balaam ye mme ñkpisọñ ekebaaha ye anye ubaak. <verse eid="NUM 22:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 22:41" />Ke ubakusen edemusen Balak amaaben Balaam adọọk akaa Bamod Baal, ndin ke itie ado anye amaakan akịt mme mben itie nnaa nditọ Isrel.<verse eid="NUM 22:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="NUM 23" />
  <para style="s1">Akpa Etob Balaam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 23:1" />Balaam amaabo Balak, “Bọp akpokoro uwa itiaba mi nnọ miin, diọñ ñyaaraenañ itiaba ye akukịmedọñ itiaba nnọ miin.” <verse eid="NUM 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 23:2" />Balak amaanam se Balaam aketañ, ndin ammọ awo iba emaewa ayaaraenañ keed ye akukịmedọñ keed ke akpokoro uwa keedekeed.<verse eid="NUM 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 23:3" />Ndin Balaam amaabo Balak, “Tie mi ke akpokoro uwa mfo ke ini ami ñkaaha nsan-nsan. Akemeido <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ayaadi adisoobo ye ami. Se adodo a-anye ayaarake añwọt miin ñyaadudọkkọ fiin.” Ndin anye amaadakka akaa iwuod abod ake eto imiidaha.<verse eid="NUM 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 23:4" />Ndin Abasi amaadisoobo ye anye, Balaam amaanyʌñ abo, “Ami mmediọñ akpokoro uwa itiaba, ndin ke akpokoro uwa keedekeed mmaanyʌñ ñwa ayaaraenañ keed ye akukịmedọñ keed.”<verse eid="NUM 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 23:5" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaasịn ikọ ke inua Balaam anyʌñ abo, “Tịmme kaa bịne Balak nyʌñ ke tañ ikọ ami nọ anye.”<verse eid="NUM 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 23:6" />Akema anye amaatịmme abịne anye anyʌñ akekịt anye nte ada ke mben ñkpọ uwa amọ, ye afịd mme ñkpisọñ ke Mọb. <verse eid="NUM 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 23:7" />Ndin Balaam amaanọ etob amọ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 23:7">“Balak akemben miin ato ke Aram,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:7">adidem Mọb ato ke mme abod usakkautịn</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 23:7">‘Di,’ anye amambo, ‘suuñọ Yekọb nnọ miin;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:7">di, kañ Isrel.’<verse eid="NUM 23:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 23:8" />Die ke ami mbo nsuuñọ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:8">mbon A-Abasi imiisuuñọke?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 23:8">Die ke ami mbo nsua nnọ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:8">mbon <char style="nd">A-Abọọñ</char> imiisuaha inọ?<verse eid="NUM 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 23:9" />Ami ñkeda ke mme atịñe ikpọitiad ñkịt ammọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:9">mmaada ke anyọñ mme abod ñkịt ammọ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 23:9">Ami mmaakịt mbon e-etieghe ke idem ammọ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:9">idatta idem ammọ nte mbon e-ebatta esịn ke atu mme idịd.<verse eid="NUM 23:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 23:10" />Anie ikan adibat ntọñ Yekọb</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:10">mme adibat mbakka keed ke itie inaañ Isrel?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 23:10">Yak ami ñkpa ñkpa adinen awo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:10">ñko yak akpatre utịd mmi aba nte ake ammọ!”<verse eid="NUM 23:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 23:11" />Balak amaabo Balaam, “Nsoo ke afo annam ami? Ami ñkudat fiin ndi nọ adisuuñọ mme asua mmi, ado afo unamma ñkpọ ndomokeed ukan adidiọñ ammọ!”<verse eid="NUM 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 23:12" />Anye amaabọọrọ, “Inaaha ami ntañ se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ansịn miin ke inua?”<verse eid="NUM 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ayọhọ Etob Balaam Iba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 23:13" />Ndin Balak amaabo anye, “Ñkeene miin kaa itie mfen a-afo akanna adikịt ammọ; afo uduukịtte afịd ammọ ibọhọke esiin itie nnaa ammọ. Ndin ke itie ado sueeñ ammọ nnọ miin.” <verse eid="NUM 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 23:14" />Akema anye amaaben anye akaa ke inwañ Sofim ke anyọñ iwuod Piska, anye amaanyʌñ abọp akpokoro uwa itiaba ke itie ado, amaanyʌñ awa ayaaraenañ keed ye akukịmedọñ keed ke mme akpokoro uwa keedekeed.<verse eid="NUM 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 23:15" />Balaam amaabo Balak, “Tie mi ke mben akpokoro uwa mfo ke ini ami ñkesooboke ye anye ke edem uko.”<verse eid="NUM 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 23:16" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaasoobo ye Balaam anyʌñ asịn ikọ ke inua amọ anyʌñ abo, “Tịmme kaa bịne Balak nyʌñ tañ ikọ ami nọ anye.”<verse eid="NUM 23:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 23:17" />Akema Balaam amaatịmme abịne anye anyʌñ akekịt anye nte ada ke mben ñkpọ uwa amọ, ye afịd mme ñkpisọñ ke Mọb. Balak amaabịp anye ate, “Nsoo ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ?”<verse eid="NUM 23:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 23:18" />Ndin anye amaatañ etob amọ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 23:18">Dakka da, Balak, nyʌñ kpañ utọñ:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:18">kop se ami ntañ, ayịn Sipọọ.<verse eid="NUM 23:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 23:19" />Abasi idooho awo, ake anye akpesʌhọke nsu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:19">idooho awo, ake anye akpekappake esịd.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 23:19">Nte anye atañ ikọ ndin atre adinam?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:19">Nte anye anwọñọ ndin atre adinam?<verse eid="NUM 23:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 23:20" />Ami mmebọ ewʌhọ adidiọñ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:20">anye a-adiọñ, ndin ami ñkemeke adikpəho.<verse eid="NUM 23:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 23:21" />“Ikịtte ndiọọkiso ke Yekọb,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:21">inyʌññọ ikịt ukuud ke Isrel.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 23:21">
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ammọ mmọdo ye ammọ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:21">ñkpo adidem mmọdo ke atu ammọ.<verse eid="NUM 23:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 23:22" />Abasi akesịññe ammọ ke Iyib;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:22">ammọ enie adudu nte ayaaraenañ.<verse eid="NUM 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 23:23" />Ubre idiọñ ibaaha inọ Yekọb,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:23">idiọọk idiọọñọ ibaaha inọ Isrel.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 23:23">Ke akem ini eyaetañ ebaña Yekọb</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:23">ye Isrel ñko, ‘Se se Abasi anam!’<verse eid="NUM 23:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 23:24" />Mbon ami edakka eda nte uman ekpe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:24">ammọ ebịmme idem ammọ nte ekpe</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 23:24">i-imiiduọkkọ adudu tutu anye ata se anye amʌm</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:24">anyʌñ anwọñ iyiib ñkpọ se anye awot.”<verse eid="NUM 23:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 23:25" />Ndin Balak amaabo Balaam, “Kuunyʌñ usuesueeñ ammọ kuunyʌñ udọdiọñ ammọ!”<verse eid="NUM 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 23:26" />Balaam amaabọọrọ Balak. “Nte ami ñketañña unọ fiin nte ke ana nnam se adodo <char style="nd">A-Abọọñ</char> andọkkọke?”<verse eid="NUM 23:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ayọhọ Etob Balaam Ita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 23:27" />Ndin Balak amaabo Balaam, “Di, yak ami udat fiin ñkaa itie mfen. Akemeido ayaanem Abasi esịd adiyak nọ afo ada ke itie ado asuuñọ ammọ annọ miin.” <verse eid="NUM 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 23:28" />Akema Balak amaadat Balaam akaa ke anyọñ iwuod abod Pio, a-asakkaiso ase mbiara isọñ.<verse eid="NUM 23:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 23:29" />Balaam amaabo Balak, “Bọp akpokoro uwa itiaba mi nnọ miin, diọñ ñyaaraenañ itiaba ye akukịmedọñ itiaba nnọ miin.” <verse eid="NUM 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 23:30" />Balak amaanam se Balaam aketañ, anyʌñ awa ayaaraenañ keed ye akukịmedọñ keed ke akpokoro uwa keedekeed.<verse eid="NUM 23:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="NUM 24" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 24:1" />Ndin ke ini Balaam akekịtte ke anem <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> esịd adidiọñ Isrel, anye ikidotto anyen ke idiọñ nte naña akedo ke mme ini mfen, ado amaakanna iso amọ ase anaan. <verse eid="NUM 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 24:2" />Ke ini Balaam atịmmeke ase anye amaanyʌñ akịt ke Isrel ekebono ke esiin ke esiin, Sịbidịd Abasi amaadoro anye <verse eid="NUM 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 24:3" />ndin anye amaatañ etob amọ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:3">“Ñkukịd Balaam ayịn Beo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:3">ñkukịd awo a-anyen amọ amọọnọke inwañ-inwañ,<verse eid="NUM 24:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 24:4" />brọfesi awo a-akoppo ikọ Abasi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:4">a-akịtte ñkukịd a-atooho Andikoñ Ñkan,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ke usem Hibru ado Sadai; se ñko ke Nọmba 24:16</char></note></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:4">a-aduọhọ ana anyan, a-anyen amọ anyʌññọ ana inwañ.<verse eid="NUM 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 24:5" />“Yekọb, mme atayad mfo eyaiya die,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:5">mme itie idʌñ mfo, Isrel!<verse eid="NUM 24:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 24:6" />“Ammọ etara nte mme abedeñ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:6">nte mme inwañ ke mben inyañ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:6">nte mme ñkọñ alo ake <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atọọhọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:6">nte mme eto sida ke mben mmọọñ.<verse eid="NUM 24:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 24:7" />Mmọọñ ayaafiọọrọ ato ke mme abañ ammọ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:7">ñkpasi ammọ ayaanie mmọọñ akemme.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="NUM 24:7" />
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:7">“Adidem ammọ ayaakpon akan Akak;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:7">abio adidem ammọ eyaebenne.<verse eid="NUM 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 24:8" />“Abasi akesioño ammọ ke Iyib;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:8">ammọ enie adudu ayaaraenañ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:8">Ammọ etata mme idịd e-edooho asua</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:8">enyʌñ eboom mme akpọ ammọ ñkeñe-ñkeñe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:8">edat idañ ammọ ekuum ammọ.<verse eid="NUM 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 24:9" />Nte ekpe ammọ enʌhọ enyʌñ esuuk enaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:9">nte uman ekpe, anie ukeme adibịmme ammọ?</para>
  <para style="b" vid="NUM 24:9" />
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:9">“Mbon se udiọñ fiin yak enyʌñ ediọñ ammọ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:9">Mbon se usuuñọ fiin yak enyʌñ esuuñọ ammọ!”<verse eid="NUM 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 24:10" />Ndin Balak amaayat esịd ikañ-ikañ ye Balaam. Anye amaamia ubọk amọ naña iba anyʌñ abo anye, “Ami ñkukoot fiin adisueeñ mme asua mmi, ado afo ametịmme adiọñ ammọ akañ ita ado ami. <verse eid="NUM 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 24:11" />Idahami kpọñ ini keed nyọñ kaa ufọk mfo! Ami mmaabo ke ñyaunọ fiin utịb ayaiyake, ado <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> iyakka afo abọ utịb ado.”<verse eid="NUM 24:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 24:12" />Balaam amaabọọrọ Balak ate, “Nte ami ñkedọkkọke mme isʌñutom a-afo akedọññọ annọ miin, <verse eid="NUM 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 24:13" />‘Akpekọm Balak akpennọ miin afịd silfa ye kold ke ebekpo amọ, ami ñkpikanna nnam ñkpọ ndomokeed ke idem mmi, me eti me idiọọk, adinam mbọhọ ewʌhọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, ndin ana ami ntañ se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> abo yak ntañ kpọd’? <verse eid="NUM 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 24:14" />Idahami ami mmetịmme ñnyọñ mbịne mbon mmi, ado di, yak ami udọkkọ fiin se mbon ami ediinam mbon mfo ke mme usen e-ediighe ke iso.”<verse eid="NUM 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ayọhọ Etob Balaam Inaañ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 24:15" />Ndin anye amaatañ etob amọ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:15">“Ñkukịd Balaam ayịn Beo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:15">ñkukịd awo a-anyen amọ akịtte inwañ-inwañ,<verse eid="NUM 24:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 24:16" />prọfesi awo a-akoppo ikọ ato Abasi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:16">a-anieghe ifiọk a-atooho Andikoñ Ñkan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:16">a-akịtte ñkukịd a-atooho Andikponñkan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:16">a-aduọhọ ana anyan, a-anyen amọ anyʌññọ ana inwañ.<verse eid="NUM 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 24:17" />“Ami mmekịt anye, ado idooho idahami,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:17">Ami mmese anye, ado ikpereke.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:17">Ntantaafiọñ ayaawuọ ato Yekọb;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:17">esañ ubọọñ ayaadakka ato Isrel.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:17">Anye ayaanuak akoiso Mọb,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:17">mme ñkpọkpọrọ afịd mbon Sed.<verse eid="NUM 24:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 24:18" />Eyaekan Edọm;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:18">eyaekan Sei, asua ammọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:18">ado Isrel ayaakpon ke adudu.<verse eid="NUM 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 24:19" />Andikara ayaawuọ ato ke Yekọb</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:19">anyʌñ asobo mme ñyọhọnsʌhọ ke abio.”<verse eid="NUM 24:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ayọhọ Etob Balaam Ition</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 24:20" />Ndin Balaam amaakịt Amalek anyʌñ atañ etob amọ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:20">“Amalek akedo akpa ke atu mme idịd,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:20">ado utịd ammọ adiido nsi-nsi nsobo.”<verse eid="NUM 24:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ayọhọ Etob Balaam Itiokeed</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 24:21" />Ndin anye amaakịt mbon Keen anyʌñ atañ etob amọ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:21">“Itie idʌñ mfo asọọñọada,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:21">efọk mfo asịne ke itiad;<verse eid="NUM 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 24:22" />kpayeado eyaisobo ndufo mbon Keen</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:22">ke ini Asiria imʌmmọ ndufo nte ifʌn.”<verse eid="NUM 24:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ayọhọ Etob Balaam Itiaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 24:23" />Ndin anye amaatañ etob amọ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:23">“Sai! Anie ikan idu uwem ke ini Abasi anamma ami?<verse eid="NUM 24:23" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 24:24" />Mme ñkpoon nsʌñikañ eyaeto ke esʌk Saiprọs edi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:24">ammọ eyaesuuk iwuod Asiria ye Ebee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:24">ado eyaenyʌñ esobo ammọ ñko.”<verse eid="NUM 24:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 24:25" />Ndin Balaam amaadakka ada anyʌñ atịmme anyọñ ufọk amọ, Balak amaanyʌñ akaa usʌñ amọ.<verse eid="NUM 24:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="NUM 25" />
  <para style="s1">Mbon Mọb Etap Isrel Esịn ke Idiọọk.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 25:1" />Ke ini Isrel ekesʌkkọ edʌñọ ke abio Sitịm, ideen ammọ emaetọọñọ adinam use ye nditọ ibaan Mọb, <verse eid="NUM 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 25:2" />e-ekekoodo ammọ yak edi itie unam uwa abasi ammọ. Ideen Isrel ami emaedia ndidia uwa ado enyʌñ etuak iwuod enọ mme abasi ado. <verse eid="NUM 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 25:3" />Ke ntoro, Isrel emaedian idem ammọ ye Baal ake Pọọ. Ke ntak ado <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaayat esịd ye ammọ.<verse eid="NUM 25:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 25:4" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Moses, “Dat afịd mme adadusʌñ ke atu ibon ami, wot ammọ nyʌñ suenne ammọ ke ufọọd uweemeayio iba ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, nọ ato do ekan ewọññọ ufiob iyadesịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ekpọñ Isrel.”<verse eid="NUM 25:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 25:5" />Ke ntoro, Moses amaabo mme abiideikpe ke Isrel ate, “Ana ndufo keedekeed ewot mbon ndufo se imaidian idem utịñe-utịñe ye Baal mbon Pọọ.”<verse eid="NUM 25:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 25:6" />Ndin awodeen Isrel keed amaaben awonwaan Midian keed adi esob mbon Isrel ke iso Moses ye afịd eboho nditọ Isrel ke ini ammọ esʌkkọ etua ke ntondʌk atayad mbono. <verse eid="NUM 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 25:7" />Ke ini Finehas ayịn Eliasa, ayịn Erọn, a-akedooho aku, akekịtte ami, anye amaadakka akpọñ itie mbono, akebenne eduad <verse eid="NUM 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 25:8" />anyʌñ asaña akeene awo Isrel ado adʌk atayad. Anye akewuuk ammọ awo iba eduad ado ato ke idịb awodeen Isrel adiwuọ idịb awonwaan ado. Ndin idiọọk unọmọ akenọmọke nditọ Isrel amaatre; <verse eid="NUM 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 25:9" />ado mbon se ikikpa ke unọmọ ado amaawuọ tọsịn edịb mme inaañ (24,000) ke ibad.<verse eid="NUM 25:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 25:10" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Moses ate, <verse eid="NUM 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 25:11" />“Finehas ayịn Eliasa, ayịn Erọn, anye a-adooho aku, a-awọññọ iyadesịd mmi asio akpọñ mbon Isrel. Sia adooho anye amaasịn ifịk ke adinnọ miin ukpono ke ufọọd ammọ kpa naña ami mba. Ami ñkiwotto ammọ ke ifịkesịd mmi. <verse eid="NUM 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 25:12" />Ke ntoro, dọkkọ anye ke ami mmenam edioomo emem mmi ye anye. <verse eid="NUM 25:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 25:13" />Anye ye afịd ubon amọ eyaenie edioomo adido aku ñkpeene, sia anye amaasịn ifịk adinọ Abasi amọ ukpono anyʌñ anam ñkpeubọk anọ nditọ Isrel.”<verse eid="NUM 25:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 25:14" />Anyịñ awodeen Isrel e-ekewotto ye awonwaan Midian akedo Simri ayịn Salu, adadusʌñ ke ekpək mbon Simiọn. <verse eid="NUM 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 25:15" />Awonwaan Midian e-ekewotto akekere Kosbi ayịn awonwaan Sọọ, a-akedooho abọọñ mbon Midian.<verse eid="NUM 25:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 25:16" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Moses ate, <verse eid="NUM 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 25:17" />“Idat mbon Midian nte mme asua inyʌñ iwot ammọ. <verse eid="NUM 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 25:18" />Ammọ ekidat ndufo nte mme asua ke ini ammọ ekibiañake ndufo ke ini ñkpọ Pio a-akebañake ayịneka awonwaan ammọ Kosbi, ayịn awonwaan adadusʌñ ke ekpək mbon Midian, awonwaan e-ekewotto idaha unọmọ ado akediighe ato ke mfịna ado.”<verse eid="NUM 25:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="NUM 26" />
  <para style="s1">Ayọhọ Ubadawo Iba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 26:1" />Ke unọmọ ado amaakekweeñe <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Moses ye Eliasa ayịn Erọn, a-akedooho aku, <verse eid="NUM 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 26:2" />“Inam ibad afịd nditọ Isrel ke ekpək ke ekpək, afịd mbon se iyọhọ isua edịb me ekpono ekan ekemeke ediba ke udịmekọñ Isrel.” <verse eid="NUM 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 26:3" />Ndin Moses ye Eliasa a-akedooho aku emaetañ ikọ ye ammọ ke unaisọñ Mọb ke mben Yọdan ke edem Yeriko ebo, <verse eid="NUM 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 26:4" />“Inam ubadawo inọ ideen se isịm isua edịb me akanna ado kpa naña <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akedọkkọ Moses.”</para>
  <para style="b" vid="NUM 26:4" />
  <para style="li4" vid="NUM 26:4">Nditọ Isrel se ikiwuọ ito Iyib edo ami:<verse eid="NUM 26:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 26:5" />Mbon se ito Rubịn, akpan Isrel, ekedoñño:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 26:5">Se ikito Hanọk, ubon Hanọk;</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 26:5">Se ikito Palu, ubon Palu;<verse eid="NUM 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 26:6" />Se ikito Hesrọn, ubon Hesrọn;</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 26:6">Se ikito Kaami, ubon Kaami.<verse eid="NUM 26:6" /></para>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 26:7" />Ubon Rubịn akedo ami; mbon se ekebat ekedo tọsịn aba mme ita mme ikie itiaba mme edịb mme duob (43,730).<verse eid="NUM 26:7" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 26:8" />Ayịn awodeen Palu akedo Eliab, <verse eid="NUM 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 26:9" />ndin nditọ ideen Eliab ekedo Nemuel, Datan ye Abiram. Kpa Datan ye Abiram ekedo mme ikpọ mbon utom idʌñ ekesọññọ iwuod ye Moses ye Erọn ekenyʌññọ eba ke atu udịmekọñ Kora ke ini ammọ ekesọññọ iwuod ye <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="NUM 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 26:10" />Isọñ amaakʌppọ inua anyʌñ amen ammọ ye Kora, u-udịm se ikikeene anye ekekpaññake ke ini ikañ aketaaha ideen ikie iba mme aba mme duob (250). Ndin ami amaakappa aba nte idiọọñọ ndʌdutọñ. <verse eid="NUM 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 26:11" />Kpayeado, nditọ Kora ikikpaaha ima.<verse eid="NUM 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 26:12" />Nditọ Simiọn ke ubon ke ubon ekedo:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 26:12">Se ito Nemuel, ubon nditọ Nemuel;</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 26:12">Se ikito Yamịn, ubon nditọ Yamịn;</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 26:12">Se ikito Yakịn, ubon nditọ Yakịn;<verse eid="NUM 26:12" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 26:13" />Se ikito Seera, ubon nditọ Seera;</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 26:13">Se ikito Sọọl, ubon nditọ Sọọl.<verse eid="NUM 26:13" /></para>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 26:14" />Ami akedo mbon se ikito ubon Simiọn; mbon se ekebat ekedo tọsịn edịb mme iba mme ikie iba (22,200).<verse eid="NUM 26:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 26:15" />Mme nditọ Kad ke ubon ke ubon ekedo:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 26:15">Se ikito Safọn, ubon nditọ Safọn;</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 26:15">Se ito Hakai, ubon nditọ Hakai;</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 26:15">Se ikito Suni, ubon nditọ Suni;<verse eid="NUM 26:15" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 26:16" />Se ikito Osni, ubon Osni;</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 26:16">Se ikito Eri, ubon Eri;<verse eid="NUM 26:16" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 26:17" />Se ikito Arodi, ubon Arod;</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 26:17">Se ikito Areli, ubon Areli.<verse eid="NUM 26:17" /></para>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 26:18" />Mbon ami ekedo ubon Kad; mbon se ekebat ekedo tọsịn aba mme ikie ition (40,500).<verse eid="NUM 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 26:19" />Er ye Ọnan ekedo nditọ ideen Yuda, ado ammọ emaekpa ke Kenan.<verse eid="NUM 26:19" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 26:20" />Mme nditọ Yuda ke ubon ke ubon ekedo:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 26:20">Se ikito Sela, ubon nditọ Sela;</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 26:20">Se ikito Peres, ubon nditọ Peres;</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 26:20">Se ikito Seera, ubon nditọ Seera.<verse eid="NUM 26:20" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 26:21" />Mme nditọ Peres ekedo:</para>
  <para style="li3" vid="NUM 26:21">Se ikito Hesrọn, ubon nditọ Hesrọn;</para>
  <para style="li3" vid="NUM 26:21">Se ikito Hamul, ubon nditọ Hamul.<verse eid="NUM 26:21" /></para>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 26:22" />Mme mbon ami ekedo ubon nditọ Yuda; mbon se ekebat ekedo tọsịn ata mme duob mme itiokeed mme ikie ition (76,500).<verse eid="NUM 26:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 26:23" />Mme nditọ Isaka ke ubon ke ubon ekedo:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 26:23">Se ikito Tola, ubon Tola;</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 26:23">Se ikito Pua, ubon Pua;<verse eid="NUM 26:23" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 26:24" />Se ikito Yasub, ubon Yasub;</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 26:24">Se ikito Simrọn, ubon Simrọn.<verse eid="NUM 26:24" /></para>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 26:25" />Mme mbon ami ekedo mbon ubon Isaka; mbon se ekebat ekedo tọsịn ata mme inaañ mme ikie ita (64,300).<verse eid="NUM 26:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 26:26" />Mme nditọ Sebulọn ke ubon ke ubon ekedo:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 26:26">Se ikito Sered, ubon nditọ Sered;</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 26:26">Se ikito Elon, ubon nditọ Elon;</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 26:26">Se ikito Yaleel, ubon nditọ Yaleel.<verse eid="NUM 26:26" /></para>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 26:27" />Mme mbon ami ekedo ubon nditọ Sebulọn; mbon se ekebat ekedo tọsịn ata mme ikie ition (60,500).<verse eid="NUM 26:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 26:28" />Mme nditọ Yosef ke ubon ke ubon se ikito Manase ye Ifrem ekedo:<verse eid="NUM 26:28" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 26:29" />Mme ubon nditọ Manase:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 26:29">Se ikito Makia, ubon nditọ Makia (Makia akedo ete Kilied);</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 26:29">Se ikito Kilied, ubon nditọ Kilied.<verse eid="NUM 26:29" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 26:30" />Ami akedo ubon nditọ Kilied;</para>
  <para style="li3" vid="NUM 26:30">Se ikito Iyesa, ubon nditọ Iyesa;</para>
  <para style="li3" vid="NUM 26:30">Se ikito Helek, ubon nditọ Helek;<verse eid="NUM 26:30" /></para>
  <para style="li3">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 26:31" />Se ikito Asriel, ubon Asriel;</para>
  <para style="li3" vid="NUM 26:31">Se ikito Sekem, ubon Sekem;<verse eid="NUM 26:31" /></para>
  <para style="li3">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 26:32" />Se ikito Semida, ubon Semida;</para>
  <para style="li3" vid="NUM 26:32">Se ikito Hefa, ubon Hefa.<verse eid="NUM 26:32" /></para>
  <para style="li3">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 26:33" />(Selofehad ayịn Hefa ikinieghe ayịn ndomokeed; anye akenie nditọ ibaan ikpọọñ, e-ekekereke Mahla, Nua, Hokla, Milka ye Tisa.)<verse eid="NUM 26:33" /></para>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 26:34" />Ami akedo ubon nditọ Manase; mbon se ekebat ekedo tọsịn aba mme duob mme iba mme ikie itiaba (52,700).<verse eid="NUM 26:34" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 26:35" />Ami akedo ubon nditọ Ifrem ke ubon ke ubon:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 26:35">Se ikito Sutela, ubon nditọ Sutela;</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 26:35">Se ikito Beka, ubon nditọ Beka;</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 26:35">Se ikito Tahan, ubon nditọ Tahan.<verse eid="NUM 26:35" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 26:36" />Mme mbon ami ekedo ubon nditọ Sutela</para>
  <para style="li3" vid="NUM 26:36">Se ikito Eran, ubon Eran.<verse eid="NUM 26:36" /></para>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 26:37" />Mbon nditọ Ifrem akedo ami; mbon se ekebat ekedo tọsịn edịb mme duob mme iba mme ikie ition (32,500).</para>
  <para style="li4" vid="NUM 26:37">Ami akedo ubon nditọ Yosef ke ubon ke ubon.<verse eid="NUM 26:37" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 26:38" />Mme ubon nditọ Benyamin ke ubon ke ubon akedo:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 26:38">Se ikito Bela, ubon nditọ Bela;</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 26:38">Se ikito Asbel, ubon nditọ Asbel;</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 26:38">Se ikito Ahiram, ubon nditọ Ahiram;<verse eid="NUM 26:38" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 26:39" />Se ikito Sufam, ubon nditọ Sufam;</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 26:39">Se ikito Hufam, ubon nditọ Hufam.<verse eid="NUM 26:39" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 26:40" />Mme ubon nditọ Bela se ikito Ard ye Neman ekedo:</para>
  <para style="li3" vid="NUM 26:40">Se ikito Ard, ubon Ard;</para>
  <para style="li3" vid="NUM 26:40">Se ikito Neman, ubon Neman.<verse eid="NUM 26:40" /></para>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 26:41" />Ami akedo mme ubon Benyamin; se ekebat ekedo tọsịn aba mme ition mme ikie itiokeed (45,600).<verse eid="NUM 26:41" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 26:42" />Ubon nditọ Daan akedo ami ke ubon ke ubon:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 26:42">Se ikito Suham, ubon nditọ Suham.</para>
  <para style="li4" vid="NUM 26:42">Ami akedo ubon nditọ Daan: <verse eid="NUM 26:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 26:43" />Afịd ammọ ekedoñño ubon nditọ Suham; ñko se ekebat ekedo tọsịn ata mme inaañ mme ikie inaañ (64,400).<verse eid="NUM 26:43" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 26:44" />Mme nditọ Asaa ke ubon ke ubon ekedo:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 26:44">Se ikito Imna, ubon nditọ Imna;</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 26:44">Se ikito Isfi, ubon nditọ Isfi;</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 26:44">Se ikito Beria, ubon nditọ Beria;<verse eid="NUM 26:44" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 26:45" />Ñko se ikito Beria, ubon nditọ Beria:</para>
  <para style="li3" vid="NUM 26:45">Se ikito Heba, ubon nditọ Heba;</para>
  <para style="li3" vid="NUM 26:45">Se ikito Malkiel, ubon nditọ Malkiel.<verse eid="NUM 26:45" /></para>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 26:46" />Asaa amaanie ayịn awonwaan a-akekereke Sera.<verse eid="NUM 26:46" /></para>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 26:47" />Ami akedo ubon nditọ Asaa; mbon se ekebat akedo tọsịn aba mme duob mme ita mme ikie inaañ (53,400).<verse eid="NUM 26:47" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 26:48" />Mme nditọ Naftali ke ubon ke ubon ekedo:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 26:48">Se ikito Yaseel, ubon nditọ Yaseel;</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 26:48">Se ikito Kuuni, ubon nditọ Kuuni;<verse eid="NUM 26:48" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 26:49" />Se ikito Yesa, ubon Yesa;</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 26:49">Se ikito Silem, ubon Silem<verse eid="NUM 26:49" /></para>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 26:50" />Ami akedo ubon Naftali; se ekebat ekedo tọsịn aba mme ition mme ikie inaañ (45,400).<verse eid="NUM 26:50" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="NUM 26:51" />Afịd ibad ideen ke Isrel akedʌk tọsịn ikie itiokeed mme keed mme ikie itiaba mme edịb mme duob (601,730).<verse eid="NUM 26:51" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="NUM 26:52" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Moses ate, <verse eid="NUM 26:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="NUM 26:53" />“Ediideeme isọñ inọ ammọ nte udeemeñkpọ ammọ akeene ibad anyịñ se enie. <verse eid="NUM 26:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="NUM 26:54" />Mbon se ubon ammọ awak, nọ udeemeñkpọ se ikpon, mbon se ido etək-etək nyʌñ nọ udeemeñkpọ etək-etək; ammọ keedekeed ana ebọ udeemeñkpọ ammọ akeene ibad se ekebat. <verse eid="NUM 26:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="NUM 26:55" />Kịt bo ke edeeme isọñ ke adisịn afia. Se ekpək keedekeed edat adiikeene anyịñ eteete ammọ. <verse eid="NUM 26:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="NUM 26:56" />Afịd udeemeñkpọ ammọ ado se ediideeme ikeene naña esịn afia eka ke ufọọd ikpọ ye ntək ikpeghe.”<verse eid="NUM 26:56" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="NUM 26:57" />Mbon ami edo mme Lifai e-ekebatta ke ubon ke ubon ammọ:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 26:57">Se ikito Kesọn, ubon nditọ Kesọn;</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 26:57">Se ikito Kohad, ubon nditọ Kohad;</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 26:57">Se ikito Merari, ubon Merari.<verse eid="NUM 26:57" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="NUM 26:58" />Mbon ami ñko ekedo nditọ Lifai:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 26:58">Ubon Libni,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 26:58">Ubon nditọ Hibrọn,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 26:58">Ubon nditọ Mahli, ubon nditọ Musi</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 26:58">Ubon nditọ Kora,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 26:58">(Kohad akedo nsọbom Amram; <verse eid="NUM 26:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="NUM 26:59" />anyịñ anwaan Amram akedo Yokebed, a-aketooho ubon Lifai, a-akemanake anọ mme Lifai ke Iyib. Anye amaaman Erọn, Moses ye Miriam ayịneka ammọ awonwaan. <verse eid="NUM 26:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="NUM 26:60" />Erọn akebon Nadab ye Abihu, Eliasa ye Itama. <verse eid="NUM 26:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="NUM 26:61" />Ado Nadab ye Abihu emaekpa ke ini ammọ ekenamma uwa ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ye ikañ a-awo imiikinọọhọ ammọ adudu).<verse eid="NUM 26:61" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="NUM 26:62" />Afịd nditọ ideen Lifai tọọñọ ke afiọñ keed ye se ikpon ikan ado ekedo tọsịn edịb mme ita (23,000). Awo ikibatta ammọ idian ye mbon Isrel mbon ako sia ammọ ikibọọhọ udeemeñkpọ ndomokeed ke atu ammọ.<verse eid="NUM 26:62" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="NUM 26:63" />Mme mbon ami edo mbon se Moses ye Eliasa a-akedooho aku ekebat ke ini ammọ ekebatta nditọ Isrel ke unaisọñ Mọb ke ñkpere Yọdan ke edem Yeriko. <verse eid="NUM 26:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="NUM 26:64" />Awo ammọ ndomokeed ikibaaha ke atu mbon se Moses ye Erọn a-akedooho aku ekebat ke ini ammọ ekebatta nditọ Isrel ke Akpautatan Sainai. <verse eid="NUM 26:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="NUM 26:65" />Sia <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaadọkkọ nditọ Isrel ke ammọ ana ekpa ke anaan, ñko awo ammọ nte keed ikisʌhọke ibọhọke Kaleb ayịn Yefune ye Yọsua ayịn Nọn.<verse eid="NUM 26:65" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="NUM 27" />
  <para style="s1">Nditọ Ibaan Selofehad</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 27:1" />Mme nditọ ibaan Selofehad a-akedooho ayịn Hefa, ayịn Kilied, ayịn Makia, ayịn Manase, akesịne ke ubon Manase ayịn Yosef. Mme anyịñ nditọ ibaan ado ekedo Mahla, Nua, Hokla, Milka ye Tisa. Ammọ emaewuọñọ edi iso <verse eid="NUM 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 27:2" />edida ke iso Moses, iso Eliasa a-akedooho aku, mme adadusʌñ ye afịd eboho ke ntondʌk atayad mbono emaenyʌñ ebo, <verse eid="NUM 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 27:3" />“Ete ñnyịn amaakpa ke anaan. Anye ikisịneke ke atu mbon se ikikeene Kora, akekọọhọ iwuod enwana ye <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, ado anye akekpa ke ntak idiọọkñkpọ amọ ndin anye ikibonno nditọ ideen. <verse eid="NUM 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 27:4" />Nsoo ido ntak yak anyịñ ete ñnyịn akpesop ke ubon amọ ke ntak anye imiikinieghe nditọ ideen? Inọ ñnyịn ñkpọ ete ñnyịn ke atu nditọete ete ñnyịn.”<verse eid="NUM 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 27:5" />Ke ntoro, Moses amaaben mfịna ammọ akaa iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="NUM 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 27:6" /><char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaanyʌñ abo Moses, <verse eid="NUM 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 27:7" />“Se nditọ ibaan Selofehad etañ anen. Ana afo anọ ammọ udeemeñkpọ ete ammọ ke atu nditọ ete ammọ anyʌñ ayaak inie ete ammọ anọ ammọ.”<verse eid="NUM 27:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 27:8" />“Dọkkọ nditọ Isrel bo, ‘Adieke awodeen akpaaha ibonno ayịn, yak eyaak udeemeñkpọ amọ enọ ayịn amọ awonwaan. <verse eid="NUM 27:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 27:9" />Akpedo inieghe nditọ ibaan ñko, ana eyaak udeemeñkpọ amọ enọ nditọeka amọ ideen. <verse eid="NUM 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 27:10" />Adieke anye imiinieghe nditọeka ideen, yak eyaak inie amọ enọ nditọeka ideen ete amọ. <verse eid="NUM 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 27:11" />Adieke ete amọ imiikinieghe nditọeka ideen yak enọ nditọete ete amọ se ikpere ikan ke ubon amọ inie amọ, yak ammọ adat anie. Ami ado adinam mbed anie nsọọñọnda ke atu nditọ Isrel, kpa naña <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akedọkkọ Moses.’ ”<verse eid="NUM 27:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yọsua Adiidat Itie Moses</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 27:12" />Akema <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaadọkkọ Moses abo, “Dọọk kaa ke abod ke Abarim nyʌñ se isọñ ami nnọọhọ nditọ Isrel. <verse eid="NUM 27:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 27:13" />Afo umause uma, eyaenyʌñ uben fiin ñko ekenịm ye aduuk mfo kpa naña ekenam ye Erọn ayịneka mfo, <verse eid="NUM 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 27:14" />sia ke ini abio ekemiommo uyio mmi ke mben mmọọñ a-abaaha ke Akpautatan ke Sịn, naña ndufo mba emaetre utọñ enọ ikọ mmi adiñkpono miin nte adisana ke iso ammọ.” (Ami ekedoñño mmọọñ Meriba Kades, ke Akpautatan Sịn.)<verse eid="NUM 27:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 27:15" />Moses amaabo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, <verse eid="NUM 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 27:16" />“Yak <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Abasi andinọ afịd aduuwem ñkpọ inweek, amek awo yak adikara abio ami. <verse eid="NUM 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 27:17" />Ke adiwuọ ye ke adidʌk, awo se idiidat ammọ usʌñ iwuọ inyʌñ idʌk, mbaak mbon ubon <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ediba nte edọñ i-imiinieghe andikpeme.”<verse eid="NUM 27:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 27:18" />Ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Moses, “Ben Yọsua ayịn Nọn, awodeen a-anieghe sịbidịd adikara, nyʌñ dot anye ubọk. <verse eid="NUM 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 27:19" />Nam anye ada ke iso Eliasa a-adooho aku ye ke iso afịd esob Isrel nyʌñ nọ anye item ke iso ammọ. <verse eid="NUM 27:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 27:20" />Nyʌñ yak usʌk adudu mfo dot anye ke idem nọ afịd ubon Isrel ekop uyio amọ. <verse eid="NUM 27:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 27:21" />Anye ana ada ke iso Eliasa a-adooho aku, a-adiibọ ikọ inọ anye ke adibịp Urim ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. Ke uyio amọ, anye ye afịd abio Isrel eyaewuọ ke uyio amọ, ñko afịd abio Isrel eyaenyʌñ edʌk edi.”<verse eid="NUM 27:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 27:22" />Moses amaanam naña <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> aketemme anye. Anye amaaben Yọsua akaa iso Eliasa a-akedooho aku ye ke iso afịd esob. <verse eid="NUM 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 27:23" />Ndin anye amaadot anye ubọk anyʌñ anọ anye item uwem, kpa naña <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akebo Moses anam.<verse eid="NUM 27:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="NUM 28" />
  <para style="s1">Enọ Usen ke Usen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 28:1" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Moses ate, <verse eid="NUM 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 28:2" />“Nọ nditọ Isrel ewʌhọ ami nyʌñ bo ammọ: ‘Kịt bo ke ini enịmme amaakem afo ayannọ miin uwa ndidia mmi, nte anemufịk enọ annemme miin esịd.’ <verse eid="NUM 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 28:3" />Bo ammọ: ‘Enọ uwa a-ndufo enieghe adinọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ado ami: ñyịn edọñ iba e-edooho isua keed i-imiinieghe ndo, nte ufọfọb uwa ini ke ini ke usen ke usen. <verse eid="NUM 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 28:4" />Iwa ñyịn edọñ keed ke ubakusen inyʌñ iwa anye ako ke ndubiayio, <verse eid="NUM 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 28:5" />a-asañake keed ye uwa abakpa a-adooho mbaak duob ke udomoñkpọ efa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">28:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ñkpọ nte kilokram 1.6; se ñko ke Nọmba 28:13, 21 ye 29</char></note> nte ndomuyo e-ewuahake ye ke mbakka inaañ hin<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">28:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ñkpọ nte lita keed; se ñko ke Nọmba 28:7 ye 14</char></note> a-atooho adan e-enyịmmeke eto ọlif. <verse eid="NUM 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 28:6" />Ami ado ufọfọb uwa e-enịmme ke ini ke ini e-eketọọñọke ke Abod Sainai nte inemufịk, uwa ndidia e-enọọhọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="NUM 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 28:7" />Unwọnwọñ ukọd uwa a-akeeneke ana ado mbakka ndañ ukọd keed ke itie inaañ ke udomoñkpọ hin a-asañake ye ñyịn edọñ keedekeed. Nwañña unwọnwọñ ukọd uwa ado duọk nọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ke adisana itie. <verse eid="NUM 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 28:8" />Wa ayọhọ ñyịn edọñ iba ke ndubiayio, nọ asaña ye ukem uwa abakpa ye unwọnwọñ uwa a-afo akewaaha ubakusen. Anyem ado uwa ndidia, inemufịk a-anemme <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> esịd.’ ”<verse eid="NUM 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mme Uwa Sabad</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 28:9" />“ ‘Ke usen Sabad, nam enọ ñyịn edọñ iba e-edooho isua keed i-imiinieghe ndo, yak asaña keed ye unwọnwọñ uwa ye uwa abakpa a-adooho mbaak iba ke itie duob ke udomoñkpọ efa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">28:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ñkpọ nte kilokram 3.2; se ñko ke Nọmba 28:12, 20 ye 28</char></note> a-adomoke ndomuyo e-ewuahake ye adan ọlif. <verse eid="NUM 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 28:10" />Ami ado ufọfọb uwa ke afịd Sabad, asañake ye ufọfọb uwa ye unwọnwọñ uwa.’ ”<verse eid="NUM 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Afiọñ ke Afiọñ Enọ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 28:11" />“ ‘Ke akpa usen ke afịd afiọñ, iben ñyaaraenañ iba ye akukịmedọñ keed ye ñyịn akukịmedọñ itiaba e-edoññoke isua keedekeed e-enyʌññọ enana ndo, isọk <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> nte ufọfọb uwa. <verse eid="NUM 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 28:12" />Ana kwa ayaaraenañ enọ abakpa a-adooho mbaak ita ke itie duob ke udomoñkpọ efa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">28:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ñkpọ nte kilokram 5; se ñko ke Nọmba 28:20 ye 28</char></note> eti ndomuyo e-ewuaha ye adan; se idiisaña ye akukịmedọñ, enọ abakpa a-adooho mbaak iba ke udomoñkpọ efa ye eti ndomuyo a-awuahake ye adan; <verse eid="NUM 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 28:13" />ñko ñyịn edọñ keedekeed, enọ mfịd a-adooho mbaak duob ke udomoñkpọ efa ewuahake ye adan. Ami ado ake ufọfọb uwa, anemme ufịk, enọ ndidia e-enọọhọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="NUM 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 28:14" />Se isaña ye ayaaraenañ keedekeed ana ado uwa mmịn a-adooho ukọd ke mbakka iba udomo hin;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">28:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ñkpọ nte lita 1.9</char></note> mbakka udomo hin<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">28:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ñkpọ nte lita 1.3</char></note> ayọhọ ita asaña ye akukịmedọñ; udomo mbakka hin keed ke itie inaañ ñko asaña ye ñyịn edọñ keedekeed. Ami ado uwa a-anaaha enam kwa afiọñ ke ufa afiọñ amaawuọ ke isua. <verse eid="NUM 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 28:15" />Ke esioho ufọfọb uwa e-enamma afịd ini ye uwa ukọd efep, ana enọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akpoebod keed nte uwa idiọọkñkpọ.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">28:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Akeme ido uwa enọ adinam asana; se ñko ke Nọmba 28:22</char></note><verse eid="NUM 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nsaña Mboiyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 28:16" />“ ‘Ke usen afiọñ duob mme inaañ ke akpa afiọñ ana enịm Usọrọ Nsaña Mboiyo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="NUM 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 28:17" />Ke ayọhọ usen duob mme ition ke afiọñ ami, ana ekamba usọrọ aba; ana eta uyo se yiis imiisịneke ke afịd usen itiaba. <verse eid="NUM 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 28:18" />Ke akpa usen, inịm adisana esob ikiinyʌñ inam utom ndomokeed. <verse eid="NUM 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 28:19" />Enọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> uwa ndidia a-adọñọke ufọfọb uwa, ñyaaraenañ iba, akukịmedọñ keed ye ñyaara ñyịn edọñ itiaba e-edoññoke isua keed, afịd inaaha anie ndo. <verse eid="NUM 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 28:20" />Kwa ayaaraenañ keed ana enọ mfịd a-adooho itie ita ke mbakka duob ke udomoñkpọ efa eti ndomuyo a-awuahake ye adan; ye akukịmedọñ iba ke mbaak duob; <verse eid="NUM 28:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 28:21" />ñko kwa ayịnedọñ itiaba keed, keed ke mbaak duob. <verse eid="NUM 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 28:22" />Idian akpoebod keed nte uwa idiọọkñkpọ nọ enam ñkpeubọk inọ ndufo. <verse eid="NUM 28:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 28:23" />Inọ ami idian ye ufọfọb uwa eseeghe enam ubakusen. <verse eid="NUM 28:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 28:24" />Ke utọ usʌñ ami ke ediiwa uwa ndidia usen ke usen itiaba nte anemufịk uwa enọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>; ana ewa anye edian ye ufọfọb uwa ye unwọnwọñ uwa esinamma. <verse eid="NUM 28:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 28:25" />Ke ayọhọ usen itiaba inịm adisana esob ikiinyʌñ inam utom ndomokeed.’ ”<verse eid="NUM 28:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Usọrọ Mme Udua</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 28:26" />“ ‘Ke usen mme akpa mfịd, ke ini ndufo enọọhọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> enọ ufa ñkpasi ke ini enamma Usọrọ Mme Udua, inịm adisana esob ndin ikiinam utom ndomokeed. <verse eid="NUM 28:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 28:27" />Inọ ufọfọb uwa ñyaara enañ iba, akukịmedọñ keed ye ñyịn edọñ itiaba nte anemufịk inọọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="NUM 28:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 28:28" />Kwa ayaaraenañ ana asaña ye uwa ñkpasi a-adooho ita ke mbakka duob ke efa eti ndomuyo ewuahake ye adan; ñko ye akukịmedọñ iba ke mbakka duob; <verse eid="NUM 28:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 28:29" />ñko ye nditọ edọñ keedekeed, keed ke mbaak duob. <verse eid="NUM 28:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 28:30" />Idian akpoebod keed yak enam ñkpeubọk inọ ndufo. <verse eid="NUM 28:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 28:31" />Ana ndufo enọ ami ye adinwọñ uwa ammọ edian ke ufọfọb uwa ye uwa ñkpasi. Ikịt ibo ke mme unam ado inieghe ndo.<verse eid="NUM 28:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="NUM 29" />
  <para style="s1">Usọrọ Mme Adukpoñ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 29:1" />“ ‘Ke akpa usen ke ayọhọ afiọñ itiaba, inịm adisana esob ñko ikiinam utom ndomokeed se esidak enam. Usen ami ado usen a-anaaha ndufo efịt adukpoñ. <verse eid="NUM 29:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 29:2" />Nte anemufịk ñkpọ ake <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akoppo inem, inọ ufọfọb uwa ñyịn ayaaraenañ keed, akukịmedọñ keed ye ñyaara ñyịn edọñ itiaba e-edooho isua keed, afịd ammọ inaaha enie ndo. <verse eid="NUM 29:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 29:3" />Yak ayaaraenañ asaña ye uwa ñkpasi a-adooho mbakka ita ke udomoñkpọ efa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">29:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ñkpọ nte kilokram 5; se ñko ke Nọmba 29:9 ye 14</char></note> ataa eti ndomuyo ewuahake ye adan ọlif; ye akukịmedọñ ado, mbakka iba ke itie duob;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">29:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ñkpọ nte kilokram 3.2; se ñko ke Nọmba 29:9 ye 14</char></note> <verse eid="NUM 29:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 29:4" />ñko kwa ñyịn edọñ keed ke atu itiaba ado, keed ke mbakka duob.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">29:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ñkpọ nte kilokram 1.6; se ñko ke Nọmba 29:10 ye 15</char></note> <verse eid="NUM 29:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 29:5" />Dian akpoebod keed nte uwa idiọọkñkpọ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">29:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Akeme ido uwa enọ adinam asana; se ñko ke itie mfen ke iwuod ñwed ami</char></note> nọ enam ñkpeubọk inọ ndufo. <verse eid="NUM 29:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 29:6" />Mbon ami edo se idiana ke mme ufọfọb uwa e-enamma afiọñ ke afiọñ ye usen ke usen ye mme uwa ñkpasi ammọ ye unwọnwọñ uwa kpa naña ekenịm. Ammọ edoñño uwa ndidia e-enọọhọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, nte anemufịk ñkpọ.<verse eid="NUM 29:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Usen Ñkpeubọk</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 29:7" />“ ‘Ke ayọhọ usen duob ke ayọhọ afiọñ itiaba inịm adisana esob. Ana ndufo enam utre udia <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">29:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Akeme ido ana etie utreudia</char></note> ikiinyʌñ inam utom. <verse eid="NUM 29:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 29:8" />Inọ ufọfọb uwa ñyịn ayaaraenañ keed, akukịmedọñ keed ye ñyaara nditọ edọñ itiaba e-edooho isua keed i-imiinieghe ndo, nte anemufịk uwa a-anemme <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> esịd. <verse eid="NUM 29:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 29:9" />Idian ye ayaaraenañ ado, uwa ñkpasi a-adotto, mbakka ita ke itie duob ke udomoñkpọ efa ye ataa eti ndomuyo ewuaha ye adan ọlif, ye akukịmedọñ ado, mbakka iba ke itie duob; <verse eid="NUM 29:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 29:10" />ñko kwa keed ke atu ñyịn edọñ itiaba ado ana anie mbakka keed ke itie duob. <verse eid="NUM 29:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 29:11" />Ñko akpoebod keed ana adiana nte uwa idiọọkñkpọ, dian ke uwa ñkpeubọk idiọọkñkpọ ye ufọfọb uwa asañake ye uwa ñkpasi amọ, ye mme unwọnwọñ uwa ammọ.<verse eid="NUM 29:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Usọrọ Mme Tabanakịd</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 29:12" />“ ‘Ke ayọhọ usen duob mme ition ke ayọhọ afiọñ itiaba, inịm adisana esob ñko ikiinam utom ndomokeed se esinam. Idia usọrọ inọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ke usen itiaba. <verse eid="NUM 29:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 29:13" />Iben anemufịk uwa ndidia a-adọñọke ufọfọb uwa ñyaaraenañ duob mme ita i-imiisọññọ, akukịmedọñ iba ye ñyịn edọñ duob mme inaañ e-edoññoke isua keed inyʌññọ inie ndo idi ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="NUM 29:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 29:14" />Kwa ayaaraenañ duob mme ita ado nọ uwa ñkpasi a-ayọhọke itie ita ke mbakka duob ke udomoñkpọ efa ataa eti ndomuyo ewuahake ye adan; kwa akukịmedọñ iba ado, mbakka iba ke itie duob; <verse eid="NUM 29:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 29:15" />ñko kwa ñyịn edọñ duob mme inaañ ado, mbakka keed ke itie duob. <verse eid="NUM 29:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 29:16" />Idian akpoebod keed nte uwa idiọọkñkpọ, yak adiana ye ufọfọb uwa ye uwa ñkpasi ye adinwọñ uwa amọ.<verse eid="NUM 29:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 29:17" />“ ‘Ke ayọhọ usen iba, inọ ñyịn ñyaaraenañ duob mme iba, akukịmedọñ iba ye ñyịn akukịmedọñ duob mme inaañ e-edoññoke isua keed ndomokeed, inieghe ndo. <verse eid="NUM 29:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 29:18" />Ye mme ñyaaraenañ, mme akukịmedọñ ye ñyịn edọñ, inọ uwa ñkpasi ye unwọnwọñ uwa ammọ akeene ibad naña asido. <verse eid="NUM 29:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 29:19" />Idian akpoebod keed nte uwa idiọọkñkpọ, adiana ye ufọfọb uwa ye uwa ñkpasi ye mme unwọnwọñ uwa ammọ.’ ”<verse eid="NUM 29:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 29:20" />“ ‘Ke ayọhọ usen ita inọ ñyaaraenañ duob mme keed, akukịmedọñ iba ye ñyaara ñyịn edọñ duob mme inaañ e-edoññoke isua keedekeed inyʌññọ inie ndo. <verse eid="NUM 29:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 29:21" />Ñko ye ñyaaraenañ ado, ye akukịmedọñ ye ñyịn edọñ, inọ uwa ñkpasi ye unwọnwọñ uwa akeene ibad se ekenịm <verse eid="NUM 29:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 29:22" />Idian akpoebod keed nte uwa idiọọkñkpọ, nọ adiana ye ufọfọb uwa ye uwa ñkpasi ye unwọnwọñ uwa.<verse eid="NUM 29:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 29:23" />“ ‘Ke ayọhọ usen inaañ iwa ñyaaraenañ duob, akukịmedọñ iba ye ñyaara ñyịn edọñ duob mme inaañ e-edoññoke isua keedekeed, afịd inaaha enie ndo. <verse eid="NUM 29:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 29:24" />Se idiisaña ye ayaaraenañ, akukịmedọñ ye ñyịn akukịmedọñ ado ediido uwa ñkpasi ye unwọnwọñ uwa akeene ibad amọ. <verse eid="NUM 29:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 29:25" />Idian akpoebod keed nte uwa idiọọkñkpọ, yak adiana ye ufọfọb uwa ye uwa ñkpasi ye unwọnwọñ uwa amọ.<verse eid="NUM 29:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 29:26" />“ ‘Ke ayọhọ usen ition, wa ñyaaraenañ usʌkkeed, akukịmedọñ iba ye ñyaara ñyịn edọñ duob mme inaañ e-edoññoke isua keedekeed, afịd inaaha anie ndo. <verse eid="NUM 29:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 29:27" />Ye mme ñyaaraenañ ado, mme akukịmedọñ ye ñyịn edọñ, inọ uwa ñkpasi ammọ ye unwọnwọñ uwa akeene ibad se enịm. <verse eid="NUM 29:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 29:28" />Idian akpoebod keed nte uwa idiọọkñkpọ, yak adiana ye ufọfọb uwa ye uwa ñkpasi ye ufọfọb uwa amọ.<verse eid="NUM 29:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 29:29" />“ ‘Ke ayọhọ usen itiokeed iwa ñyaaraenañ itiaita, akukịmedọñ iba ye ñyaara ñyịn edọñ duob mme inaañ e-edoññoke isua keedekeed, inyʌññọ inie ndo. <verse eid="NUM 29:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 29:30" />Ye mme ñyaaraenañ ado, mme akukịmedọñ ye ñyịn edọñ, inọ uwa ñkpasi ye unwọnwọñ uwa akeene ibad se ekebiere. <verse eid="NUM 29:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 29:31" />Idian akpoebod keed nte uwa idiọọkñkpọ, yak adiana ye ufọfọb uwa ye uwa ñkpasi ye unwọnwọñ uwa amọ.’ ”<verse eid="NUM 29:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 29:32" />“ ‘Ke ayọhọ usen itiaba iwa ñyaaraenañ itiaba, akukịmedọñ iba ye ñyaara ñyịn edọñ duob mme inaañ e-edoññoke isua keedekeed, inyʌññọ inie ndo. <verse eid="NUM 29:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 29:33" />Ye mme ñyaaraenañ ado, mme akukịmedọñ ye mme ñyaara ñyịn edọñ, inọ uwa ñkpasi ye unwọnwọñ uwa akeene ibad se ekebiere. <verse eid="NUM 29:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 29:34" />Idian akpoebod keed nte uwa idiọọkñkpọ, adiana ye ufọfọb uwa ye uwa ñkpasi ye unwọnwọñ uwa amọ.’ ”<verse eid="NUM 29:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 29:35" />“ ‘Ke ayọhọ usen itiaita, inịm asaña-asaña esob usuana ndin ikiinam utom ndomokeed. <verse eid="NUM 29:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 29:36" />Iben uwa ndidia a-adọñọke ufọfọb uwa ayaaraenañ keed, akukịmedọñ keed ye ñyịn akukịmedọñ itiaba e-edooho isua keed ammiinieghe ndo nte anemufịk uwa enọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="NUM 29:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 29:37" />Ye ayaaraenañ ado, akukịmedọñ ye mme ñyịn akukịmedọñ, inọ uwa ñkpasi ye unwọnwọñ uwa akeene ibad se ekebiere. <verse eid="NUM 29:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 29:38" />Idian akpoebod keed nte uwa idiọọkñkpọ, yak adiana ye ufọfọb uwa ye uwa ñkpasi ye ufọfọb uwa amọ.<verse eid="NUM 29:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 29:39" />“ ‘Ke ebenne edian ye se ndufo ekekaaña ye enọ ima esịd ndufo, inọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> mme ñkpọ ami ke ini usọrọ ndufo amaakem: Adifọb uwa ndufo, adinwọñ uwa ye uwa ewuana.’ ”<verse eid="NUM 29:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 29:40" />Moses amaadọkkọ nditọ Isrel afịd se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> aketemme anye.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">29:40 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ke ikpañwed Hibru, ewet ufañ ami Nọmba 29:40 nte Nọmba 30:1.</char></note><verse eid="NUM 29:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="NUM 30" />
  <para style="s1">Akaaña</para>
  <para style="p">
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">30: </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Ke ikpañwed Hibru, ewet Nọmba 29:40 nte Nọmba 30:1-16 nte Nọmba 30:2-17.</char>
    </note> <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 30:1" />Akem Moses amaabo mme adaiwuod ke mme esiin Isrel: “Ami ado se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atemme: <verse eid="NUM 30:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 30:2" />Ke ini awo anamma akaaña anọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> me anwọñọ enwọñọ abo ke imisịm idem imọ ke idak unwọñọ, inaaha anye abiat akaaña amọ ado yak anye anam afịd se anye aketañ.”<verse eid="NUM 30:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 30:3" />“Ke ini abọikpa a-asʌkkọ adʌñ ke ufọk ete amọ anamma akaaña anọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> me a-anyịkke idem amọ adinam enwọñọ, <verse eid="NUM 30:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 30:4" />ndin ete amọ akop akaaña me enwọñọ ado ado isuaha inọ anye, ndin afịd akaaña ye enwọñọ a-anye akenamma ayaasọọñọ ida. <verse eid="NUM 30:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 30:5" />Ado adieke ete amọ asuaha anọ anye ke ini anye adikoppo abaña, akaaña me unwọñọ a-anye akenwọñọke anọ idem amọ idiisọọñọke ida; <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ayaafeen anọ anye sia ete amọ a-asua anọ anye.”<verse eid="NUM 30:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 30:6" />“Adieke anye adọọhọ ebe ke anye amaakenam akaaña me ke ñkpọkinua amọ amaaketañ ke imọ iminwọñọ inọ idem imọ <verse eid="NUM 30:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 30:7" />ndin ebe amọ akop abaña ado isuaha inọ anye, ndin akaaña me enwọñọ amọ ayaasọọñọ ada. <verse eid="NUM 30:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 30:8" />Ado ebe amọ akpekpan anye ke ini anye akoppo abaña, anye abiat akaaña a-anye akekaañake ye enwọñọ a-akewuọhọ anye ke inua a-anye akebenne abọp idem amọ, ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ayaafeen anọ anye.”<verse eid="NUM 30:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 30:9" />Akaaña me enwọñọ keed akeedodo se ebekpa me awonwaan amaakewuọ ndọ anamma ayaabọp anye.<verse eid="NUM 30:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 30:10" />Adieke awonwaan a-adʌññọ ye ebe amọ anamma akaaña me a-anyịkke idem amọ ke idak unwọñọ <verse eid="NUM 30:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 30:11" />ndin ebe amọ akop abaña ado ibooho anye ñkpọ ndomokeed inyʌññọ isua inọ anye, afịd unwọñọ me akaaña a-anye akenamma ayaasọọñọ ada. <verse eid="NUM 30:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 30:12" />Ado adieke ebe amọ asịññeke mme akaaña ado ke ini anye akoppo abaña ammọ, ndin akaaña ndomokeed me enwọñọ ndomokeed a-aketooho anye inua idiisọọñọke ida. Ebe amọ amaatañ asio, ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ayaadakka anọ anye. <verse eid="NUM 30:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 30:13" />Ebe amọ akeme adisọọñọ a-anyʌñ akeme adibiat akaaña ndomokeed me enwọñọ ndomokeed a-anye anamma adikañ idem nsio.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">30:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Akeme ido aditre udia</char></note> <verse eid="NUM 30:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 30:14" />Ado adieke ebe amọ imiibooho anye ñkpọ ndomokeed ibaña akaaña ado ke usen ke usen, awuọ anye a-asọọñọ afịd akaaña amọ ye mme enwọñọ a-abọppọ anye. Anye asọọñọ ke adikʌp inua ke ini anye akoppo mme ñkpọ ami. <verse eid="NUM 30:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 30:15" />Ndin, adieke anye atañña se anye amaakekookop asio, ana anye abọ utịb ukwaññkpọ anwaan.<verse eid="NUM 30:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 30:16" />Mme mbon ami ado mme ewʌhọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akenọọhọ Moses ke abaña ewuana awodeen ye anwaan amọ, ye ke abaña ete ye ayịn abọikpa amọ asʌkkọ adʌñ ye anye.<verse eid="NUM 30:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="NUM 31" />
  <para style="s1">Nditọ Isrel Esio Mbon Midian Usiene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 31:1" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Moses ate, <verse eid="NUM 31:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 31:2" />“Sio nditọ Midian usiene nọ nditọ Isrel. Ke ado amaaboiyo, eyauben fiin ekedian ye aduuk mfo.”<verse eid="NUM 31:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 31:3" />Ke ntoro Moses amaabo mbon awo, “Yak usʌk ideen ke atu ndufo ebọbọ mbọbọekọñ eka ekọñ ye mbon Midian nọ ato do ammọ ekesio usiene <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ke idem mbon Midian. <verse eid="NUM 31:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 31:4" />Ndufo esio awo tọsịn keed eto esiin Isrel keedekeed.” <verse eid="NUM 31:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 31:5" />Ndin ideen tọsịn duob mme iba ekebọbọ mbọbọekọñ, tọsịn keed ke esiin Isrel keedekeed, ke ekesio enọ mme aduuk Isrel. <verse eid="NUM 31:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 31:6" />Moses amaadọñ awo tọsịn keedekeed ke afịd esiin Isrel yak eka ekọñ, esaña ye Finehas ayịn Eliasa, a-akedooho aku, a-akebenne mme ñkpọ ke adisana itie ye adukpoñ se anam idiọọñọ.<verse eid="NUM 31:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 31:7" />Ammọ emaenwana ye mbon Midian, kpa naña <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> aketemme Moses, emaenyʌñ ewot afịd ideen. <verse eid="NUM 31:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 31:8" />Ke atu mbon se ikiduọ idʌk ubọk ammọ ekedo, Efi, Rekem, Sọọ, Họọ, ye Reba, mme ndidem Midian ition. Ammọ emaenyʌñ ewot Balaam ayịn Beo ke akañkañ. <verse eid="NUM 31:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 31:9" />Mbon Isrel emaemuum ibaan ye ntəkayịn enyʌñ ekoono afịd udịmenañ, udịmedọñ ye nti ñkpọ ke abio Midian enyọñ nte mbuodekọñ. <verse eid="NUM 31:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 31:10" />Ammọ emaefọp afịd idʌñ a-mbon Midian ekedʌñọke, ye afịd mme itie mbono ammọ. <verse eid="NUM 31:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 31:11" />Ammọ emaeben afịd mbuodekọñ ye ñkpọ mbịme, dian mme awo ye mme unam, <verse eid="NUM 31:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 31:12" />enyʌñ ekoono mbon se ammọ ekemuum, mme ñkpọ mbịme ye mbuodekọñ ado esọk Moses ye aku Eliasa ye mme eboho mbon Isrel ke itie nnaa ammọ ke unaisọñ Mọb, ke ñkpere Yọdan ke ukañ Yeriko.<verse eid="NUM 31:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 31:13" />Moses, Eliasa a-akedooho aku ye afịd mme adadusʌñ ke esob emaewuọ ekekịt ammọ ke edem itie nnaa. <verse eid="NUM 31:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 31:14" />Moses amaayat esịd ye mme adaiso ekọñ, mme adaiso ke tọsịn ye mme adaiwuod ke ikie, ekenyọññọ ekọñ edi.<verse eid="NUM 31:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 31:15" />Moses amaabịp ammọ, “Ndufo emeyaak nọ ibaan ammọ edu uwem?” <verse eid="NUM 31:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 31:16" />“Ammọ ekedo mbon ekekeeneke item Balaam enyʌñ enam nditọ Isrel inamma akpanikọ ye <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ke ini ñkpọntịppe Pio akenamma yak unọmọ ado asịm ikọd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="NUM 31:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 31:17" />Idahami iwoot afịd nditọ ideen. Inyʌñ iwot afịd awonwaan se imaina ye awodeen, <verse eid="NUM 31:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 31:18" />ado inịm inọ idem ndufo afịd awonwaan se imiinaaha akpa ye awodeen.”<verse eid="NUM 31:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 31:19" />Awo akeedodo a-awotto awo me atuuhọ awo se ewot ana aba ke anwa itie nnaa ke usen itiaba. Ke ayọhọ usen ita ye ayọhọ usen itiaba ana ndufo enam idem ndufo ye idem mme mbuodekọñ esana. <verse eid="NUM 31:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 31:20" />Nam afịd afọñidem ye afịd ñkpọ se enam ke ikpa, ided ebod me eto esana.<verse eid="NUM 31:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 31:21" />Ndin Eliasa a-adooho aku amaabo mbon ekọñ e-ekekaaha ekọñ, “Se ami ado se mbed <char style="nd">A-Abọọñ</char> akenọọhọ Moses ayem: <verse eid="NUM 31:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 31:22" />kold, silfa, brọns, ukwak, tian, ñked <verse eid="NUM 31:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 31:23" />ye ñkpọ ndomokeed mfen se ikpikan idʌk ikañ iwuọ ana esịn ke ikañ nọ anye asana. Ado ana enyʌñ enam asana ke adisana mmọọñ. Ado ñkpọ ndomokeed se imiimaaha ikañ ana esịn ke adisana mmọọñ ado. <verse eid="NUM 31:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 31:24" />Ke ayọhọ usen itiaba iyet afọñ ndufo ndin ndufo eyaesana. Ndin ndufo emekeme edidʌk ndi esịd itie nnaa.”<verse eid="NUM 31:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ubakka Mbịme Ekọñ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 31:25" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Moses ate, <verse eid="NUM 31:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 31:26" />“Afo ye Eliasa a-adooho aku ye adaiwuod ke ufọk ke mme abio ana ebat afịd mme awo ye unam se ekemʌm. <verse eid="NUM 31:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 31:27" />Bakka mme mbịme ekọñ ado ukem-ukem ke atu mbon ekọñ se ikikaa ekọñ ye mbon mfen se iba ke abio. <verse eid="NUM 31:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 31:28" />Ke atu mbon ekọñ e-ekewuọhọ eka ekọñ, sio mbaak nịm nọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, keed ke afịd itie ikie ition, me ado mbonawo, enañ, dọñki me edọñ. <verse eid="NUM 31:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 31:29" />Isio anye ke mbakka iba udeeme enọ ammọ inyʌñ iyaak inọ Eliasa a-adooho aku nte udeeme <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="NUM 31:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 31:30" />Ke atu keed ke mbakka iba ake nditọ Isrel, isat keed isio ke atu afịd itie aba mme duob, me ado mbonawo, enañ, dọñki, edọñ me mme unam mfen. Iben ammọ inọ mme Lifai, e-enieghe ubiọñ utom adise ñkpọ mbaña adinam tabanakịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> asana.” <verse eid="NUM 31:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 31:31" />Ndin Moses ye Eliasa a-adooho aku emaenam kpa naña <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> aketemme ammọ.<verse eid="NUM 31:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 31:32" />Mbuodekọñ se ikisʌhọ ke se mbon ekọñ ekeben akedo edọñ tọsịn ikie itiokeed mme ata mme duob mme ition (675,000), <verse eid="NUM 31:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 31:33" />enañ tọsịn ata mme duob mme iba (72,000) <verse eid="NUM 31:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 31:34" />dọñki tọsịn ata mme keed (61,000) <verse eid="NUM 31:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 31:35" />ye ibaan i-imiikinaaha ye awodeen akpa tọsịn edịb mme duob mme iba (32,000).<verse eid="NUM 31:35" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 31:36" />Keed ke mbakka iba ake mbon e-ekekeeneke enwana ekọñ akedo:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="NUM 31:36" />
  <para style="li1" vid="NUM 31:36">edọñ tọsịn ikie ita mme edịb mme duob mme itiaba mme ikie ition (337,500), <verse eid="NUM 31:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 31:37" />a-adooho udeeme ufene <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akedo ikie itiokeed mme ata mme duob mme ition (675);<verse eid="NUM 31:37" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 31:38" />enañ tọsịn edịb mme duob mme itiokeed (36,000), udeeme <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akedo ata mme duob mme iba (72);<verse eid="NUM 31:38" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 31:39" />dọñki tọsịn edịb mme duob mme ikie ition (30,500), udeeme <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akedo ata mme keed (61);<verse eid="NUM 31:39" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 31:40" />ke atu awo tọsịn duob mme itiokeed (16,000), udeeme <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akedo edịb mme duob mme iba (32).<verse eid="NUM 31:40" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 31:41" />Moses amaayaak udeeme ado anọ aku Eliasa nte udeeme <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> kpa naña <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akedọkkọ anye.<verse eid="NUM 31:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 31:42" />Mbakka iba a-akenaaha anọ nditọ Isrel, ake Moses akesioho anịm ke atu ake mbon e-ekenwanake ekọñ, <verse eid="NUM 31:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 31:43" />mbakka ake mbon abio, akedo edọñ tọsịn ikie ita mme edịb mme duob mme itiaba mme ikie ition (337,500) <verse eid="NUM 31:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 31:44" />enañ tọsịn edịb mme duob mme itiokeed (36,000), <verse eid="NUM 31:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 31:45" />dọñki tọsịn edịb mme duob mme ikie ition (30,500) <verse eid="NUM 31:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 31:46" />ye mme awo tọsịn duob mme itiokeed (16,000). <verse eid="NUM 31:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 31:47" />Ke atu keed ke mbakka iba ake nditọ Isrel, Moses amaasat keed ke atu afịd mme awo ye mme unam aba mme duob kpa naña <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> aketemme anye, ndin amaayaak anọ mme Lifai e-ekeseeghe ñkpọ ebaña ufọk <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.<verse eid="NUM 31:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 31:48" />Akem mme adaiso ekọñ e-ekeseeghe ñkpọ ebaña mme ikpeghe mbon ekọñ, mme andikara tọsịn ye mme andikara ikie emaekaa ebịne Moses <verse eid="NUM 31:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 31:49" />ekebo Moses, “Mme nditọufọk mfo e-ebat mbon ekọñ ke idak ñnyịn, ndin ndomokeed isoppo. <verse eid="NUM 31:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 31:50" />Ke ntoro, ñnyịn imiben isọk <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> nte enọ ñkpọ mmaidem kold ake afịd ñnyịn ikibọọhọ, mme ñkpọubọk, mme ñkpaha ubọk, mme ñkpannuun idiọọñọ, mme ñkpahautọñ ye mme ñkwaitọñ adinam ñkpeubọk nnọọ idem ñnyịn ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.”<verse eid="NUM 31:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="NUM 31:51" />Moses ye aku Eliasa emaebọ ammọ mme kold se ammọ ekenọọ ye afịd ñkpọ se enam ke ubọk a-ammọ ekebenne edi. <verse eid="NUM 31:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="NUM 31:52" />Afịd kold e-eketooho mme adaiso ekọñ tọsịn ye mme adaiso ekọñ ikie ake Moses ye Eliasa ekebọọhọ eyaak enọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akedo sekel tọsịn duob mme itiokeed mme ikie itiaba mme aba mme duob (16,750)<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">31:52 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ñkpọ nte kilokram 190</char></note> ke udob. <verse eid="NUM 31:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="NUM 31:53" />Mbon ekọñ keedekeed emaeben mbuodekọñ enọ idem. <verse eid="NUM 31:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="NUM 31:54" />Moses ye Eliasa a-adooho aku emaebọ kold eto mme adaiso ekọñ se ikara udịm ekọñ tọsịn ye se ikara udịm ekọñ ikie, ñko emaenyʌñ eben edi atayad mbono nditọ Isrel edinịm nte ñkpọ aditoiyo ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.<verse eid="NUM 31:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="NUM 32" />
  <para style="s1">Mme Ekpək Edem Inyañ Yọdan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 32:1" />Mme nditọ Rubịn ye nditọ Kad e-ekenieghe ataa uwak udịmenañ ye udịmedọñ, emaekịt ke isọñ Yasa ye Kilied emaefọn se ebọọk ufene. <verse eid="NUM 32:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 32:2" />Ke ntoro, mbon Kad ye mbon Rubịn emaedibịne Moses ye Eliasa aku ye mme adadusʌñ ke mme abio edibo, <verse eid="NUM 32:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 32:3" />“Atarọd, Dibon, Yasa, Nimra, Hesbọn, Eliele Sebam Nebo ye Bọọn, <verse eid="NUM 32:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 32:4" />kpa isọñ <char style="nd">A-Abọọñ</char> akesuuhọke ke iso nditọ Isrel, adot se ebọọk ufene, ndin nditọufọk mfo enie ufene.” <verse eid="NUM 32:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 32:5" />Ammọ emaenyʌñ ebo, “Adieke ñnyịn ikịtte mfọn ke iso mfo, yak eyaak isọñ ami enọ nditọufọk mfo nte inie. Kuunam ñnyịn ikaaña Yọdan.”<verse eid="NUM 32:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 32:6" />Moses amaabo nditọ Kad ye nditọ Rubịn, “Nte nditọ Isrel mbon ako eyaekaa ekọñ ke ini ndufo etieghe mmi? <verse eid="NUM 32:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 32:7" />Nsoo ido ntak yak ndufo eyem edibiat esịd nditọ Isrel mbaña ammọ adiboiyo ndʌk isọñ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akenọọhọ ammọ? <verse eid="NUM 32:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 32:8" />Se mme ete ndufo ekenam ado ami ke ini a-ami ñkesioho ammọ ke Kades Banie ndọñ mbo yak ekese ñkpọ ebaña isọñ. <verse eid="NUM 32:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 32:9" />Ke ammọ emaekedọọk ekesịm ke abedeñ Eskol enyʌñ eda ese isọñ ado, ammọ etịmede nditọ Isrel esịd adidʌk isọñ <char style="nd">A-Abọọñ</char> akenọọhọ ammọ. <verse eid="NUM 32:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 32:10" />Ndin esịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaayat usen ado ndin anye amaanwọñọ enwọñọ: <verse eid="NUM 32:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 32:11" />‘Sia ammọ iñkeeneke miin ke afịd esịd, ibaaha awo ammọ ndomokeed a-akeyọhọke isua edịb me akanna ado idaha ammọ ekewuọhọ ke Iyib se idiikịt isọñ a-ami ñkenwọñọke nnọ Ebraham, Aisik ye Yekọb. <verse eid="NUM 32:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 32:12" />Awo ndomokeed ke imiibọhọke Kaleb ayịn Yefune awo Kenis ye Yọsua ayịn Nọn, sia ammọ emaekeene <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ke afịd esịd.’ <verse eid="NUM 32:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 32:13" />Esịd amaanekke ayat <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> abaña nditọ Isrel, anye amaanyʌñ anam ammọ eyooñ ke anaan ke isua aba, tutu afịd emana mbon e-ekenamma idiọọkñkpọ ke iso amọ ekweeñe.”<verse eid="NUM 32:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 32:14" />“Ndin se ndufo mi, udịm mme anam idiọọkñkpọ e-edaaha ke itie mme eteete ndufo enyʌñ enam <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> anenekke ayat esịd ye nditọ Isrel. <verse eid="NUM 32:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 32:15" />Adieke ndufo ewọññọke ekpọñ edikeene anye, anye ayaamaana akpọñ afịd ibon ami ke anaan, ndin ndufo ediido ntak nsobo mbon ami.”<verse eid="NUM 32:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 32:16" />Ndin ammọ emaesaña ekpere anye ekebo, “Ñnyịn ikpaima adibọp mme aba mi inọ ufene ñnyịn ye abio mi inọ ibaan ye nditọ ñnyịn. <verse eid="NUM 32:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 32:17" />Ado ñnyịn iyaibọbọ mbọbọ ibeeñe idem ñnyịn inọ ekọñ inyʌñ iboiyo nditọ Isrel iso tutu ñnyịn iben ammọ idisịm itie ammọ. Ado idahami ibaan ye nditọ ñnyịn eyaedʌñ ke abio se inie ndibene nọ anie ukpeme ke ntak mbon se idʌñọ ke isọñ ami. <verse eid="NUM 32:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 32:18" />Ñnyịn idiitịmmeke inyọñ ufọk ñnyịn tutu nditọ Isrel keedekeed ebọ udeemeñkpọ ammọ. <verse eid="NUM 32:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 32:19" />Ñnyịn idiibọọhọ udeeme ñkpọ ndomokeed ye ammọ ke edem Yọdan ñkañ uko, sia udeemeñkpọ ñnyịn adi ibịne ñnyịn ke edem usakkautịn Yọdan.”<verse eid="NUM 32:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 32:20" />Ndin Moses amaabo ammọ, “Adieke ndufo ediinam ntom, adieke ndufo ebanake idem ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> enọọ ekọñ <verse eid="NUM 32:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 32:21" />ñko adieke afịd ndufo e-ebọbọke mbọbọekọñ ekaañake Yọdan ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> tutu anye aben mme asua amọ asio ke iso amọ, <verse eid="NUM 32:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 32:22" />ndin ke ini emaedat isọñ inọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, ndufo emekeme itịmme ñnyọñ enyʌñ ebọkkọ ke ubiọñutom ndufo ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ye ke Isrel. Ndin isọñ ami ayaado udeeme ndufo ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.<verse eid="NUM 32:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 32:23" />“Ado adieke ndufo etreke edinam ntom, ndufo eyaenam idiọọkñkpọ ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>; ana ndufo ediọọñọ ke idiọọkñkpọ ndufo ayaiyem ndufo akịt. <verse eid="NUM 32:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 32:24" />Ibọọp mme abio inọ ibaan ye nditọ ndufo, ye mme aba inọ udịmedọñ ndufo, ado inam se ndufo enwọñọ.”<verse eid="NUM 32:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 32:25" />Mme nditọ Kad ye nditọ Rubịn emaebo Moses, “Ñnyịn nditọufọk mfo iyainam kpa naña abọọñ ñnyịn atañ. <verse eid="NUM 32:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 32:26" />Nditọ ye ibaan ñnyịn, edọñ ñnyịn ye ufene eyaesʌhọ mi ke abio Kilied. <verse eid="NUM 32:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 32:27" />Ado nditọufọk mfo, afịd awo se ibọbọ mbọbọekọñ ibet ekọñ, eyaekaaña ekaa anwan ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, kpa naña abọọñ ñnyịn atañ.”<verse eid="NUM 32:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 32:28" />Ndin Moses amaanọ uyio abaña ammọ anọ Eliasa aku ye Yọsua ayịn Nọn ye mme adaiwuod ekpək ubon Isrel. <verse eid="NUM 32:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 32:29" />Moses amaabo ammọ, “Adieke nditọ Kad ye nditọ Rubịn, afịd ideen se ikibọbọ mbọbọ ibeeñe idem ekọñ, ekaañake Yọdan ye ndufo ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, ndin ke ini edatta isọñ enie ke iso mfo, ana afo anọ ammọ isọñ Kilied nte udeeme ammọ. <verse eid="NUM 32:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 32:30" />Ado adieke ammọ idiikamake ñkpọekọñ ikaaña ye ndufo, ana ammọ ebọ udeeme ammọ ye ndufo ke abio Kenan.”<verse eid="NUM 32:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 32:31" />Mme nditọ Kad ye nditọ Rubịn emaebọọrọ, “Nditọufọk mfo eyaenam se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ. <verse eid="NUM 32:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 32:32" />Ñnyịn iyaikaaña ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> idʌk Kenan ye mbọbọekọñ, ado inie a-ñnyịn idiibọ adiiba ke edem Yọdan umi.”<verse eid="NUM 32:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 32:33" />Ndin Moses amaanọ nditọ Kad, nditọ Rubịn ye keed ke mbakka iba esiin Manase ayịn Yosef abioubọọñ Sihọn adidem mbon Amọọ ye abioubọọñ Ọk adidem Basan, afịd isọñ ye mme abio ye ñkanñkʌk ammọ.<verse eid="NUM 32:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 32:34" />Nditọ Kad emaebọp Dibon, Atarọd, Arowa, <verse eid="NUM 32:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 32:35" />Atrọd Sofan, Yasa, Yokbeha, <verse eid="NUM 32:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 32:36" />Bed Nimra ye Bed Haran nte mme abio e-enieghe ndibene, enyʌñ ebọp mme aba enọ ufene ammọ. <verse eid="NUM 32:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 32:37" />Ndin nditọ Rubịn emaemaana ebọp Hesbọn Eliele ye Kiriataim, <verse eid="NUM 32:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 32:38" />kpa ye Nebo ye Baal Mọọn (emaekpuuño mme anyịñ ami) ye Sibma. Ammọ emaenọ mme abio a-ammọ ekebọppọ mme anyịñ.<verse eid="NUM 32:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 32:39" />Ubon Makia ayịn Manase emaekaiya Kilied, emaekan anye enyʌñ ebịn mbon Amọọ e-ekebaaha do esio. <verse eid="NUM 32:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 32:40" />Ke ntoro Moses amaayaak Kilied anọ nditọ Makia, ubon Manase, ndin ammọ edʌñọ do. <verse eid="NUM 32:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 32:41" />Yai, a-akedooho awo ubon Manase, amaabọ mme itie idʌñ ammọ anyʌñ akoot Hafọd Yai. <verse eid="NUM 32:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 32:42" />Ñko Noba amaabọ Kenad ye ñkanñkʌk amọ anyʌñ akoot anye adian anyịñ amọ.<verse eid="NUM 32:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="NUM 33" />
  <para style="s1">Mme Ikpeghe mme Ikpeghe ke Isañ Isrel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 33:1" />Ami edo mme ikpeghe ke isañ nditọ Isrel ke ini ammọ ekewuọhọ ke isọñ Iyib ke udịm ke udịm ke idak ukara Moses ye Erọn. <verse eid="NUM 33:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 33:2" />Ke uyio <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Moses amaawet mme ikpeghe ke isañ ammọ. Ami akedo isañ ammọ ke ikpeghe ke ikpeghe:<verse eid="NUM 33:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 33:3" />Nditọ Isrel eketọọñọ isañ ke Ramese ke ayọhọ usen duob mme ition ke akpa afiọñ, ke edem usen Usọrọ Nsaña Mboiyo amaakekweeñe. Ammọ emaenam isañ ewuọñọ ke udịm ke iso nditọ Iyib, <verse eid="NUM 33:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 33:4" />mbon Iyib e-ekesʌkkọ ebuuk afịd mme akpan ammọ, <char style="nd">A-Abọọñ</char> akewotto ke atu ammọ; sia <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabiom mme abasi ammọ ikpe.<verse eid="NUM 33:4" /></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 33:5" />Mme nditọ Isrel emaekpọñ Ramese ekena ke Sukọd.<verse eid="NUM 33:5" /></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 33:6" />Ammọ emaekpọñ Sukọd ekena ke Etam, ke mben akpautatan.<verse eid="NUM 33:6" /></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 33:7" />Ammọ emaekpọñ Etam, ewọññọ etịmme ekaa Pi Hahirọd, tutu ke usakkautịn Baal Sefọn, enyʌñ ekena ke ñkpere Mikdol.<verse eid="NUM 33:7" /></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 33:8" />Ammọ emaekpọñ Pi Hahirọd enyʌñ ekesaña eboiyo akpainyañ edʌk ke akpautatan, ndin ke ammọ emaekesaña ke Akpautatan Etam usen ita, ammọ emaenaa ke Mara.<verse eid="NUM 33:8" /></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 33:9" />Ammọ emaekpọñ Mara enyʌñ ekaa Elịm, a-akenieghe ube mmọọñ duob mme iba ye itak ayob ata mme duob, ndin ammọ emaebono do.<verse eid="NUM 33:9" /></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 33:10" />Ammọ emaekpọñ Elịm ekeba ke ñkpere Ndad-Ndad Akpainyañ.<verse eid="NUM 33:10" /></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 33:11" />Ammọ emaekpọñ Ndad-Ndad Akpainyañ ekena ke Akpautatan Sin.<verse eid="NUM 33:11" /></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 33:12" />Ammọ emaekpọñ Akpautatan Sin ekena ke Dofka.<verse eid="NUM 33:12" /></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 33:13" />Ammọ emaekpọñ Dofka ekena ke Alus.<verse eid="NUM 33:13" /></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 33:14" />Ammọ emaekpọñ Alus ekena ke Refidịm, a-mmọọñ imiikibaaha se mbon awo enwọñ.<verse eid="NUM 33:14" /></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 33:15" />Ammọ emaekpọñ Refidịm ekena ke Akpautatan Sainai.<verse eid="NUM 33:15" /></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 33:16" />Ammọ emaekpọñ Akpautatan Sainai ekena ke Kibrod Hatafa.<verse eid="NUM 33:16" /></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 33:17" />Ammọ emaekpọñ Kibrod Hatafa ekena ke Haserọd.<verse eid="NUM 33:17" /></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 33:18" />Ammọ emaekpọñ Haserọd ekena ke Ritma.<verse eid="NUM 33:18" /></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 33:19" />Ammọ emaedaaña ke Ritma ekena ke Rimọn Peres.<verse eid="NUM 33:19" /></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 33:20" />Ammọ emaedaaña ke Rimọn Peres ekena ke Libna.<verse eid="NUM 33:20" /></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 33:21" />Ammọ emaedaaña ke Libna ekena ke Risa.<verse eid="NUM 33:21" /></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 33:22" />Ammọ emaedaaña ke Risa ekena ke Kehedata.<verse eid="NUM 33:22" /></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 33:23" />Ammọ emaedaaña ke Kehedata ekena ke abod Sefa.<verse eid="NUM 33:23" /></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 33:24" />Ammọ emaedaaña ke abod Sefa ekena ke Harada.<verse eid="NUM 33:24" /></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 33:25" />Ammọ emaedaaña ke Harada ekenaa ke Makhedọd.<verse eid="NUM 33:25" /></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 33:26" />Ammọ emaedaaña ke Makhedọd ekenaa ke Tahad.<verse eid="NUM 33:26" /></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 33:27" />Ammọ emaedaaña ke Tahad ekena ke Tera.<verse eid="NUM 33:27" /></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 33:28" />Ammọ emaedaaña ke Tera ekena ke Mitka.<verse eid="NUM 33:28" /></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 33:29" />Ammọ emaedaaña ke Mitka enyʌñ ekena ke Hasmọna.<verse eid="NUM 33:29" /></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 33:30" />Ammọ emaedaaña ke Hasmọna ekena ke Moserọd.<verse eid="NUM 33:30" /></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 33:31" />Ammọ emaedaaña ke Moserọd ekena ke Bene Yaakan.<verse eid="NUM 33:31" /></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 33:32" />Ammọ emaedaaña ke Bene Yaakan ekena ke Họọ Hakịdkad.<verse eid="NUM 33:32" /></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 33:33" />Ammọ emaedaaña ke Họọ Hakịdkad ekena ke Yọtbata.<verse eid="NUM 33:33" /></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 33:34" />Ammọ emaedaaña ke Yọtbata ekena ke Abrona.<verse eid="NUM 33:34" /></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 33:35" />Ammọ emaedaaña ke Abrona ekena ke Esiọn Keba.<verse eid="NUM 33:35" /></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 33:36" />Ammọ emaedaaña ke Esiọn Keba ekena ke Kades, ke Akpautatan Sịn.<verse eid="NUM 33:36" /></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 33:37" />Ammọ emaedaaña ke Kades ekena ke Abod Họọ, ke adaña Edọm. <verse eid="NUM 33:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 33:38" />Ke uyio <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Erọn aku amaadọọk akaa ke Abod Họọ, itie a-anye akekpaaha ke akpa usen afiọñ ke ayọhọ afiọñ ition ke ayọhọ isua aba tọọñọ ke isua nditọ Isrel ekewuọñọke ke Iyib. <verse eid="NUM 33:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 33:39" />Erọn akedo isua ikie mme edịb mme ita ke ini anye akekpaaha ke abod Họọ.<verse eid="NUM 33:39" /></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 33:40" />Adidem nditọ Kenan ake Arad, a-akedʌññọ ke Nekef ke Kenan, amaakop ke nditọ Isrel esʌk edi.<verse eid="NUM 33:40" /></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 33:41" />Ammọ emaedaaña ke Abod Họọ ekena ke Salmọna.<verse eid="NUM 33:41" /></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 33:42" />Ammọ emaedaaña ke Salmọna ekena ke Punọn.<verse eid="NUM 33:42" /></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 33:43" />Ammọ emaedaaña ke Punọn ekena ke Obod.<verse eid="NUM 33:43" /></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 33:44" />Ammọ emaedaaña ke Obod ekena ke Iye Abarim, ke adaña Mọb.<verse eid="NUM 33:44" /></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 33:45" />Ammọ emaedaaña ke Iye Abarim ekena ke Dibon Kad.<verse eid="NUM 33:45" /></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 33:46" />Ammọ emaedaaña ke Dibon Kad ekena ke Almọn Diblataim.<verse eid="NUM 33:46" /></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 33:47" />Ammọ emaedaaña ke Almọn Diblataim ekena ke abod Abarim, ke ñkpere Nebo.<verse eid="NUM 33:47" /></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 33:48" />Ammọ emaedaaña ke abod Abarim ekena ke unaisọñ Mọb ke mben Yọdan ke edem Yeriko. <verse eid="NUM 33:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 33:49" />Do ke unaisọñ Mọb ammọ enaa ke utịd ñkañ Yọdan tọọñọ ke Bed Yesimod tutu Ebeel Sitịm.<verse eid="NUM 33:49" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 33:50" />Ke unaisọñ Mọb ke mben Yọdan ke ekaañake Yeriko <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Moses, <verse eid="NUM 33:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="NUM 33:51" />“Tañ nọ nditọ Isrel nyʌñ bo ammọ: ‘Ndufo imaikaaña Yọdan idʌk Kenan, <verse eid="NUM 33:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="NUM 33:52" />ibịne afịd mbon se idʌñọ ke isọñ ado i-idaaha ndufo ke iso isịññe. Ibiat afịd mbid ukakab ñkpọ ammọ ye mme ubobod abasi ammọ, inyʌñ isuan afịd mme ñkoñ-ñkoñ itie ammọ. <verse eid="NUM 33:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="NUM 33:53" />Ndufo iben isọñ inie inyʌñ idʌñ ke esịd, sia ami mminọ ndufo isọñ mbo yak enie. <verse eid="NUM 33:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="NUM 33:54" />Ideeme isọñ ado ke usịn afia, akeene naña ubon ndufo ado. Se ido ekamba ubon, nọ ekamba udeemeñkpọ; ñko se ido etək-etək ubon, nọ etək-etək udeemeñkpọ. Ñkpọ ndomokeed se iduọ inọ awo ke usịn afia adiido ake ammọ. Ideeme anye ikeene aduuk esed ndufo.<verse eid="NUM 33:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="NUM 33:55" />“ ‘Ado adieke ndufo imiibịneke mbon se ikidʌñ ke isọñ ado isio, mbon se ndufo eyak nọ eba eyaekappa edo ñkukịm ke anyen ndufo ye akpab ke ñkañ ndufo. Ammọ eyainọ ndufo mfịna ke isọñ a-ndufo ediidʌñ. <verse eid="NUM 33:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="NUM 33:56" />Ndin ami ñyainam ndufo se ami nduak adinam ammọ.’ ”<verse eid="NUM 33:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="NUM 34" />
  <para style="s1">Mme Adaña Kenan</para>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 34:1" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Moses ate, <verse eid="NUM 34:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 34:2" />“Wuuk nditọ Isrel nyʌñ bo ammọ: ‘Ndufo imaidʌk Kenan, isọñ se ediideeme inọ ndufo nte udeemeñkpọ ndufo ana anie mme adaña ami.’ ”<verse eid="NUM 34:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 34:3" />“ ‘Usuuk-usuuk efaak ndufo ayaasịne usʌk Akpautatan Sịn ke adaña Edọm. Adaña ndufo ke edem usuuk adiitọọñọ ke usakkautịn tọọñọ ke akpatre edem Ñkpaikpa Akpainyañ, <verse eid="NUM 34:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 34:4" />kaaña edem usuuk-usuuk ukan Usʌñ Ikpeyen, sʌk kaa tutu akewuọ ukan Sịn nyʌñ kaa edem usuuk-usuuk ukañ Kades Banie. Ndin ayaakaa ukañ Hasa Adaa anyʌñ akaaña akewuọ Asmọn, <verse eid="NUM 34:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 34:5" />ke Asmọn anye ayaawọññọ, adiana ye Wadi ake Iyib anyʌñ aketre ke Akpainyañ Mediterenia.’ ”<verse eid="NUM 34:5" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 34:6" />Adaña ndufo ke usobutịn adiido usuuk Akpainyañ Mediterenia. Ami adiido adaña ndufo ke ñkañ usobutịn.<verse eid="NUM 34:6" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 34:7" />Ke adaña edem adoro ndufo, dʌt udịm tọọñọ ke Akpainyañ Mediterenia tutu ke Abod Họọ <verse eid="NUM 34:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 34:8" />ndin tọọñọ ke abod Họọ tutu Debo Hamad. Ndin adaña ado ayaakewuọ Sedad, <verse eid="NUM 34:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 34:9" />akaiso akaa Sifrọn anyʌñ aketre ke Hasa Enan. Adaña ndufo adiido ado ke edem adoro.<verse eid="NUM 34:9" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 34:10" />Ke adaña ndufo ke usakkautịn, dʌt udịm tọọñọ ke Hasa Enan tutu Sefam. <verse eid="NUM 34:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 34:11" />Adaña ado ayaasọiyọ atọọñọ ke Sefam tutu akewuọ Ribla ke edem usakkautịn Ain anyʌñ akaa iso tutu ke mbeñ usuuk usakkautịn Akpainyañ Kalili.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">34:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ke Hibru ado Kinered</char></note> <verse eid="NUM 34:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 34:12" />Ndin adaña ado ayaasọiyọ akaa usuuk ukañ Yọdan aketre ke Ñkpaikpa Akpainyañ.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="NUM 34:12" />
  <para style="li4" vid="NUM 34:12">“ ‘Ami adiido isọñ ndufo, ye adaña amọ akanna afịd mbeñ akʌk.’ ”<verse eid="NUM 34:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 34:13" />Moses amaanọ nditọ Isrel uyio: “Ideeme isọñ ami ke adisịn afia nte udeemeñkpọ. <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> anọ uyio ate eben anye enọññọ ubon usʌkkeed ye ibio, <verse eid="NUM 34:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 34:14" />sia adooho mme ekpək ubon Rubịn, ubon Kad ye mbaak ubon Manase emaebọ udeemeñkpọ ammọ. <verse eid="NUM 34:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 34:15" />Mme ubon iba ye ibio ami emaebọ udeemeñkpọ ammọ ke edem usakkautịn Yọdan ke ekaañake Yeriko, a-aseeghe ukañ usakkautịn.”<verse eid="NUM 34:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 34:16" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Moses ate, <verse eid="NUM 34:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 34:17" />“Mbon ami edo anyịñ mme ideen a-anaaha nte ebakka isọñ inọ ndufo nte udeemeñkpọ; Eliasa aku ye Yọsua ayịn Nọn. <verse eid="NUM 34:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 34:18" />Nyʌñ sio adadusʌñ keed ke ubon keedekeed yak enwam ke adideeme isọñ ado.”<verse eid="NUM 34:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 34:19" />“Mme anyịñ ammọ edoñño ami:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="NUM 34:19" />
  <para style="li1" vid="NUM 34:19">“se ito ubon Yuda, Kaleb ayịn Yefune;<verse eid="NUM 34:19" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 34:20" />se ito ubon Simiọn, Semuel ayịn Amihud;<verse eid="NUM 34:20" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 34:21" />se ito ubon Benyamin, Elidad ayịn Kislọn;<verse eid="NUM 34:21" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 34:22" />se ito ubon Daan, adadusʌñ akedo Bukki ayịn Yokli;<verse eid="NUM 34:22" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 34:23" />se ito ubon Manase ayịn Yosef, adadusʌñ akedo Haniel ayịn Efọd;<verse eid="NUM 34:23" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 34:24" />se ito ubon Ifrem ayịn Yosef, adadusʌñ akedo Kemuel ayịn Siftan;<verse eid="NUM 34:24" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 34:25" />se ito ubon Sebulọn, adadusʌñ akedo Elisafan ayịn Panak;<verse eid="NUM 34:25" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 34:26" />se ito ubon Isaka, adadusʌñ akedo Paltiel ayịn Asan;<verse eid="NUM 34:26" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 34:27" />se ito ubon Asaa, adadusʌñ akedo Ahihud ayịn Selomi;<verse eid="NUM 34:27" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 34:28" />se ito ubon Naftali, adadusʌñ akedo Pedahel ayịn Amihud.”<verse eid="NUM 34:28" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 34:29" />Mme mbon ami ekedo mbon <char style="nd">A-Abọọñ</char> akenọọhọ uyio ate edeeme Kenan enọ nditọ Isrel.<verse eid="NUM 34:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 34" />
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="NUM 35" />
  <para style="s1">Mme Abio A-anieghe Mme Lifai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 35:1" />Ke unaisọñ Mọb ke mben Yọdan e-eboiyoke eka Yeriko, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaanọ Moses uyio ate, <verse eid="NUM 35:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 35:2" />“Nọ nditọ Isrel ewʌhọ bo yak enọ mme Lifai abio se ammọ edʌñọ ke atu udeemeñkpọ a-nditọ Isrel ediinie. Ñko inọ ammọ isọñ se inie awawa mbid ke ñkanñkʌk abio. <verse eid="NUM 35:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 35:3" />Ndin ammọ eyaenie mme abio se edʌñọ ye mme inwañ mbid se enañ ye afịd mme unam mfen a-ammọ enieghe eta.”<verse eid="NUM 35:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 35:4" />“Mme isọñ mbid e-edaaha ekanna mme abio se ndufo enọọ mme Lifai eyaetara tọsịn kubid keed<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">35:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ñkpọ nte mita 300</char></note> tọọñọ ke ndibene idʌñ. <verse eid="NUM 35:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 35:5" />Ke ukañ edem abio, idomo tọsịn kubid iba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">35:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ñkpọ nte mita 600</char></note>, ke edem usakkautịn, tọsịn ita ke edem usuuk-usuuk, tọsịn ita ke edem usobutịn ye tọsịn ita ke ukañ anyọñ-anyọñ, ye abio ke ufọọd. Ammọ eyaenie afịd ukañ umi nte isọñ mbid ke mme abio.”<verse eid="NUM 35:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mme Abio Ubọkkọ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 35:6" />“Abio itiokeed ke atu abio a-ndufo ediinọ mme Lifai adiido abio ubọkkọ, ake awo a-awotto awo akemeke adifeghe ñkaa. Dian abio aba mme iba nte udian nọ ammọ. <verse eid="NUM 35:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 35:7" />Ke afịd, ndufo ediinọ mme Lifai abio aba mme itiaita, ye mme isọñ mbid ammọ. <verse eid="NUM 35:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 35:8" />Abio a-ndufo ediinọ mme Lifai ke atu isọñ se nditọ Isrel enieñe adiikeene udeemeñkpọ se ubon keedekeed enieñe: Bọ ubon se inie uwak abio uwak, ado mbon se inie etək nyʌñ bọ etək to ammọ.”<verse eid="NUM 35:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 35:9" />Ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Moses: <verse eid="NUM 35:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 35:10" />“Tañ nọ nditọ Isrel nyʌñ dọkkọ ammọ: ‘Ndufo emaekaaña Yọdan idʌk Kenan, <verse eid="NUM 35:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 35:11" />isat usʌk abio yak ado abio ubọkkọ ndufo, abio ake awo a-awotto awo ke ndudue akemeke ifeghe ñkaa. <verse eid="NUM 35:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 35:12" />Ammọ ediido itie ubọkkọ ke ubọk mme asiousiene, nọ ato do awo ndomokeed e-ebooho ke anye awot awo akuukpa mbemiso edaaha anye ke iso ikpe ke anwa mbono. <verse eid="NUM 35:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 35:13" />Mme idʌñ itiokeed a-ndufo ediinọ mi adiido abio ubọkkọ ndufo. <verse eid="NUM 35:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 35:14" />Nọ ita ke edem Yọdan ukañ umi, ita ñko ke Kenan nte mme abio ubọkkọ. <verse eid="NUM 35:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 35:15" />Mme abio itiokeed ami ediido itie ubọkkọ inọ nditọ Isrel ye mme adidʌñ e-edʌññọ ke atu ammọ, nọ ato do awo a-adueghe awot awo mfen afeghe akaa do akenie ubọkkọ.<verse eid="NUM 35:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 35:16" />“ ‘Awo ndomokeed akpeyʌppọ awo ke ñkpọ se ido ukwak ndin awo ado akpa, awo a-ayʌppọke awo do ado awodawo; ana ewot awodawo ado. <verse eid="NUM 35:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 35:17" />Me awo akpekama itiad amia awo awot, awo ado ado awodawo; ana ewot awodawo ado. <verse eid="NUM 35:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 35:18" />Me awo akpekama ñkpọ se enam ke eto amia awo awot, awo ado ado awodawo; ana ewot awodawo ado. <verse eid="NUM 35:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 35:19" />Asiousiene iyiib ayaawot awo ado; ke ini asio usiene ado adiighe abịne awodawo ado, asio usiene ayaawot awodawo ado. <verse eid="NUM 35:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 35:20" />Adieke awo anieghe usua abaña awo ndin akokoi anək awo me atop ñkpọ atọ awo ndin awo ado akpa <verse eid="NUM 35:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 35:21" />me ke ntak usua awo keed atuak awo mfen ke ita ndin ato do awo ado akpa, ana ewot awo ado; awo ado ado awodawo. Asiousiene iyiib ayaawot awodawo ado ke ammọ emaesoobo.<verse eid="NUM 35:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 35:22" />“ ‘Ado adieke awo anəkko emọ-emọ awo ke ndudue yak aduọ ke ini utọk imiikibaaha me aditop ñkpọ ntọ awo ado ke anye imiifiọkọfiọk <verse eid="NUM 35:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 35:23" />me ke ntak a-anye imiikikịtte ammọ, ayaak itiad se idoppo ikeme adiwot ammọ atọ ammọ, ndin ammọ ekpa, ndin sia awo ado imiikidooho usua ikinyʌññọ ikere idiọọk, <verse eid="NUM 35:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 35:24" />mbono ana ekpe ikpe enọ anam ndudue ye asiousiene iyiib akeene mme mbed ami. <verse eid="NUM 35:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 35:25" />Ana esob akpeme anam ndudue asio ke ubọk asiousiene iyiib anyʌñ anam anye atịmme anyọñ abio ubọkkọ a-ammọ ekefegheke eka. Ana anam ndudue aba do tutu ekamba aku e-ekeyette adisana adan akpa.<verse eid="NUM 35:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 35:26" />“ ‘Ado adieke anam ndudue awuọhọ akpọñ utịd abio ubọkkọ a-anye akefegheke akaa <verse eid="NUM 35:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 35:27" />ndin asiousiene iyiib akịt anye ke awuọhọ akpọñ abio ubọkkọ, asiousiene iyiib akeme iwot anam ndudue ndin anye idueghe isob uwot awo. <verse eid="NUM 35:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 35:28" />Mme akañ idem ado ana eba ke abio ubọkkọ tutu ekamba aku akpa; ñkọ ekamba aku ado akpakpa ke ammọ ekeme aditịmme ñnyọñ ufọk ammọ.<verse eid="NUM 35:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 35:29" />“ ‘Ami ana ado nsọọñọ mbed inọ ndufo ye emana se idiidi ke itie akeedodo ake ndufo ediidʌñ.<verse eid="NUM 35:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 35:30" />“ ‘Awo ndomokeed a-awotto awo ana ewot anye ke mme ntiense ekpeba editañ ke imaikịt. Ado inaaha ewot awo ndomokeed ke ntiense keed ikpọọñ akpeba.<verse eid="NUM 35:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 35:31" />“ ‘Kuubọọ awo a-awotto awo ekọmudua ke ini anye adotto ñkpa. Ana ewot anye esio.<verse eid="NUM 35:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 35:32" />“ ‘Kuubọọ awo ndomokeed a-afegheke akaa abio ubọkkọ ekọmudua adiyak anye atịmme akedʌñ ke abio amọ ke ini ekamba aku imiikpaaha dion.<verse eid="NUM 35:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 35:33" />“ ‘Ndufo ikiibiat isọñ a-ndufo edʌññọ. Uduọk iyiib ababiat isọñ, ñko awo isinamma ñkpeubọk inọ isọñ e-eduọkkọ iyiib, ibọhọke ekama iyiib andikiduọk iyiib awo efeen. <verse eid="NUM 35:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 35:34" />Ikiisappa isọñ a-ndufo edʌññọ ke esịd a-ami ñko ndʌññọ ke esịd, sia ami, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, mmọdo ndʌñ ke atu nditọ Isrel.’ ”<verse eid="NUM 35:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 35" />
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="NUM 36" />
  <para style="s1">Udeemeñkpọ Nditọ Ibaan Selofehad</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 36:1" />Mme adaiwuod ekpək ke ubon Kilied ayịn Makia, ayịn Manase, e-eketooho ubon ye a-mme nditọ se ito Yosef, emaedi editañ ikọ ye Moses ye mme adadusʌñ, mme adaiwuod ke ekpək nditọ Isrel. <verse eid="NUM 36:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 36:2" />Ammọ emaebo, “Ke ini <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akenọọhọ abọọñ mmi uyio abo yak edeeme isọñ ke usịn afia enọ nditọ Isrel nte udeemeñkpọ, anye amaunọ fiin uyio abo yak ayaak udeemeñkpọ ayịneka ñnyịn awodeen Selofehad anọ nditọ amọ ibaan. <verse eid="NUM 36:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 36:3" />Adieke ammọ ekedọọhọ ideen ke mme esiin Isrel mfen; ndin eyaeben udeemeñkpọ ammọ esio ke udeemeñkpọ eteete ñnyịn ekedian ke udeemeñkpọ ubon se ammọ ekedọ ndọ. Ke ntoro, eyaibọ ubaak udeemeñkpọ e-ekinọọhọ ñnyịn. <verse eid="NUM 36:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 36:4" />Isua Yubili nditọ Isrel amaadi, eyaeben udeemeñkpọ a-ammọ edian enọ ubon se ammọ ekedọ ndọ, ndin eyaeben inie ammọ esio ekpọñ udeemeñkpọ eteete ñnyịn.”<verse eid="NUM 36:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 36:5" />Ndin ke uyio <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Moses amaanọ nditọ Isrel ewʌhọ ami: “Se mbon ubon Yosef etañ ado akpanikọ. <verse eid="NUM 36:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 36:6" />Ami ado se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ abaña nditọ ibaan Selofehad: Ammọ e-ekeme edidọ awo akeedodo ammọ emaaha, ado awo ado ana ato ubon ete ammọ. <verse eid="NUM 36:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 36:7" />Inaaha udeemeñkpọ ndomokeed ke Isrel awuọ akpọñ ubon keed akaa mfen, sia afịd nditọ Isrel ana enịm udeemeñkpọ ubon mme eteete ammọ. <verse eid="NUM 36:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 36:8" />Afịd nditọ ibaan e-ebọọhọ udeeme isọñ ke ubon nditọ Isrel ndomokeed ana edọ awo ke ubon ete ammọ, nọ ato do afịd nditọ Isrel enie udeemeñkpọ mme eteete ammọ. <verse eid="NUM 36:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 36:9" />Udeemeñkpọ ndomokeed inaaha awuọ akpọñ ubon keed akaa ubon mfen, sia afịd ubon Isrel ana enịm isọñ a-ammọ enieghe nte udeeme eto mme eteete ammọ.”<verse eid="NUM 36:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 36:10" />Nditọ ibaan Selofehad emaenam kpa naña <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> aketemme Moses. <verse eid="NUM 36:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 36:11" />Nditọ ibaan Selofehad, Mahla, Tisa, Hokla, Milka ye Nua emaedọ nditọ ete ammọ ke edem ete ammọ. <verse eid="NUM 36:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 36:12" />Ammọ emaedọ ke esịd ubon nditọ Manase ayịn Yosef, ndin udeemeñkpọ ammọ asʌk ababa ke ubon ete ammọ.<verse eid="NUM 36:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 36:13" />Mbon ami edo mme ewʌhọ ye mme item <char style="nd">A-Abọọñ</char> akenọọhọ ato Moses esọk nditọ Isrel ke unaisọñ Mọb ke mben Yọdan ke ekaañake Yeriko.<verse eid="NUM 36:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 36" />
</usx>